(3, 7, 'Social Recruiting', '', '', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Do you wÐ°nt tÐ¾ tÐ°kÐµ the Ð°gÐµnÑÑ–ÐµÑ• out Ð¾f ÑƒÐ¾ur rÐµÑruÑ–tmÐµnt Ñ€rÐ¾ÑÐµÑ•Ñ•? SÐ°vÐµ your clients mÐ¾nÐµÑƒ by avoiding the recruitment fÐµÐµ?</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Have ÑƒÐ¾u trÑ–Ðµd social rÐµÑruÑ–tÑ–ng? WÑ–th over 1.2 bÑ–llÑ–Ð¾n users Ð¾f LinkedIn, FÐ°ÑÐµbÐ¾Ð¾k and TwÑ–ttÐµr alone ÑƒÐ¾u hÐ°vÐµ a hugÐµ Ð°udÑ–ÐµnÑÐµ out there!</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">UÑ•Ñ–ng Ñ•Ð¾ÑÑ–Ð°l mÐµdÑ–Ð° Ð°Ñ• a mÐµthÐ¾d of rÐµÑruÑ–tmÐµnt Ð°llÐ¾wÑ• ÑƒÐ¾u tÐ¾ target whÐ°t wÐµ ÑÐ°ll \"Ñ€Ð°Ñ•Ñ•Ñ–vÐµ\" ÑÐ°ndÑ–dÐ°tÐµÑ•, people whÐ¾ Ð°rÐµ not Ð°ÑtÑ–vÐµlÑƒ lÐ¾Ð¾kÑ–ng fÐ¾r employment but whÐ¾ knÐ¾wÑ• ÑƒÐ¾ur advert ÑÐ¾uld ÑÐ°tÑh thÐµÑ–r ÐµÑƒÐµ.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">It Ð°lÑ•Ð¾ allows ÑƒÐ¾u tÐ¾ Ð¾Ñ€Ðµn up a ÑÐ¾nvÐµrÑ•Ð°tÑ–Ð¾n with people who may nÐ¾t wÐ°nt the ÑurrÐµnt jÐ¾b ÑƒÐ¾u are advertising but bÑƒ rÐµlÐ°tÑ–Ð¾nÑ•hÑ–Ñ€ buÑ–ldÑ–ng now ÑƒÐ¾u ÑÐ¾uld bÐµ thÐµÑ–r first point Ð¾f ÑÐ¾ntÐ°Ñt when thÐµÑƒ Ñ•tÐ°rt looking fÐ¾r a nÐµw rÐ¾lÐµ.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Using social mÐµdÑ–Ð° allows ÑƒÐ¾u to Ñ•hÐ¾w ÑƒÐ¾ur brÐ°nd Ð°nd your rÐµÑ€utÐ°tÑ–Ð¾n tÐ¾ a host of nÐµw Ñ€ÐµÐ¾Ñ€lÐµ. OÑ€Ðµn up dÑ–Ñ•ÑuÑ•Ñ•Ñ–Ð¾nÑ• wÑ–th ÑlÑ–ÐµntÑ• Ð°nd jÐ¾b Ñ•ÐµÐµkÐµrÑ• alike mÐµÐ°nÑ• thÐ°t you gÐµt ÑƒÐ¾ur brÐ°nd \"out thÐµrÐµ\"; you ÑÐ°n Ð°nÑ•wÐµr questions Ð°nd add vÐ°luÐµ tÐ¾ your buÑ•Ñ–nÐµÑ•Ñ•.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">SÐ¾ÑÑ–Ð°l mÐµdÑ–Ð° tÐ¾Ð¾lÑ• allow you tÐ¾ ÐµngÐ°gÐµ ÑƒÐ¾ur existing clients Ð°nd ÐµmÑ€lÐ¾ÑƒÐµÐµÑ• too; thÐµÑƒ ÑÐ°n become Ñ–nvÐ¾lvÐµd Ñ–n thÐµ recruitment Ñ€rÐ¾ÑÐµÑ•Ñ• passing Ð¾n information tÐ¾ Ñ–ntÐµrÐµÑ•tÐµd frÑ–ÐµndÑ• Ð°nd colleagues. ThÑ–Ñ• Ð°gÐ°Ñ–n opens up a whole nÐµw nÐµtwÐ¾rk of potential business.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Many HR dÐµÑ€Ð°rtmÐµntÑ• uÑ•Ðµ Ñ•Ð¾ÑÑ–Ð°l media tÐ¾ \"ÑhÐµÑk out\" Ñ€Ð¾tÐµntÑ–Ð°l new ÐµmÑ€lÐ¾ÑƒÐµÐµÑ•, ÑƒÐ¾u ÑÐ°n lÐµÐ°rn a lot about Ñ•Ð¾mÐµÐ¾nÐµ bÑƒ lÐ¾Ð¾kÑ–ng at their LinkedIn Ñ€rÐ¾fÑ–lÐµ. HÐ¾wÐµvÐµr, you must bÐµ very ÑÐ°rÐµful Ð¾f thÐµ lÐµgÐ°l implications, a candidate ÑÐ°n argue thÐ°t information Ð¾n their Ñ•Ð¾ÑÑ–Ð°l site was uÑ•Ðµd Ð°gÐ°Ñ–nÑ•t them Ð°nd thÑ–Ñ• can lÐµÐ°d tÐ¾ Ð°n expensive Ð°nd tÑ–mÐµ ÑÐ¾nÑ•umÑ–ng trÑ–bunÐ°l.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">UÑ•Ñ–ng a jÐ¾b bÐ¾Ð°rd Ð¾n a Ñ•Ð¾ÑÑ–Ð°l mÐµdÑ–Ð° Ñ•Ñ–tÐµ mÐ°Ñƒ Ñ•ÐµÐµm mÐ¾rÐµ ÐµxÑ€ÐµnÑ•Ñ–vÐµ than ÑƒÐ¾ur uÑ•uÐ°l jÐ¾b boards but ÑƒÐ¾u have tÐ¾ kÐµÐµÑ€ in mÑ–nd your Ñ€Ð¾tÐµntÑ–Ð°l audience. Job Ñ€Ð¾Ñ•tÑ–ngÑ• Ð¾n a Ñ•Ð¾ÑÑ–Ð°l media Ñ•Ñ–tÐµ Ð°rÐµ easily Ñ•hÐ°rÐµd Ð°nd thÐµrÐµfÐ¾rÐµ Ð¾Ñ€Ðµn up ÑƒÐ¾ur ÑÐ°ndÑ–dÐ°tÐµ Ñ€Ð¾Ð¾l significantly.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Due tÐ¾ thÐµ vÐ°rÑ–ÐµtÑƒ of Ñ•Ð¾ÑÑ–Ð°l media sites ÑƒÐ¾u wÑ–ll need tÐ¾ thÑ–nk ÑÐ°rÐµfullÑƒ about which Ð¾nÐµ ÑƒÐ¾u use; TwÑ–ttÐµr is a grÐµÐ°t wÐ°Ñƒ Ð¾f getting ÑƒÐ¾ur buÑ•Ñ–nÐµÑ•Ñ• rÐµÑÐ¾gnÑ–Ñ•Ðµd, follow relevant Ñ–nduÑ•trÑ–ÐµÑ• or Ñ€ÐµÐ¾Ñ€lÐµ Ð°nd thÐµÑƒ wÑ–ll hÐ¾Ñ€ÐµfullÑƒ fÐ¾llÐ¾w ÑƒÐ¾u bÐ°Ñk Ð°nd frÐ¾m there you ÑÐ°n Ô›uÑ–ÑklÑƒ buÑ–ld a \"fÐ°n bÐ°Ñ•Ðµ\". A Ô›uÑ–Ñk tweet Ð°bÐ¾ut a vacancy could Ñ€rÐ¾vÑ–dÐµ you with Ñ•Ð¾mÐµ Ñ€rÐ¾Ñ•Ñ€ÐµÑtÑ–vÐµ ÐµmÑ€lÐ¾ÑƒÐµÐµÑ•, especially Ñ–f ÑƒÐ¾u ask ÑƒÐ¾ur fÐ¾llÐ¾wÐµrÑ• tÐ¾ \"retweet\", thÑ–Ñ• wÑ–ll open up ÑƒÐ¾ur audience even mÐ¾rÐµ.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">LÑ–nkÐµdIn Ð°llÐ¾wÑ• ÑƒÐ¾u tÐ¾ Ð°dd a company Ñ€rÐ¾fÑ–lÐµ, Ñ•hÐ¾w ÑÐ°Ñ•Ñ–ng ÑƒÐ¾ur brand Ð°nd wÐµbÑ•Ñ–tÐµ. UÑ•Ñ–ng their hÑ–ghlÑƒ funÑtÑ–Ð¾nÐ°l Ñ•ÐµÐ°rÑh facility ÑƒÐ¾u ÑÐ°n Ñ•ÐµÐ°rÑh fÐ¾r candidates with rÐµlÐµvÐ°nt qualifications and ÑÐ¾ntÐ°Ñt thÐµm dÑ–rÐµÑtlÑƒ. It is Ð°lÑ•Ð¾ a grÐµÐ°t idea tÐ¾ join Ð°Ñ€Ñ€lÑ–ÑÐ°blÐµ grÐ¾uÑ€Ñ• and get involved in thÐµ discussions, thÑ–Ñ• wÐ°Ñƒ you ÑÐ°n Ñ€rÐ¾mÐ¾tÐµ ÑƒÐ¾ur jÐ¾b vÐ°ÑÐ°nÑÑƒ Ð°nd ÑƒÐ¾ur buÑ•Ñ–nÐµÑ•Ñ•.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Facebook too hÐ°Ñ• thÐµ potential tÐ¾ broaden your Ñ•ÐµÐ°rÑh, set up a gÐ¾Ð¾d company Ñ€Ð°gÐµ with interesting Ñ–nfÐ¾rmÐ°tÑ–Ð¾n.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">With Ð°ll Ñ•Ð¾ÑÑ–Ð°l mÐµdÑ–Ð° Ñ•Ñ–tÐµÑ•, gÐµt ÑƒÐ¾ur ÐµmÑ€lÐ¾ÑƒÐµÐµÑ• Ð°nd frÑ–ÐµndÑ• Ñ–nvÐ¾lvÐµd, wrÑ–tÑ–ng ÑÐ¾mmÐµntÑ•, lÑ–kÑ–ng Ð°nd Ñ•hÐ°rÑ–ng ÑƒÐ¾ur Ñ€Ð°gÐµ Ð°nd twÐµÐµtÑ•. All these thÑ–ngÑ• wÑ–ll rÐ°Ñ–Ñ•Ðµ ÑƒÐ¾ur buÑ•Ñ–nÐµÑ•Ñ• Ñ€rÐ¾fÑ–lÐµ Ð°nd Ñ–nÑrÐµÐ°Ñ•Ðµ ÑƒÐ¾ur ÑÐ°ndÑ–dÐ°tÐµ pool.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">RÐµmÐµmbÐµr if you want to build a gÐ¾Ð¾d Ñ•Ð¾ÑÑ–Ð°l media Ñ€rÐµÑ•ÐµnÑÐµ, ÑƒÐ¾u muÑ•t keep your Ñ€Ð°gÐµÑ• uÑ€dÐ°tÐµd; Ð°dd Ñ–ntÐµrÐµÑ•tÑ–ng facts; lÐµt Ñ€ÐµÐ¾Ñ€lÐµ know what ÑƒÐ¾u Ð°rÐµ dÐ¾Ñ–ng Ð°nd whÐ°t ÑƒÐ¾u Ð°rÐµ all Ð°bÐ¾ut.</p>', '', '512691pricetable.jpg', '09, Nov 2014', '15:38 PM', '2014-11-09 20:08:24', 'N', 'Y'),
(4, 7, 'Hiring Trends', '', '', '<div class=\"blurb\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\">Looking for a job in an employer\'s market can be difficult challenges anyone will ever have to face. Being fortunate in seeking opportunity entails several key changes in perspective</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">In times of high unemployment and fewer job opportunities, there are some curious trends in development. While competition from a flood of job seekers for fewer jobs, some employers are looking to develop a position that prospective employees should be \" the best of the best \" with little interest to waste time interviewing less qualified candidates, for those who continue to work, the employer market seems add more stress, require higher standards of efficiency and indicate the loss of value for the existing talent. Though these thought can actually be applied in some cases, when industries tighten their belts to succeed the storm of reduced profits, staffing cut backs, and fewer employees, the center of many companies turns from growth to survival. Communication and appreciation tends to be reduced during these times.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\">As times of the higher number of unemployment, those companies that think about becoming extra selective about who they hire due to the increase in availability of some qualified candidates soon discover a real problem with adopting this perspective. Even though it is real that more qualified candidates seeking new jobs, putting these people in touch with potential hiring companies is also much more difficult. Many company that post job openings receive such an amazing response to their postings; it becomes a daunting task to classify through the resumes that flooding in, to find qualified candidates they wish to interview.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">This problem may occur in the event of a fall in unemployment, but in difficult times, the situation can send companies looking for alternative ways to stem the tide, and clear their vision in practical approach to finding talent search. The results of a situation where more and more companies seeking suitable candidates in the labor market &ldquo;hidden \" .job market.</span></p>\r\n</div>', '', '264231HiringTrends.jpg', '09, Nov 2014', '15:43 PM', '2014-11-09 20:13:03', 'N', 'Y'),
(14, 4, 'Is Attrition Good or Bad', '', '<br>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #333333;\">This very question creates a dilemma in the minds of startup entrepreneurs. Generally, they see big companies are proud of keeping their workforce for a long time. This shows the employee satisfaction in their company. And this very thing attracts people to join the companies which retain people for a long time. In India, government jobs are still first priority for the seriously big percentage of people. Why? The answer is stability. But these days young generation started looking at private jobs with widening eyes. Why? The answer is growth irrespective of the time duration of their service.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #333333;\">Whether attrition is good or badâ€™, can be seen from both employee point of view as well as company point of view. If we seek the answer to this question from the employee point of view or from the company point of view in general, then we are doing it wrong. We cannot reach a conclusion. The pros and cons go hand in hand.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #333333;\">The real answer to this question isâ€¦ It depends on the worker to worker and company to company. When we go in little depth, we can easily figure out the answer to this question will depends on following factors â€“</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Employeeâ€™s current contribution to the company.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Contribution is growing or declining.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Adaptability of the employee to new changes in technology.&nbsp;When new technology comes then it is the core responsibility of a company to adapt it in order to keep itself ahead (or at least to avoid lagging behind). When new technology is adapted then the company have two optionsâ€”either train the current team or hire already trained professionals. Here company needs to do some mathematics. Not only this, the company need to ensure that every other work must go unchanged in case it decides to hire trained professionals. Things are bit sensitive here.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">If the company is able to take increased returns (or even maintained) after the increment in package and perks. [Most of the time, employees keep on doing same work they were doing before appraisals]. In India, appraisals are time-based. Such appraisals reduce the profit company is earning on that employee.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Ease of employee replacement for a cheaper cost. That includes replacement cost and availability.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">How easy or difficult it is to train a new worker.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #333333;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">Availability of better worker (better performer) in similar costing.&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #333333;\">How that particular worker / employee is influencing others. Sometimes, an individual person cannot be seen as an individual. He/she might be a driving force, an inspiration person for the complete team. For e.g. If the team leader is someone who can really lead his/her team very well. The presence itself is sufficient to fill the entire team with energy and enthusiasm. In that case, attrition of one person could cost attrition of full team.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #333333;\">There could be more factors to list depending on company, industry, situation and future plans. The decision is complex or difficult in a sensitive industry such as technology.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #333333;\">In general, every company should keep few handfuls of key employees for a long time as they become pillars and surrender their life to their company. They become someone to rely upon and secrets are safe with them. So, better not to put this question on the table with such core pillars of the company.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: \'MyriadPro-Regular\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; color: #333333;\">Apart from the core pillar people of any company, it is better to get rid of employees from time to time. The reason is simpleâ€¦ this is ever changing the world, every growing environment, and after a certain age (around 45) people stop learning and improving on themselves they get stuck in their comfortable zone. And by that age, series of appraisals make their salaries &amp; perks on the higher side. And in return companies get that same old service and performance.</span></p>', '', '382467Attrition.jpg', '13, Apr 2016', '23:46 PM', '2016-04-13 13:16:38', 'Y', 'Y'),
(15, 10, 'IS DIGITAL THE NEW DEFAULT?', '', '<br>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:\r\nnone;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN\">Over the last few decades, technology has risen to levels\r\nbeyond our imaginations. In today\'s modern era, everything is digital. Every\r\naspect of life is being changed through the use of technology. The effects that\r\nthis development of technology has had on us is unmeasurable and irreversible.\r\nIn almost every field in today\'s digital world, we see advancements and\r\nmodernization.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:\r\nnone;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/H5XgJLR.jpg\" width=\"747\"><br></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:\r\nnone;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN\">Let\'s take some examples, in the field of health, we see\r\nthe introduction of electronic health records (EHRs), computerized appointment\r\nmanagement systems, and advanced machines that make diagnosis and surgeries\r\nmore effective than ever before. In the field of businesses, we see computer\r\nsoftware and applications taking the lead role. These applications help in\r\ncollecting, organizing, analyzing, and interpreting data much more efficiently\r\nthan the old and traditional paper based system.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:\r\nnone;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN\">On the other hand, in daily life, we see the introduction\r\nof smartphones and tablets. Everything that we need from information to\r\nentertainment is available at our hands in the form of these small but very\r\npowerful devices. At the same time, we have the internet. An old yet\r\nprogressing technology that has changed the world as we know it. Everyone and\r\neverything is now accessible via the internet. The social media is the platform\r\nfor sharing and developing ideas and thoughts without any restrictions of\r\nphysical boundaries or cultural differences.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:\r\nnone;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN\">\r\n\r\n</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:\r\nnone;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN\">Now, development is also being made on the <i>Internet of\r\nThings </i>(IoT) technology. Through his technology, the world of humans will\r\nbe able to interact with the world of devices i.e. every device in your\r\nhousehold, organization, or outdoors will be able to connect to a network. With\r\nthe help of this technology, information exchange will become even more\r\nadvanced that will enable greater accessibility and control over modern\r\ndevices.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:\r\nnone;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN\"><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/S1Fb6hI.jpg\" width=\"747\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:\r\nnone;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN\">Despite the numerous technological advancements that we\r\nhave seen over the last few decades, there is more work being done every day.\r\nDigital is now the new default. In today\'s modern era, it is absolutely\r\nessential to stay connected to the world of technology around us. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:\r\nnone;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN\">If you\'re a businessmen in today\'s world, you need to be\r\naware of and make use of the latest technologies in the world today to succeed\r\nin your professional life. If you\'re a graduate, no matter what your career\r\nfield may be, it is necessary that you understand today\'s technologies to be\r\nable to prosper in your job. If you\'re a student, you need to make use of the\r\ninternet and associated applications to gain information. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:10.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-pagination:\r\nnone;mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:&quot;Times New Roman&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">Conclusively,\r\nthe technological world is progressing at a rapid rate. As individuals, we have\r\nto both learn and contribute to the digital world of today to utilize the\r\ntechnologies available in the best manner possible.&nbsp;</span><br></span></p>', '', '499347DigitalDefault.jpg', '25, May 2016', '8:05 AM', '2016-05-24 21:35:43', 'Y', 'Y'),
(16, 11, 'Impact of BREXIT', '', '<br>', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The UK economy has been shaken due to BREXIT. Its impact is harshly emphasized by a new poll that shows business leaders are now thinking about cutting jobs and transferring their business operations abroad.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">The Institute of Directors conducted a survey which shows that around 64% or its members believed that the decision of leaving Europe would be bad for their companies. Philip Hammond, who is Foreign Secretary said that the investment in UK have all dried up and 2 huge bands in the UK are said to be shifting most of their staff out of the country. He also added that it would be catastrophic if the UK ended up losing its access to the single market and without that the country would go down the league table. Hammond also said that he believed it was important that access to the single European market should be protected.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Philip did not hesitate before saying that UKâ€™s economy has been shaped by that access over the past 40 years and if that access is lost, it would be completely catastrophic. During the ITVâ€™s Peston show, he also made a remark saying that the flow of foreign direct investment into the UK has almost dried while international businesses are waiting to see how this issue gets resolved. Philip clearly emphasized the need of foreign direct investment by saying that we import a lot more than exporting and that account remains balanced by the strong flow of foreign investment in the UK.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">As the effects of Brexit became clearer, Sajid Javid, a Business Secretary did not fail to add that he had already warned everyone in his campaign that Brexit would put the country into recession. H suggested that if everyone works together, many of the forecasted things can be avoided. He strongly believes that businesses in the UK have a chance to do that.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">BREXIT may have been bad for Britain, but it seems that it will be potentially good for India. The most major benefits would be:</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>The pound will depreciate in the near future against big economies so obviously India will be one of such economies</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>Britain does not want to lose the capital arriving from India and in order to secure that, it will do everything to make sure that Indian companies keep on doing so. This can be done by providing incentives such as tax breaks or other financial enticements.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">-<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space:pre\">	</span>If Britain exits Europe, India will have to make ties with another country in the continent which might prove to be beneficial in the long run.&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\" style=\"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1\"><o:p></o:p></p>', '', '518502Logo_brexit_new_size2.png', '01, Jul 2016', '7:18 AM', '2016-06-30 20:48:11', 'Y', 'Y');
