Cash Flow Statements & Fund Flow Statements<br />\r\nÃ˜ Maintain of Fixed Asset Register on ongoing basis<br />\r\nÃ˜ As a designated head of Department, coordinates Inter Department and provide the necessary information to the team.<br />\r\nÃ˜ Conducting root cause analysis, entailing cost drivers analysis budget v/s actual and ensuring that OPEX & CAPEX & Profits are adequately within the specified budgetary parameters.<br />\r\nÃ˜ Implementing accounting / financial systems with a view to ensure smooth accounting operations and facilitate internal financial control.<br />\r\nÃ˜ Implementation of cost control measures at various levels, Ensuring best practices & procedures are followed through best adoption of Internal Control & Procedures to be implemented from time to time.<br />\r\n <br />\r\n', 'Email: hrd@royaloakindia.comTelephone: 9740018085<br />\r\n', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '05 April, 2017', '2017-04-05', 42, '2017-04-05 05:09:40', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(1330078, 74820, 'senior Document Specialists', 'RR Donnelley', 'RR Donnelley is a $11.5 billion Fortune 500 company, and a global provider of integrated communications including premedia, printing, logistics and business process outsourcing services. The Global Outsourcing (GO) division is among the world&rsquo;s leading professional service providers of integrated onsite-offshore services in finance, publishing, manufacturing, transportation, telecommunications, healthcare, advertising, and investment banking to Fortune 500 companies and professional services firms in the United States and Europe. Our operations are spread across India, Philippines and Sri Lanka, with sales and delivery offices in the United States and United Kingdom.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRR Donnelley is committed to providing a meritocratic environment that values, recognizes and rewards our employees for their performance.', '5', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '2', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Chennai', 'Minimum typing speed of 60 words per minute with 99%accuracy  - Advanced knowledge of MS Office Suite majorly in  Power point.  - Good oral and written communication skills  - Ability to function in a dynamic and changing environment  - Adaptability / Flexibility.', '', '25', '12', '', '', '', '', 'Educational Qualifications:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Graduate in any discipline<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTechnical Qualifications:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Certification in typing and MS-Office<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMinimum of 2 years experience in DTP, MS Powerpoint, data entry or secretarial practice<br />\r\n', '', 'Job Description:<br />\r\nProvide high quality, real-time assistance to clients for documentation projects that includes Powerpoint processing, editing and formatting of documents in a variety of software and media.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnsure timely delivery of accurate output.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWork Schedule:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbility to work flexible schedules during day/ night / weekend shifts.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf the profile suits your career aspirations, please walk-in for an interview tomorrow, 27-April-2017 - 29- Apr-2017, between 10 am to 1 pm. ', 'If the profile suits your career aspirations, please walk-in for an interview tomorrow, 27-April-2017 - 29- Apr-2017, between 10 am to 1 pm. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nRR Donnelley<br />\r\nFloor 6, Prestige Polygon, <br />\r\n471 Anna Salai, Teynampet<br />\r\nChennai - 600018<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContact Person - Vijai Raman', 'ANY GRADUATATE ', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '24 April, 2017', '2017-04-24', 23, '2017-04-24 05:27:05', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
