s, Microsoft word,<br />\r\nexcel, and power point<br />\r\nMin.Exp. (Years) 2<br />\r\nMax.Exp. 8<br />\r\nSalary (Lac per Annum) 2 to 5<br />\r\n ', 'Email: hranjali9@gmail.comTelephone: 9029013438', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 April, 2017', '2017-04-07', 40, '2017-04-07 00:18:30', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(1397328, 74820, 'E-learning Counselor', 'Info Edge India Ltd.', 'Info Edge India Ltd.<br />\r\nInfo Edge is India\'s leading consumer internet company. With online presence in recruitment, matrimony, real estate and education, and strong brands like Naukri.com, 99acres.com, jeevansathi.com and Shiksha.com. With over 4,500 employees spread over more than 48 locations in India & Middle East and a financially strong status of revenue figure Rs. 483 cr and EBIDTA margin of 40.09% for last financial year. We also have a market capitalization of over Rs 7500 cr.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNaukri FastForward is the candidate service arm of Naukri.com. It offers specialised services to jobseekers across profiles to complement their job search journey and speedup the process. These services are designed to enhance their profiles, increase exposure to recruiters and provide them with latest and relevant job openings.', '4', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '0', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'noida', 'B2C, Outbound Sale,s telesales, tele sales, sales inside, sales, e - learning ,education sales, courses selling, counselor counselling,', '', '29', '116', '', '', '', ' Opportunity to work with No. 1 Job site.<br />\r\n-- People from corporate sales who are looking for office based sales profile can apply (No field sales)<br />\r\n-- Fixed Day Shift Job<br />\r\n-- Attractive Monthly Incentives<br />\r\n-- Holiday remuneration for working on weekly offs / Public Holiday<br />\r\n-- Enriching exposure- B2C model with opportunity to deal with senior level clients<br />\r\n-- Excellent growth opportunities<br />\r\nNote: Candidates who\'ve appeared in last 3 months are requested not to apply', 'Graduates/Post Graduates with 0 to 3 yr of Exp in Sales/business development/Customer service/counselling<br />\r\n-- Must have excellent Spoken & written communication skills in English<br />\r\n-- People looking for a corporate exposure are encouraged to apply<br />\r\n-- Ability to work independently and under pressure<br />\r\n-- Ready to take challenges<br />\r\n', '', 'About the role: <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe role is focused towards generating revenue for the company by selling e-courses to customers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n It also involves maintaining client relationships with the existing clients. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Responsibilities: <br />\r\n<br />\r\n-- Making enhanced outbound calls (60-80 calls) on leads provided by the company<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-- Reaching out to new customers and explaining them the benefits of different Preparatory & Upskilling courses provided like Six Sigma, IFRS, CFA, Digital Marketing etc <br />\r\n<br />\r\n-- Analyzing customer\'s requirements and providing them solutions as per their needs<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-- Achieving sales targets by acquiring new clients and growing business from existing clients <br />\r\n<br />\r\n-- Creating database of existing and new clients<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-- Understanding and managing personal performance on daily basis<br />\r\n<br />\r\n--Adhering to quality standards <br />\r\n', 'Megha Agarwal<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTelephone:0120-308000<br />\r\nReference Id:FF-Noida', 'ANY GRADUATATE ', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '18 April, 2017', '2017-04-18', 29, '2017-04-18 06:35:59', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
