(1589201, 74820, 'Customer Service Rep.', 'SHENTEL', '', '3', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '2', '9', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'Accomac, VA', 'Ability to communicate orally and in written form, and in both face-to-face and non-face-to-face situations. Ability to use general office equipment, including a computer.  Ability to retrieve a vast amount of information from memory.', '', '1', '62', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Handles all customer requests for service via telephone, email, web, chat or face to face interactions. Responsible for collection of customer accounts receivable. Resolves customer inquiries or complaints on products, services, or billing issues. May perform other administrative functions for the department. Daily contact with customers in a call center environment, staff, agents, and other departments regarding service requests, billing payments, troubles, and reports. Some record keeping is required. ', '<br />\r\nFOR HELP PLEASE USE JOBSIRE.COM', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '26 April, 2017', '2017-04-26', 21, '2017-04-26 08:09:33', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
