hnical and soft skills training programs that help individuals\' progress. GSR for the last two years has doubled itself each year, and our plan is to continue on that growth path for the foreseeable future.', '6', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '3', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Chennai', 'C, Automation Testing, OOPS, Core Java Test Cases Scratch', '', '23', '40', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Should have strong work experience in Automation testing<br />\r\nMust have experience in creating any Framework (Like Data driven, Keyword Driven OR Hydbrid) from scratch.<br />\r\nMust have strong experience in Core Java<br />\r\nAbility to create Test Cases<br />\r\nShould be strong in OOPS Concept<br />\r\nCore Java OR \'C\' programming experience is an added advantage.', 'Contact Person : Muthu (8870476197) & Vikram (8870476198)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDate of Interview: 29th & 30th April. 2017 (Saturday & Sunday)<br />\r\nWalkin Timings : 10.30 AM to 3 PM<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInterview Venue: <br />\r\niKeva<br />\r\nLevel 1, am@10, MB Towers<br />\r\nRoad No 10 Banjara Hills<br />\r\nHyderabad 500034<br />\r\nNearest Landmark - near city center mall, Behind UCO bank lane ,ICICI Prudential on the ground floor .', 'BSC IT', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 April, 2017', '2017-04-08', 39, '2017-04-08 05:39:22', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(1758039, 74820, 'Android Developer', 'Lyra Information Technology Pvt Ltd', '', '5', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '1', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Chennai', 'AngularJS BackBoneJS KnockoutJS Dojo Sencha Touch', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Work across all phases of app development requirement gathering, code, release, bug fixing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Good oral and written communication skills to work with various teams and client personnel, locally and internationally, with minimal supervision.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Multitasking, task prioritization, timely completion of tasks and reporting to managers/leads<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Development experience with mobile web technologies (HTML5, JavaScript, CSS3)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Development experience with hybrid technologies such as Ionic, Apache Cordova (Phone Gap), Onsen-UI<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Experience with one or more JavaScript frameworks such as AngularJS, BackBoneJS, KnockoutJS, Dojo, Sencha Touch, jQuery, jQuery Mobile and NodeJS<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Experience developing mobile/web user interfaces, component and widgets<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Familiarity with common development tools such as Eclipse, xCode, Android Software Development Kit (SDK), Git, Ubuntu/OS X<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Ability to work independently, as well as part of a larger team<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Knowledge at multiple code levels and the overall application designDesired Candidate Profile *2-4 years hands on experience in android/iOS Hybrid application development.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Must have published few android applications on Play Store or other market. (Provide links.)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Expertise with mobile web technologies (HTML5, JavaScript, CSS3)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*Experience with hybrid technologies such as Ionic, Apache Cordova (Phone Gap), Onsen-UI<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*JavaScript frameworks such as AngularJS, BackBoneJS, KnockoutJS, Dojo, Sencha Touch, jQuery, jQuery Mobile and NodeJS<br />\r\n', 'Company Name: Lyra Information Technology Pvt Ltd<br />\r\nCompany Description: <br />\r\nLyra Information Technology Pvt Ltd<br />\r\nEmail: hr@lyrainfotech.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 9884185200', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '19 April, 2017', '2017-04-19', 28, '2017-04-19 06:41:02', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(1853231, 19170, 'PPC Executive', 'Cybernext private limited', 'Company Profile<br />\r\nCybernext is a leading information technology company that provides highly qualitative, timely delivered and cost-effective IT services to wide variety of global clients. It offers a wide range of creative solutions that are designed to meet specific business needs.<br />\r\nCybernext provides end-to-end business solutions that leverage technology. We provide solutions for a dynamic environment where business and technology strategies converge. Our approach focuses on new ways of business combining IT innovation and adoption while also leveraging an organizationâ€™s current IT assets.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCybernext possesses result oriented team working with right technology for right work assuring total quality with accuracy and high value returns. Our Research & Development Department continuously explore new technologies to give our clients the best, generating a high level of satisfaction in them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCybernext provides wide range of Software and Web Services that deliver real business results. We work with global clients and new generation technology companies to build new products or services and to implement prudent business and technology strategies in todayâ€™s dynamic digital environment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe are staying on pace with the fast evolving development tools and technologies available in the market today. Cybernext employees are the cream of the talent crop. Because of our experience, the tools we have evolved, and our talented engineers, we can develop quality, customized solutions very quickly. When we have deadlines to meet, we ensure the deadline is met.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur development team provides customized solutions to include specific business requirements to existing solutions. We have experience backed up by completing number of commercial projects related to different business sectors.<br />\r\nWe provide value to our customers by offering several benefits to them including speed to market, high quality people and processes, cutting edge technology expertise and a full service portfolio.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHard work, attitude and dedication, these are not just words for the members of the Cybernext family, they actually implement it. Five days work culture is what Cybernext follows. <br />\r\n', '', '90', '06 Jul, 2017', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', 'IN', '', '', 'Mohali', 'ppc, smm, seo, sem', '', '23', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ' Key Functional Areas of Responsibility- _<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Account management of pay per click accounts on Google AdWords, LinkedIn & Facebook for a variety of clients in India & abroad.<br />\r\n    Assist in the maintenance and monitoring of keyword bids, account daily and monthly budget caps, impression share, quality score and other important account metrics.<br />\r\n    Provide creative copy suggestions and graphical ad templates.<br />\r\n    Execute strategies for keyword opportunities, campaign structuring, targeting.<br />\r\n    Create search, sponsored, display, lead, remarketing campaigns.<br />\r\n    Generate weekly and monthly reports with all major metrics, goals.<br />\r\n    Keep pace with search engine and PPC industry trends and developments.<br />\r\n    Monitor and administer web analytics dashboards, reports and key reporting tools<br />\r\n    Communication to team and management on project development, timelines, and results.<br />\r\n    Work closely with the other team members to meet client goals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n_ Professional Competencies- _<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Passion for Search and internet marketing.<br />\r\n    Outstanding ability to think creatively, and identify and resolve problems.<br />\r\n    Effectively multi-task in a deadline driven atmosphere.<br />\r\n    Ability to learn new industries and new business types quickly and can apply this knowledge to Digital marketing initiatives and achieving goals.<br />\r\n    High levels of integrity, autonomy, and self-motivation.<br />\r\n    Excellent analytical, organizational, project management and time management skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n_ Professional Skills & Qualifications- _<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Experience in Search Engine Marketing (SEM) CPC & CPM<br />\r\n    Proficiency in MS Excel, PowerPoint, and Word.<br />\r\n    Experience with website analysis using a variety of analytics tools including Google Analytics as well as internal reporting tools.<br />\r\n    Experience working with popular PPC ad platforms (AdWords, Bing).<br />\r\n    AdWords, Google Analytics certification is a plus.<br />\r\n', 'Share resumes at hr@cybernext.io', '', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 April, 2017', '2017-04-07', 40, '2017-04-06 23:09:47', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
