(2100607, 74820, 'General Ledger-LEAD ASSOCIATE', 'WNS', 'WNS<br />\r\nWNS (Holdings) Limited (NYSE: WNS) is a leading global Business Process Management (BPM) company. WNS offers business value to 200+ global clients by combining operational excellence with deep domain expertise in key industry verticals, including Banking and Financial Services, Healthcare, Insurance, Manufacturing, Media and Entertainment, Professional Services, Retail &amp;amp; Consumer Packaged Goods, Telecom and Diversified Businesses, Shipping and Logistics, Travel and Leisure and Utilities. WNS delivers an entire spectrum of business process management services such as customer care, finance and accounting, human resource solutions, research and analytics, technology solutions, and industry-specific back-office and front-office processes.<br />\r\nWe enable our clients to OUTPERFORM by transforming their business processes with domain expertise, partnership approach and global delivery capability. For further information, please visit www.wns.com', '2', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '1', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Pune', 'accounts general,  ledger,  gl', '', '2', '47', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Greeting from WNS<br />\r\n<br />\r\n11 AM - 2 PM <br />\r\nIMMEDIATE JOINERS ONLY<br />\r\nBCOM PLUS MBA FINANCE CAN APPLY<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNO BCA OR BSC/ NO BE/B.Tech  / DO NOT APPLY<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEXPERIENCE IN RECONCILIATION ,JOURNALS(Accural & Adjustment)<br />\r\nEXCEL EXPERIENCE (essential)<br />\r\nMONTH END CLOSURES<br />\r\nNEED EXCELLENT COMMUNICATION SKILLS AND GRADUATES ONLY BCOM,BBA,MBA,MCOM<br />\r\nEXPERIENCE INTO END TO END ACCOUNTING<br />\r\nWELL VERSED WITH ACCOUNTING CONCEPT.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n  Excellent opportunity @ WNS for General Ledger process. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nInterested Candidates can walk in for an interview and Meet HR SNEHA<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMention Contact Person\'s name (HR SNEHA) on your CV <br />\r\n<br />\r\nJob Location- PUNE<br />\r\nGeneral Ledger-LEAD ASSOCIATE<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Preparation of dash board for internal and external reporting.<br />\r\n- Excellent Communication skills<br />\r\n- Free transport.<br />\r\n- Willing to work for shifts (US)<br />\r\n- GL Posting/JE<br />\r\n- Fixed Asset<br />\r\n- Candidates should have worked upto finalization of accounts or   assisted in finalization.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n Interview Day:Monday to friday<br />\r\nb/w:11am-2pm<br />\r\nWNS VIMANNAGAR BLOCK C OPPOSITE HYAAT HOTEL  ', 'Recruiter Name:HR SNEHA<br /><br />\r\nContact Company:WNS GLOBAL SERVICES PRIVATE LIMITED<br /><br />\r\nEmail Address:sneha.katore@wns.com<br /><br />\r\nWebsite:http://www.wns.com/<br /><br />\r\nTelephone:9823676344', 'ANY GRADUATATE ', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '25 April, 2017', '2017-04-25', 22, '2017-04-25 07:48:46', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
