(2182598, 74820, 'Sr.manager/agm-client Servicing & Business Development,', 'C S DIREKT EVENTS AND EXHIBITION PVT LTD', 'We are Proud to be at CS Direkt<br />\r\nAt CSD we \"Make Magic Happen\" for Brands. <br />\r\nWe believe that when people come together for an Experience, it\'s a context where Brands come Alive!<br />\r\nThat\'s why we\'ve been connecting Brands with their Audience through innovative Meetings, Events, Activation, Exhibitions and Large Format Show management since 1994. We are one of the first Indian agencies to be accredited with ISO 9001:2008. We have Executed Government, Corporate Large format projects for more than two decades now.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCS Direkt is an independent, privately held organization with its headquarter based at Gurgaon, India. We have our offices in Mumbai and Dubai. We have delivered projects for clients all over the world. <br />\r\nWe are recognized in the industry for Creative and Flawless Event executions!!', '3', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '0', '12', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Gurgaon', 'Client Servicing ,presentation events, ideation conceptualisation ,BTL ATL Activation promotion', '', '28', '69', '', '', '', '', 'Bachelor\'s degree with strong academic credentials <br />\r\nStrong business acumen, ethics and high integrity <br />\r\nExperience with Excel, power point and other relevant tools <br />\r\nExcellent communication skills (verbal and written) <br />\r\n', '', 'Job Profile: <br />\r\nDesign and drive Revenue Generation Strategy for the Company. As an Business Head you are responsible for both Top Line and Bottom line for the business generated through your team. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience: 8-12 Years<br />\r\nLocation: Gurgaon, Udyog Vihar, Phase 1<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout the role <br />\r\nReporting to GM, you will lead and manage the events sales team in delivering end to end events programs. Based at Gurgaon, You will also coach the teams in creating and delivering bespoke, high-end and truly out of the ordinary large scale events globally. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Responsibilities:<br />\r\nBe entrepreneurial in managing financial and corporate objectives of sub business unit and maximize the opportunities offered by the events. <br />\r\nComprehend brand, develop strategy, prepare and present event proposals to clients. <br />\r\nWork with key stakeholders to design and deliver a range of large scale events. <br />\r\nLead and mentor the team to nurture brands and create value for our clients by providing creative, engaging solutions. <br />\r\nInvest in relationships with clients, industry peers & colleagues to ensure best practice methods are applied and the team is up to date with industry/global trends. <br />\r\nPost event analysis including managing evaluation process and providing feedback/ROI to clients. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompetencies:<br />\r\nYou must have 8 plus years of experience in a similar area or work. <br />\r\nStrong experience and skills in budget management. <br />\r\nPassion for events and brand promotions. <br />\r\nExcel at developing and building relationships <br />\r\nMust be articulate, organized, detail-oriented, and have ability to multi-task in a dynamic, fast-changing entrepreneurial environment ', 'Rajinder Kaur<br />\r\nContact Company:C S DIREKT EVENTS AND EXHIBITION PVT LTD<br />\r\nEmail Address:rajinder@csdirekt.com<br />\r\nWebsite:http://www.csdirekt.com<br />\r\nTelephone:9717592210', 'ANY GRADUATATE ', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '19 April, 2017', '2017-04-19', 28, '2017-04-19 07:01:58', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
