(2321119, 74820, 'Phython Developer - Experienced', 'Lapiz Digital Services', '', '', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '0', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Chennai, Tamil Nadu', '    Anaconda     Git     Bitbuket     PyCharm ', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '    Expert in Python, with knowledge of at least one Python web framework such as Django, Flask, etc<br />\r\n    Able to integrate multiple data sources and databases into one system<br />\r\n    Understanding of the threading limitations of Python, and multi-process architecture<br />\r\n    Good understanding of server-side templating languages such as Jinja 2, Mako, etc<br />\r\n    Good understanding of front-end technologies, such as JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3<br />\r\n    Knowledge of user authentication and authorization between multiple systems, servers, and environments<br />\r\n    Understanding of fundamental design principles behind a scalable application<br />\r\n    Able to create database schemas that represent and support business processes<br />\r\n    Strong unit test and debugging skills<br />\r\n    Proficient understanding of code versioning tools such as Git, Mercurial or SVN<br />\r\n    Experience: 3 - 5 Years ', '', '    We are looking for a Python Developer responsible for managing the interchange of data between the server and the users.<br />\r\n    Your primary focus will be the development of all server-side logic, ensuring high performance and responsiveness to requests from the front-end.<br />\r\n    You will also be responsible for integrating the front-end elements built by your co-workers into the application; therefore, a basic understanding of front-end technologies is necessary as well. ', 'For help please use jobsire.com', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '19 April, 2017', '2017-04-19', 28, '2017-04-19 06:45:46', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(2323593, 74820, 'Data Analyst', 'The Heritage Group', '', '3', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '1', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '12', 'US', '', '', 'Indianapolis, IN', 'analyze data, create statistical methods', '', '23', '', '', '', 'Y', '', '<br />\r\nSeeking an experienced Data Analyst to maintaining data integrity within custom ERP system. This position is responsible for data reporting, correction and process improvement. The ideal candidate for this positon is able to do complete life cycle data generation procedures and outline critical information for our leaders. Data Analysts works directly with leadership at various levels within the organization and with outside parties to research and identify operational business requirements with sufficient detail and clarity to allow the development of the data or reporting solution needed. Develops, maintains, and ensures quality control of databases and may assist in development and implementation of measurement systems. ', '', 'Use statistical methods to analyze data and generate useful business reports<br />\r\nEffectively manage routine data problems and inquiries<br />\r\nExecute data processes in accordance with process and data standards and procedure<br />\r\nInvestigate and initiate appropriate corrective action when data quality deteriorates<br />\r\nEffectively communicate basic data value propositions<br />\r\nEducate coworkers and organizational management on the value of data and data related changes, including impact on the organizations and Company\'s financial performance<br />\r\nEnsure users are kept informed of changes in data standards and processes<br />\r\nR eview, recommend solution and facilitate data deletion and archiving requests for data<br />\r\nAssist with resolution of data integration issues<br />\r\nAssist with the definition of business requirements and Data Business rules, and support the projects and initiatives for development and refinement of data processes and metrics<br />\r\nRecommend adjustments to data policies and procedures as necessary to improve key performance indicators<br />\r\nMonitor performance indicators/metrics for data & report to management<br />\r\nProvide support to other Data Analysts and Stewards of data', 'apply directly from our The Heritage Group website', 'Bachelor\'s Degree: Information Technology or Computer Engineering preferred', 'Formal', 'H1B', 'W2-Contract', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '19 April, 2017', '2017-04-19', 28, '2017-04-19 06:58:59', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(2379433, 74820, 'Software Engineer- Freshers', 'Manpower Global', 'Company Name: Manpower GlobalCompany Description: <br />\r\nManpower Global hr consultant ,,hiring fresher software engr for our client.......The company laid its roots from basics of HR Management, thereby bringing a unique approach to cater the requirements of our Clients. We recruit across various verticals for multinational corporations as well as leading business houses. Over the past years, we have been able to shape the careers of numerous professionals. Our strong beliefs and values define what we stand for and determine how we work.<br />\r\nOur rigorous screening procedure ensures quality output within specific timeframes. You can completely rely on us to handle even the most critical requirements in shortest possible time, which is of paramount importance in these evolving times. We keep abreast of the rapid developments that take place in the corporate arena and constantly review and upgrade ourselves to tackle these developments in the most effective manner.<br />\r\nOur mission is â€œTo mutually build a globally respected Human Capital Solutions Company that provides best-in-class human capital solutions,<br />\r\nwhich will add value to client organizationsâ€.<br />\r\nWe hold specialization in offering consultancy services in the following diversified sectors:<br />\r\nIndustrial â€“ Engineering, Manufacturing, R&D and Process IndustriesInformation Technology & TelecommunicationsMedia, Entertainment & AdvertisementHospitals, Pharmaceuticals & MedicineIT Enabled ServicesConsulting, Marketing, Banking & Financial ServicesTextiles & Garments IndustriesFMCG & Consumer DurablesHuman Resource Personnel and Industrial Relations.Security services- including corporate and industrialE', '4', '90', '04 Jul, 2017', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '', 'Delhi', 'Skills: engineering .net java php', '', '23', '22', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Job Description <br />\r\nThe software engineer will work in product design and development team to support various products testing features development using Microsoft technologies ( .Net , C# , SQL server) , JAVA etc.<br />\r\n- Work closely with the developers and product owners to understand the user stories and customer requirements<br />\r\n- Design test plans automation tools for test cases for each iterations of the product development<br />\r\n- Performing automation testing of product features and UI enhancements and new development<br />\r\n- Performing performance testing and usability testing of the products using automation tools<br />\r\n- Creating automation test suits for regressing testing<br />\r\n- Good visibility on software product test automation and developing automation reports<br />\r\n <br />\r\n', 'Email: manpowerglobal076@gmail.comTelephone: 8510073185<br />\r\n', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '05 April, 2017', '2017-04-05', 42, '2017-04-05 05:43:53', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(2448434, 74820, 'MIS Executive', 'TravelO.Ninja', 'Company Name: TravelO.NinjaCompany Description: <br />\r\nIf exploring the world is your dream then we Travelo.Ninja makes your dream come true. We make journeys that are carefully crafted to deliver a personalized adventure like no other. We take the stress and anxiety to create an outstanding itinerary for you.<br />\r\nWe bring adventure in everyone via our travel trips to far-flung corners of the planet. We never fail to live up to the expectations of our clients. We want to give best customer satisfaction and donâ€™t want to compromise on the quality thus the result is more personal, more extraordinary and more fun. Hence a trip of a lifetime. We provide you with local guide who helps you get the most out of everyday of your journey.<br />\r\n', '2', '90', '04 Jul, 2017', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '', 'Delhi', ' MIS Reports IT MIS Finance MIS Reports FInance MIS Management Finance  ', '', '37', '1', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Should be able to create dashboards and scorecards<br />\r\nShould be able to handle large quantity of data in excel<br />\r\nShould be proficient in excel formulas, Pivot tables, formatting data, Sorting and filters, building and customizing charts<br />\r\nShould be able to create PowerPoint presentations with the data provided<br />\r\nShould be able to understand and build at least simple visual basic macros', 'Email: info@travelo.ninjaTelephone: 9711640594<br />\r\n', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '05 April, 2017', '2017-04-05', 42, '2017-04-05 05:46:55', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(2511456, 74820, 'Internship for MBA,MBA fresher,MBA trainee', 'Aester India Pvt Ltd', '', '', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Ernakulam', 'The person should be personable and presentable and possess exceptional communication skills.', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Marketing Manger Trainee are hired to provide support to marketing department of a company to function properly. Their work is mostly administrative in nature, handle office and support duties that eventually help the marketing team in driving the companyâ€™s sales. Marketing Manger Trainee perform market research duties, schedule conferences, gather and organize data and handle travel arrangements too.Also help marketing heads and teams during specific marketing and promotional activities and are also an integral part of the company as far as communication is concerned. The person should be personable and presentable and possess exceptional communication skills.', 'For help please use jobsire.com', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 April, 2017', '2017-04-08', 39, '2017-04-08 05:05:03', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(2517439, 74820, 'Senior Executive - Data Privacy Counsel', 'People First Consultants Pvt Ltd.,', '', '2', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '4', '9', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Bengaluru', 'Data Privacy, data protection', '', '27', '120', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Experience in working on global privacy related matters<br />\r\nDevelop and implement the global privacy compliance programme<br />\r\nDraft privacy policies and guidelines<br />\r\nDesign and deliver privacy training programmes <br />\r\nReview, draft and negotiate privacy clauses in customer and vendor contracts <br />\r\nConduct privacy impact and risk assessments, audit and monitor privacy compliance', 'send your cv in ranjani@peoplefirst.co.in', 'ANY GRADUATATE ', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '25 April, 2017', '2017-04-25', 22, '2017-04-25 07:52:38', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
