(3519064, 19170, 'Sr. PHP Developer', 'Cybernext private limited', 'Cybernext is a leading information technology company that provides highly qualitative, timely delivered and cost-effective IT services to wide variety of global clients. It offers a wide range of creative solutions that are designed to meet specific business needs.<br />\r\nCybernext provides end-to-end business solutions that leverage technology. We provide solutions for a dynamic environment where business and technology strategies converge. Our approach focuses on new ways of business combining IT innovation and adoption while also leveraging an organizationâ€™s current IT assets.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCybernext possesses result oriented team working with right technology for right work assuring total quality with accuracy and high value returns. Our Research & Development Department continuously explore new technologies to give our clients the best, generating a high level of satisfaction in them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCybernext provides wide range of Software and Web Services that deliver real business results. We work with global clients and new generation technology companies to build new products or services and to implement prudent business and technology strategies in todayâ€™s dynamic digital environment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe are staying on pace with the fast evolving development tools and technologies available in the market today. Cybernext employees are the cream of the talent crop. Because of our experience, the tools we have evolved, and our talented engineers, we can develop quality, customized solutions very quickly. When we have deadlines to meet, we ensure the deadline is met.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur development team provides customized solutions to include specific business requirements to existing solutions. We have experience backed up by completing number of commercial projects related to different business sectors.<br />\r\nWe provide value to our customers by offering several benefits to them including speed to market, high quality people and processes, cutting edge technology expertise and a full service portfolio.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHard work, attitude and dedication, these are not just words for the members of the Cybernext family, they actually implement it. Five days work culture is what Cybernext follows. ', '1', '90', '06 Jul, 2017', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', 'IN', '', '', 'Mohali', 'php, wordpress, codegnitior, magento, joomla, laravel', '', '23', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<br />\r\nCandidate should have experience in PHP, wordpress, codegnitior & other CMS/frameworks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCandidate must have good communication skills with leadership skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCandidate should be able to understand well project requirements & get work done through others & guide others as well as self involvement.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCandidate must have experience in team handling.', '', '', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 April, 2017', '2017-04-07', 40, '2017-04-06 22:55:32', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3534617, 74820, 'Junior .Net Developer', 'SIERRA ODC Private Limited', '', '', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '0', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu', 'ASP.NET/C#.NET', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Training will be provided to work on international and domestic projects for large Fortune 500 and Government clients. Keen interest to shine in the software field and willingness to work hard and grow well is key.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSubsidised food and accommodation shall also be provided for deserving candidates.', 'For help please use jobsire.com', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '20 April, 2017', '2017-04-20', 27, '2017-04-20 07:21:26', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3556226, 74820, ' Automation Tester', 'GSR Business Services Private Limited.', 'GSR Business Services Private Limited.<br />\r\nGSR Business Services Private Limited is an ISO 27001:2013 Certified Organization.<br />\r\nGSR is a high growth IT Services Organization that is at its cusp of its growth path. Started in 1992, GSR is established both in the United States and in India, with offices in California, Texas, Chennai, Bangalore and New Delhi.<br />\r\nAt GSR, We build and deliver Productivity and Business Applications for the Mobile First - Cloud First World that provide our clients with the information and systems they need to effectively operate and grow their business. Enabling clients to be at the bleeding edge of technology and to realize their full potential is what we pride ourselves with. Our employees not only work on the latest and emerging technologies but also are passionate about seeing how technology has changed the way the world works. GSRs core strength is the strong team of technical experts who have an opportunity to continually learn every day by working on most technically challenging assignments. <br />\r\nWith around 400 employees, GSR has more than 30 live projects with more than 20 clients as of now. GSR focus on Manufacturing, Pharmaceuticals, Life sciences, Healthcare, Education and BFSI. Our customers range from large MNCs in India and US to most promising startups in the USA. We have effectively delivered 500+ projects around the world, and continuing to expand to the newest realms of technology. Our practices include application development in Microsoft stack (Preferred partner to Microsoft), Open Source, Java, Enterprise Mobility, Business Analytics, Cloud Computing, MS Dynamics CRM, and Testing Center of Excellence. In addition to these, we have a great UX and Project Management teams that serve as a great value add to the customer. <br />\r\nWe at GSR believe in all-rounded career development for individuals and provide both technical and soft skills training programs that help individuals\' progress. GSR for the last two years has doubled itself each year, and our plan is to continue on that growth path for the foreseeable future.', '6', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '3', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Chennai', 'C, Automation Testing, OOPS, Core Java Test Cases Scratch', '', '23', '40', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Should have strong work experience in Automation testing<br />\r\nMust have experience in creating any Framework (Like Data driven, Keyword Driven OR Hydbrid) from scratch.<br />\r\nMust have strong experience in Core Java<br />\r\nAbility to create Test Cases<br />\r\nShould be strong in OOPS Concept<br />\r\nCore Java OR \'C\' programming experience is an added advantage.', 'Contact Person : Muthu (8870476197) & Vikram (8870476198)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDate of Interview: 29th & 30th April. 2017 (Saturday & Sunday)<br />\r\nWalkin Timings : 10.30 AM to 3 PM<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInterview Venue: <br />\r\niKeva<br />\r\nLevel 1, am@10, MB Towers<br />\r\nRoad No 10 Banjara Hills<br />\r\nHyderabad 500034<br />\r\nNearest Landmark - near city center mall, Behind UCO bank lane ,ICICI Prudential on the ground floor .', 'BSC IT', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '24 April, 2017', '2017-04-24', 23, '2017-04-24 05:36:37', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3564327, 74820, 'Sr. Software Developer', 'eTech Inc.', '', '5', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '5', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Delhi', 'J2EE, JSF, Richfaces, Spring, JavaScript, Jquery, Ajax, DHTML', '', '23', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '-A highly motivated team of working on challenging and exciting applications.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Agile software development<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-A dynamic environment in a fast-growing division.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Opportunity to work on latest technologies and tools', '', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '19 April, 2017', '2017-04-19', 28, '2017-04-19 06:58:03', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3584937, 74820, 'Pick Base Developer', 'Black & White Business Solutions', '', '4', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '3', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Pune', 'ASAP Pick Base Developer', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'We have a critical requirement for one of the major client in Pune location.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience on following skill: <br />\r\n<br />\r\n3-8 years of experience in Pick Basic/Universe/Unidata technology <br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience / Knowledge of Investment Banking domain will be an added advantage<br />\r\n', 'Company Name: Black & White Business SolutionsCompany <br />\r\nDescription: Black & White Business Solutions<br />\r\nEmail: rajendra@blackwhite.inTelephone: 9900025514', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '11 April, 2017', '2017-04-11', 36, '2017-04-11 06:00:47', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3607809, 44223, 'HR-ADMIN/EXECUTIVE', 'Ramanujan Info Solutions and services ', '', '', '30', '04 May, 2017', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', 'IN', '', '', 'Hyderabad', 'HR Admin HR Recruiter', '', '21', '119', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Human Resources Administrative Assistant Skills and Qualifications:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdministrative Writing Skills, Verbal Communication, Maintaining Employee Files, Compensation and Wage Structure, Orienting Employees, Benefits Administration, Interviewing Skills, Professionalism, Organization, Teamwork, Supply Management.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNote please call us at 8978023455 for schedule details or mail your resume at hr@ramanujaniss.com', '', '', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 April, 2017', '2017-04-04', 43, '2017-04-04 09:35:02', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3619465, 74820, 'Python Developer', 'GDS India Private Limited', '', '5', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '3', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Pune', 'Average competency', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Skill Set:Should have hands on experience with Python (3+ years, Recent), JavaScript, JQuerry and frameworks (Django, Pylon or Pyramid), type of projects should be web based. JS and advanced concepts - Average competency will workJQuery and Ajax - Good to knowDatabases - Must have REST API - Need to conceptually know how REST works and experience in implementation including error handling Note:- Candidates who can join max 30daysYour answers to the questions that follow will assist us in prospecting your candidature for all open positions with us. 1. Total Experience (In Yrs):2. Current CTC (In Lacs)<br />\r\n', 'Company Name: GDS India Private LimitedCompany Description: <br />\r\nGDS India Private LimitedEmail: indiaapply@gdatasol.comTelephone: 4064614559', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '14 April, 2017', '2017-04-14', 33, '2017-04-14 06:02:56', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3636919, 74820, 'Buyer - EPC Oil & Gas', 'Black and Veatch', 'Black and Veatch Corporation is a leading global engineering, consulting and construction company specializing in infrastructure development in the fields of energy, water and information. Founded in 1915, Black and Veatch serves its clients with conceptual and preliminary engineering services, engineering design, procurement, construction, financial management, asset management, information technology, environmental, security design and consulting, and management consulting services. It has an annual turnover of around U$ 3.5 billion and is listed 92 in the Forbes 500 list of largest private companies in the US for 2003. It is known for the highest quality design and construction work on a fast-track basis in more than 100 countries. Black and Veatch is headquartered in Kansas City, Missouri, USA, and maintains more than 110 offices worldwide. In a period of 115 years, Black and Veatch has implemented more than 35,000 projects all over the world for more than 6,100 clients. Major business sectors: Water and Power.', '3', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '9', '14', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Mumbai', 'Buyer Activities, Procurement, Gas, Oil ,EPC, Negotiation ,Construction ,Engineering ,buye,r mechanical ,rotating rotating, equipment ,pumps rotatory, compressors static,', '', '13', '58', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Minimum 8 Years of relevant work experience.<br />\r\nPrepares contract documents and bidders list. Prepares, issues and manages the bidding process. Leads and manages the evaluation process through the distribution of quotations, preparation of the commercial portion of the bid tabulation, and collaboration with engineering and construction regarding the technical and constructability evaluations. Makes recommendations for selected bidder(s) and who to award. Leads, and schedules, coordinates and manages the negotiation process. Able to resolve complex commercial terms and conditions exceptions. Manages the award and conforming process. Able to resolve mildly complex claim or dispute events with vendors. May lead the solicitation of budgetary pricing for equipment, material, or labor to support estimating/proposal efforts for a non-major project or projects. Proficient in the basic functions of the vendor database. Trains others in the function of a Procurement Representative, with minimal supervision. Files appropriate record documents and follows Corporate and project filing rules. May be responsible for developing set-up documents and processes for new project(s). May provide input to portions of new and/or revised procedures or documents. Individual contributor with no subordinates.', 'apply through jobsire.com', 'Any Graduate', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '11 April, 2017', '2017-04-11', 36, '2017-04-11 05:48:42', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3711336, 74820, 'Managing Consultant - Energy - Downstream  ', 'wipro', 'Wipro Ltd. (NYSE:WIT) is a leading Information Technology, Consulting and Outsourcing company that delivers solutions to enable its clients do business better. Wipro delivers winning business outcomes through its deep industry experience and a 360 degree view of \"Business through Technology\" - helping clients create successful and adaptive businesses. A company recognized globally for its comprehensive portfolio of services, a practitioner\'s approach to delivering innovation, and an organization wide commitment to sustainability, Wipro has a workforce of 140,000 serving clients across 61 countries.', '3', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '10', '15', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Bengaluru', 'Downstream - Oil and Gas (Mandatory) Process automation - Oil and Gas Project Management', '', '23', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'As a Senior Consultant in one of the industry verticals, you are responsible for developing strong client relationships and manage large engagements (single/multiple). You are responsible for developing and selling innovative value propositions within the product/practice space and drive real, measurable value for clients and for developing major accounts in consultation with Consulting Partners and Sales Teams. You should be able to manage a sub practice within the domain practice.<br />\r\n', 'FOR HELP PLEASE USE JOBSIRE.COM<br />\r\n', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '21 April, 2017', '2017-04-21', 26, '2017-04-21 07:25:56', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
