(3882548, 14999, 'Genpact Hiring For Multiple Voice Processes @ Hotel Vikram |1st April 2017', 'Genpact', 'Semi-Technical Voice-(Technical Graduates can also apply!)<br />\r\n Candidate should be able to solve the technical issues related to electronic products and provide solution for the same. <br />\r\n It is an inbound support for electronic products.<br />\r\nShift window - 6 a.m. - 12 p.m. ( Day Shift ) <br />\r\nJob Location - Gurgaon<br />\r\nCustomer Service-(Only Non-Technical Graduates can apply)<br />\r\n This is a knowledge centric process.<br />\r\n Candidates are expected to speak to customers and provide correct resolution within a specified time.<br />\r\n Provide Support in inbound call center related to insurance policies.<br />\r\n', '3', '90', '28 Jun, 2017', '0', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '', 'Gurgaon', 'domestic inbound Outbound Calling voice call center call centre customer support customer service Customer Handling Genpact Walk In', '', '9', '11', '', '', '', '', 'Skills Required<br />\r\n 1.Candidates should be flexible with timings<br />\r\n 2.Strong written and verbal communication skills required<br />\r\n 3.Prior experience into domestic or international voice will be an added advantage.<br />\r\n4.Ability to meet deadlines & work effectively with high quality levels<br />\r\n5.Team player and high energy level.<br />\r\n 6.Customer oriented and problem solving skills<br />\r\nYou can directly walk-in mentioning \'SHUBHI RAWAT\' on top of the resume.<br />\r\nCarry 2 copies of resume along with ID proof and 2 photographs', '', 'Genpact Hiring For Multiple Voice Processes @ Hotel Vikram, Lajpat Nagar | 1st April 2017<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a DIRECT WALK- IN Interview for GENPACT . No fee will be Charged from the candidates.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nYou can directly walk-in mentioning \'SHUBHI RAWAT\' on top of the resume.<br />\r\nHurry! We are Hiring FRESHERS / EXPERIENCED candidates for Multiple Domestic Voice Processes<br />\r\nYou can directly walk-in mentioning \'SHUBHI RAWAT\' on top of the resume.<br />\r\n', 'Venue-Hotel Vikram, Outer Ring Road, Opposite Moolchand Metro Station, Lajpat Nagar, New Delhi. <br />\r\nNearest Metro station -Moolchand Metro Station<br />\r\nTime - 11:00 am-2:00 pm<br />\r\nDate - 1st April 2017<br />\r\nContact Person - Shubhi Rawat- 8527521228 <br />\r\nEmail ID - subhashini.rawat@genpact.com<br />\r\n', 'Education Qualification Required- B.Sc, BA, B.B.A, B.Com or any Graduate. Technical Graduates can only apply for the semi technical voice process', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '30 March, 2017', '2017-03-30', 48, '2017-03-30 04:20:34', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3933087, 74820, 'PHP Developers/Programmers', 'SibzSolutions ', '', '', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Pune, Maharashtra', 'XHTML, HTML 5, JavaScript, CSS, Ajax, jQuery, bootstrap, APIs and mod-rewriting,  Cake PHP, Yii and Laravel, ', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', 'Hands on experience in Core PHP is must. 2+ years of experience with PHP and familiar with XHTML, HTML 5, JavaScript, CSS, Ajax,jQuery, APIs and mod-rewriting.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-<br />\r\nExperienced candidate who has practically worked on E-commerce websites using the Core PHP.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-<br />\r\nExperience with on-line payments gateways, Affiliate management system, CMS referrals system will be an added advantage. Payment Gateway: PayPal, Authorize.net, Google Checkout, CCAVANUE.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-<br />\r\nVery good troubleshooting skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-<br />\r\nBuilding reusable and resalable products<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-<br />\r\nExcellent conceptual, analytical and programming skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-<br />\r\nCommunicating technical concepts to Project Managers, Clients, and other audiences of all technical levels in a team environment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-<br />\r\nPreference will be given if you hold working knowledge with on one of this Open Source like Drupal, Joomla, wordpress, OSCommerce.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-<br />\r\nPreference will be given if you hold working knowledge with on one of these MVC frameworks like Cake PHP, Yii, and Laravel. ', '', 'The candidates for senior development role will perform the following responsibilities:<br />\r\n1<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMentor and lead a team of junior developers.<br />\r\n2<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTake up system analysis, design, documenting responsibilities and get it done in time. He/ she should be able to perform code analyzing and reading exercises for current and previous projects.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3<br />\r\nThe Sr. developer will lead developers; Apart from this he will/ can be involved in the coding activities besides the team management role. All necessary support will be provided for smooth execution of projects. The senior developers will keep a track and reviews on existing projects to identify bottlenecks, bugs, performance issues and involve the team to study and learn from existing projects.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4<br />\r\nMust be able to advise ways and means to obtain performance metrics of applications and optimize applications.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n5<br />\r\nMust possess excellent attention to detail and be able to familiarize and quickly learn new Software/ framework/ languages/ technology with ease.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n6<br />\r\nMust be able to apply innovative thinking at work.<br />\r\n7<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood communication skills (spoken/written) will be a plus. ', 'For help please use jobsire.com', 'BE/ B. Tech/ M. Tech/ MCA/ MCS/ MCM', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '24 April, 2017', '2017-04-24', 23, '2017-04-24 07:28:51', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3976579, 74820, 'Requirement In Banking Back Office Operation & Finance', 'Orient Project Management India Services Pvt Ltd H', 'Company Name: Orient Project Management India Services Pvt Ltd Hiring For Back Office executive', '2', '90', '06 Jul, 2017', '0', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '', 'Mumbai ', 'Data Entry Data Extraction Data Staging Operations Research Back office Billing Back office Processing Back Office Operations', '', '10', '1', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Banking Operation<br />\r\nIn Bank- AXIS BANK,ICICI BANK,HDFC BANK,<br />\r\nProvide administrative and operational support to Bank Operations & Finance.<br />\r\nResponsible to coordinate with management and complete a variety of operational tasks, projects and reports to support the department needs.<br />\r\nMust be able to work independently to complete complex tasks and handle sensitive data/situations appropriately.<br />\r\nPrepare reports, records statistics regarding operations, personnel changes etc. to ensure employees receive accurate and consistent information.<br />\r\nResponsible for administrative functions including payroll, opening and sorting mail, WebEx, supply orders, vendor coordination, project follow-up and similar items.<br />\r\nAssist with the preparation of department meetings, events, and trainings.<br />\r\nAssist with budget preparation and control activities.<br />\r\nMay administer various programs, projects, and/or processes specific to Bank Operations.<br />\r\nMay serve as the administrative liaison within and outside the company regarding administrative issues related to purchasing, personnel, facilities and operations.<br />\r\nMay train and assist other employees.<br />\r\nPerform clerical and other duties as assigned<br />\r\nÂ§<br />\r\nSalary: 1.2 Lacs to 3.8 Lacs<br />\r\n Industry: Banking / Financial Services/ Back Office / Broking / Operations / Sale & Marketing<br />\r\n Functional Area: Financial Services, Banking, Investments, Insurance<br />\r\nSelection Process : Examination Basis Plus Interview.<br />\r\n Role Category: Mutual Funds/Fund Management/Asset Management<br />\r\n Key skills: Banking Operations Branch Banking bank<br />\r\n Education :- Graduates and Post Graduates (Any Stream)<br />\r\n Documents Required :- One Any ID Proof Xerox, One 10th Class Certificate Xerox, Two Passport Size Photographs and Updates C.V.<br />\r\nNow Can \'Walk In\' at Our Corporate office of given below.<br />\r\n Interview Timings: - 11:00 PM to 04:30 PM<br />\r\nQualification minimum: HSC, B.COM Graduate, Banking and insurance Any Post Graduate.<br />\r\n ', 'Email: tech1.lgstaffingsolution@gmail.comTelephone: 9702165887', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 April, 2017', '2017-04-07', 40, '2017-04-07 00:40:21', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(3982195, 74820, 'Head - HR Business Partner - IT Services', 'Target HR', '', '', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', 'IN', '', '', 'Bengaluru', 'HR Business Partner HR Head MIS Employee Relations Organization Development Statutory Compliance Performance Management Compensation and Benefits', '', '24', '32', '', '', '', '', '', '', '15+ Years of experience as a HRBP Function with a pleasing personality<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMajor Functional Deliverables to be:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Business HR<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Project Management<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Organization Development<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Employee Relations<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Merger & Acquisitions<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- MIS<br />\r\n<br />\r\nISMS Certification:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Statutory Compliance<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Policy and Process<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Learning and Development<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Performance Management<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Compensation and Benefits<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Employee Engagement Survey<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Departure Survey<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Talent Summit', '', 'Bachelor\'s', ' Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '24 April, 2017', '2017-04-24', 23, '2017-04-24 07:30:52', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
