(4046695, 74820, 'Software Development Engineer', 'Altizon Systems', '', '5', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '3', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Pune', 'Oracle SQLServer', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Writing code in Ruby-on-Rails and Javascript. Familiarity with technologies that we use such as Rails, Javascript, MongoDB and Hadoop is a huge bonus (If you are familiar with a different web technology stack and willing to adapt, do apply)<br />\r\nImplementing features end-to-end with full automation and high code quality.<br />\r\nBrainstorm and create new features based on the Datonis  architecture.<br />\r\nBuild necessary support infrastructure to monitor systems 247.<br />\r\nWork with a small, extremely talented and tightly-knit engineering team.<br />\r\nThe ideal candidate will have the following qualifications:<br />\r\nCandidates should have Computer Science/IT degree or MCS/ M.Sc(IT) with 4-6 years of industry experience in developing large scale distributed software systems<br />\r\nStrong computer fundamentals, data structures and algorithms<br />\r\nExperience with at least one OO programming language (Java/C++ etc.)<br />\r\nExperience with scripting  Shell/Python/Ruby etc.<br />\r\nStrong knowlege with working with Relational like Oracle, SQLServer,/Non-relational Databases like MongoDB, Cassandra<br />\r\nKnowledge of professional software engineering practices & best practices for the full software development life cycle, including coding standards, code reviews, source control management, build processes, testing, and operations<br />\r\nStrong sense of ownership, urgency, and drive<br />\r\nAbility to achieve stretch goals in a highly innovative and fast-paced environment.<br />\r\nAbility to communicate the ideas to both technical and non-technical audiences.<br />\r\nInterface with business teams and convert their business requirements to technical requirements.<br />\r\nWilling to work on all kinds of technologies and programming languages<br />\r\nCommon Sense<br />\r\n', 'Company Name: Altizon SystemsCompany Description: <br />\r\nAltizon Systems<br />\r\n <br />\r\nEmail: namita_nagarnaik@altizon.comTelephone: 2067903700', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '20 April, 2017', '2017-04-20', 27, '2017-04-20 07:17:46', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
