(4116800, 74820, 'FG Debutant: Hiring for Sales Trainee', 'Future Generali India Life Insurance Co. Ltd.', 'About US: Future Generali Life Insurance is a joint venture between three leading groups: Future Group - A leading retailer of India, Generali Group - A global insurance group that features among the top 50 largest companies of the world and Industrial Investment Trust Limited (IITL) - A leading investment company.<br />\r\nFuture Generali Life Insurance provides a complete range of simplified solutions for the financial security of customers and enterprises, including savings, family protection, Unit Linked Policies as well as group products<br />\r\nOur Journey So Far<br />\r\nFuture Generali Life Insurance, incorporated in September 2007, presence in 80 locations across the country. We have sourced over 11 lakh policies since inception, and aim towards being one of the most trusted insurers in India with assets under management of over Rs. 2,600 crore (as on February 2016). Over Rs. 1,400 crore capital has been invested in the company till date<br />\r\nRewards & Accolades<br />\r\n*	ISO 9001:2008 certification for the Investment Department in Feb 2014<br />\r\n*	The Asian Leadership Awards - Best Twitter Campaign Award, Dubai- October 2015<br />\r\n*	CIO 100 awards for IT Innovation & business value delivery, Sourcing Shogun Special Award, September 2015 <br />\r\n*	Silver EFFIE award in the financial services category in 2011 for marketing effectiveness during the Insurance week<br />\r\n*	Guinness World Record in Feb 2011 for the longest balloon chain during Insurance week<br />\r\n*	Top 100 CISO Award - May 2015', '150', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '0', '0', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Hyderabad', 'Direct Sales Sales Support team handling Agency Sales Agency Marketing business development sales', '', '29', '111', '', '', '', '', 'Management candidates who have completed their MBA/PGDBM in 2017', '', 'Future Generali India Life Insurance Company (FGILI) is looking for hiring fresh MBA/PGDM graduates for its newly launched FG Debutant Program. Selected candidates would be absorbed into roles of Certified Financial Planning Consultant/Asst. Sales Manager after successful completion of program.<br />\r\nFeatures of the Program:<br />\r\n21 days - Classroom training<br />\r\n60 days - On Job training<br />\r\n120 days - Probation period<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJob Description of Roles:<br />\r\nAsst. Sales Manager:<br />\r\nPrimary Responsibility is to recruit agents as per plan<br />\r\nActivate agents on a monthly basis as per given plan<br />\r\nEnsure Active Advisor productivity is maintained as per the plan <br />\r\nUnderstand, Monitor & Develop the Agents<br />\r\nGenerate Revenue and Acquire New Customers for Life Division<br />\r\nMandatory Attendance at all Meetings & Training Programs as decided from time to time by Management.<br />\r\nEnsure Joint Calls are made on a daily basis<br />\r\nReview with Reporting Manager on a Weekly Basis<br />\r\nConduct Meetings with reporting Agents on a ongoing basis.<br />\r\nComply with all the Policies and Procedures laid down by the Company<br />\r\nCertified Financial Planning Consultant:<br />\r\nEducate the Customer about the product<br />\r\nCold calling to arrange meetings with potential customers to prospect for new business<br />\r\nClose the leads assigned by the call center team<br />\r\nActivation of Maximize and Daily follow up and lead updation in Maximizer<br />\r\nCustomer Servicing <br />\r\nCollection of Renewals <br />\r\nAttending team meeting and sharing best practice with colleagues ', 'Madhur Kathpal<br />\r\nContact Company:Future Generali India Life Insurance Co Ltd<br />\r\nAddress:India Bulls Finance Center, 6th Floor, Tower 3.Senapati Bapat Marg, Elphinstone Road(W)MumbaiMUMBAI,Maharashtra,India 400013<br />\r\nWebsite:http://futuregenerali.in<br />\r\nReference Id:FG Debutant001', 'ANY GRADUATATE ', 'FORMAL', '', ''