(4353709, 74820, 'WALK - INs for HR Recruiter - Female / Male 25/26/27/28/29 -04 -2017.', 'Focus Energy Limited', 'Come up to Grab This Opportunity for  your Professional Growth . <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNote: Carry your updated resume with 10th, 12th, Graduation original certificates, Photographs & ID proofs. All documents in original are mandatory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1) Experience into manufacturing / construction industries and Consultancy background will be preferred.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2) The individual should be open to do 100% Recruitment both for Blue Collar & White Collar people.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3) He should be well versed in doing end to end recruitment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3) Should be able to Source and Interview Support, Mid managerial and Top Management positions and can do exhaustive reference verification.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4) Has to Plan and execute recruitment activities including placing job advertisements, resume screening, candidates short-listing and interviewing, to support manpower needs in line with the Company\'s business objectives.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n5) Proficient in sourcing, recruiting at all levels for technical and non technical positions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n6) Should be able to work under Pressure and Result Oriented.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n7) Should be analytically strong.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInterested candidates can share resumes or call on below details:', '', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '2', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '', 'Delhi NCR', 'Recruitment Screening Interviewing Sourcing HR Top Management mass mailing', '', '41', '41', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Come up to Grab This Opportunity for  your Professional Growth . <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNote: Carry your updated resume with 10th, 12th, Graduation original certificates, Photographs & ID proofs. All documents in original are mandatory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1) Experience into manufacturing / construction industries and Consultancy background will be preferred.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2) The individual should be open to do 100% Recruitment both for Blue Collar & White Collar people.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3) He should be well versed in doing end to end recruitment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3) Should be able to Source and Interview Support, Mid managerial and Top Management positions and can do exhaustive reference verification.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4) Has to Plan and execute recruitment activities including placing job advertisements, resume screening, candidates short-listing and interviewing, to support manpower needs in line with the Company\'s business objectives.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n5) Proficient in sourcing, recruiting at all levels for technical and non technical positions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n6) Should be able to work under Pressure and Result Oriented.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n7) Should be analytically strong.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInterested candidates can share resumes or call on below details:', '', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '21 April, 2017', '2017-04-21', 26, '2017-04-21 07:26:51', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(4359646, 74820, 'Application Engineer - PHP & JavaScript, Webservic', 'Prolim Corporation', '', '5', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '8', '12', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'United States of America', 'Cake OOPs framework', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Become an expert in our Facilities Business Applications and Products and provide effective technical   consultation to end users and product team.<br />\r\nWork with product team to define proper hand-off for Production operations.<br />\r\nUpdate FB App Store with latest builds.<br />\r\nBe the point of contact interfacing with customers, to provide first level of triage and enhancement requests.<br />\r\nManage technical and product issues and escalations.<br />\r\nHelp scale engineering support with Facilities growth.<br />\r\nWork directly with product team to resolve technical issues, build, drive and improve our products and processes.<br />\r\nWith product team alignment, write production code that will enhance our products.<br />\r\nBuild product insights from developer experience/sentiments and work with cross-functional partners to take appropriate action.<br />\r\nDeliver data-driven, impactful results.<br />\r\nBuild understanding about the wide variety of software across the Facebook platform stack at a deep engineering level.<br />\r\nIdentify additional opportunities for measurement, to monitor health and success of our applications.<br />\r\nComply with release management policies to ensure data integrity and system stability.', 'Company Name: Prolim CorporationCompany Description: <br />\r\nProlim CorporationEmail: devaiah.tholanda@prolim.comTelephone: 8067364411', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '26 April, 2017', '2017-04-26', 21, '2017-04-26 08:11:42', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(4417101, 74820, 'Technical Developer C++', 'TATA CONSULTANCY SERVICES', 'Just as an organization needs the right talent to drive its business objective, people need the right environment to grow and achieve their career goals. The moment you step into TCS, you would be greeted with that unmistakable feeling of being at the place. Along with that, working with TCS affords you with a sense of certainty of a successful career that would be driven by boundless growth opportunities and exposure to cutting- edge technologies and learning possibilities.', '3', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '4', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Pune', 'C++,Multithreading,UNIX,SED,AWK', '', '23', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<br />\r\n>Development experience in C++, specifically STL, templates and structures<br />\r\n<br />\r\n>Knowledge of RTOS, specifically vxWorks<br />\r\n<br />\r\n>Working Experience in Embedded Systems<br />\r\n<br />\r\n>Worked on Memory Management and Code Optimization<br />\r\n<br />\r\n>Development of device drivers and communication protocols<br />\r\n<br />\r\n>Knowledge of design patterns<br />\r\n<br />\r\n>Worked on GUI development using Tilcon<br />\r\n<br />\r\n>Excellent analytical and problem solving skills<br />\r\n<br />\r\n> Good knowledge of dynamic systems', 'FOR HELP PLEASE USE JOBSIRE.COM', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '24 April, 2017', '2017-04-24', 23, '2017-04-24 05:30:39', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(4430631, 74820, 'Project Assistant', 'CAREERS AT USC', 'USC is a leading private research university located in Los Angeles â€“ a global center for arts, technology and international business. As the cityâ€™s largest private employer, responsible for more than $5 billion annually in economic activity in the region, we offer the opportunity to work in a dynamic and diverse environment, in careers that span a broad spectrum of talents and skills across a variety of academic schools and units. As a USC employee, you will enjoy excellent benefits and perks, and you will be a member of the Trojan Family - the faculty, staff, students and alumni who make USC a great place to work. Think youâ€™ve got what it takes to join us? We invite you to search our open positions and apply!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n', '2', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '1', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'Los Angeles,California', ' Knowledge of data collection procedures and some experience with proposal preparation and production of technical documents', '', '23', '123', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<br />\r\nThe USC Department of Surgery Research Division is recruiting a Project Assistant to assist with coordination of research study participant activities and collection of pertinent information from study participants.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Project assistant with also assist with data collection for a project or study and assists with research center or project administrative functions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n', ' FOR HELP PLEASE USE JOBSIRE.COM<br />\r\n', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '24 April, 2017', '2017-04-24', 23, '2017-04-24 05:29:04', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(4444431, 74820, 'City Head - E-commerce/ Retail', 'Acceleration StaffingVendor Management (India) Pvt', '', '4', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '3', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', 'IN', '', '', 'Delhi ', 'Sales, Relationship Management, Business Development, Operations City Head, City Manage, P&L ecom retail,', '', '30', '116', '', '', '', '', 'B.E./B.Tech./MBA from Tier I/Tier II Colleges only <br />\r\nShould have 4-8 yrs of relevant work experience in Sales or Marketing or Operations from a E-com/ Food delivery / retail industry.<br />\r\nA competent decision-maker with the ability to create and execute a strategic sales and marketing plan for the region <br />\r\nA self-motivated individual who derives their source of energy from people and ideas and knows how to get the best from the available resources <br />\r\nIdentifies, builds and uses a wide network of contacts with people at all levels, internally and externally <br />\r\nGood Communication and interpersonal skills in English and vernacular language.<br />\r\nWillingness to travel<br />\r\n', '', '1.	Responsible for sustaining and growing the city\'s revenues with P&L responsibilities <br />\r\n2.	Developing & ensuring execution of Operational Processes to efficiently operate and grow the business <br />\r\n3.	Leading the Sales team in initiating new accounts and managing relationships with existing ones thereby ensuring a healthy mix of partners. <br />\r\n4.	Laying down the roadmap for new account acquisition for the city and ensuring its execution.<br />\r\n5.	Strategizing and executing all account related initiatives from operational troubleshooting to activations.<br />\r\n6.	Maintaining a strong relationship with partners and being the face of the Organisation in the business community.<br />\r\n7.	Leading the Operations team in delivering the best Customer experience. <br />\r\n8.	Manage the administration function and operational performance reporting, streamlining processes and systems wherever possible.<br />\r\n9.	Performing ad-hoc analysis and reports based on business needs.<br />\r\n10. Responsible for managing the City team from hiring and training new recruits to assigning targets and formulating incentive plans as well as career planning for each member of the team ', 'Interested candidates may send in their resumes for the further process. Should you need more clarifications, please feel free to call. Ranjith<br />\r\nTelephone:09840377667', 'ANY GRADUATATE ', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '11 April, 2017', '2017-04-11', 36, '2017-04-11 05:59:00', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
