(6142062, 74820, 'Back Office Executive', 'capital life research', 'Company Name: capital life researchCompany Description: <br />\r\nWe are Growing Financial Advisory Company based in Indore .looking for fresh/exp. talent for BA/SBA/TL. Salary- Best in Industry Call for Interview Date & Time. For more detail visit our website<br />\r\n ', '2', '90', '06 Jul, 2017', '0', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', 'IN', '', '', 'Indore', 'Skills: Back Office Support Communication Skills HR Policy Sales Trading Financial Sales Team Handling', '', '10', '4', '', '', '', 'Interested candidates can contact: 9407566518 ( HR Pooja)<br />\r\nCapital Life Research Company<br />\r\nVijay Nagar (Indore)<br />\r\n', 'Experience: min 1 year<br />\r\nDesired: Excellent communication and leadership qualities<br />\r\n', '', 'Hi,Greetings from Capital Life Research Pvt. Ltd.!!<br />\r\nWe are hiring for below mentioned profiles :<br />\r\n1. Research Analyst (Trainee) : 2<br />\r\nQualification : Graduation<br />\r\nDesired : Excellent communication skills, Learning ability, Zeal to administer.<br />\r\n2. Human Resource (Trainee) : 1<br />\r\nQualification : MBA (HR)<br />\r\nDesired : Excellent communication skills, Patience and dedication towards human resource management, Problem solving skills, Team work ability.<br />\r\n3. Sales (Trainee) : 50<br />\r\nQualification : Graduation<br />\r\nDesired : Analytical and management ability, Excellent communication ability.<br />\r\n4. Senior Business Development Executive : 30<br />\r\nExperience: 6 months to 1 year<br />\r\nDesired: Excellent communication skills, goal oriented, team working<br />\r\n5. Team leader/ Senior team leader: 10<br />\r\nExperience: min 1 year<br />\r\nDesired: Excellent verbal communication, team handling, leadership<br />\r\n6. Floor Manager: 3<br />\r\n', 'Email: hr.ksrajput09@gmail.comTelephone: 9407566518', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 April, 2017', '20