(6797158, 74820, 'Salesforce Developer', 'BIDONHOMES DOTCOM PRIVATE LIMITED', 'We are software development company having head office in USA. India office of Bidonhomes.com is software development center of Bidonhome.com. Bidonhomes.com is web application oprational in USA <br />\r\nfor conducting online auctions of properties.', '1', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '3', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Gurgaon', 'salesforce saas sales team sales application development marketing j query Salesforce Developer SFDC salesforce.com Developer visualforce apex', '', '23', '40', '', '', '', '', '4+ years of experience developing on the Salesforce.com platform (Lightning Components development, declarative development, Process Automation, VisualForce, JavaScript, Apex) * Experience with partner products in the AppExchange marketplace<br />\r\nProven ability in successfully understanding and capturing business requirements, Strong collaboration, communication and leadership skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3+ years web application development experience including HTML, JavaScript, and CSS<br />\r\nSolid knowledge of Lightning and Lightning communities<br />\r\nStrong oral and written communication skills<br />\r\nAbility to work independently and as part of a team<br />\r\nExperience with Agile development practices<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCertified Force.com Developer or other Salesforce.com certifications a plus<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBasic understanding of project management principles<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbility to interpret business requirements and to accurately estimate workloadlevWe are looking for a Salesforce Developer who will be responsible for implementing, testing, and deploying solutions using Apex and Visualforce, and possibly leveraging other technologies. Must be able to speak and write in English language fluently. The proper candidate will have significant experience in custom implementations of the application in both SF classic and Lightning including, but not limited to, custom workflows, integrations, storage management, reporting and dashboards.', '', 'We are looking for a Salesforce Developer who will be responsible for implementing, testing, and deploying solutions using Apex and Visualforce, and possibly We are looking for a Salesforce Developer who will be responsible for implementing, testing, and deploying solutions using Apex and Visualforce, and possibly leveraging other technologies. Must be able to speak and write in English language fluently. The proper candidate will have significant experience in custom implementations of the application in both SF classic and Lightning including, but not limited to, custom workflows, integrations, storage management, reporting and dashboards.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nResponsibilities:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDesign, develop, test, document, and deploy high quality business solutions on the Force.com platform.<br />\r\nServe as a subject matter expert on Salesforce technology, and common AppExchange tools<br />\r\nBuild and manage dashboards, views, and report<br />\r\nDesign and develop workflows and assignment rules to automate manual processes<br />\r\nCreate and maintain system-related documentation, such as business requirements, process flows, data maps, configuration worksheets, etc.<br />\r\nDefine the scope of the project and interpret documented requirements.<br />\r\nParticipate in the process of implementing improvements and new functionality in the application.<br />\r\nIntegrate data-driven processes as well as create and maintain reports / dashboards.<br />\r\nImprove and evolve existing technical processes<br />\r\nProficiency in using Apex for use in<br />\r\nVisualforce pages and component controllers<br />\r\nAbility to implement and test Triggers<br />\r\nSandbox deployment strategies and Test coverage<br />\r\nCapable of comprehending existing code<br />\r\nProcess automation experience (workflow, Process Builder, etc.)<br />\r\nPerform ongoing Salesforce administration<br />\r\nSalesforce Advanced Developer Certification is preferred', 'Hemant<br />\r\nTelephone:91-124-4599637', 'ANY GRADUATATE ', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '19 April, 2017', '2017-04-19', 28, '2017-04-19 06:57:48', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(6799544, 74820, 'Software Developer - ASP.Net MVC C# 3+ Years', 'We4its ', '', '', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '3', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Hyderabad, Telangana', '    Visual Studio 2013     C#.NET 4/4.5     .NET MVC 4/5     SQL Server / NoSQL DB     Entity Framework 5/6     JSON     Ajax     JQuery     JavaScript     CSS', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Responsibilities & Skills Required**<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWeâ€™re urgently looking for a very good experienced ASP.NET MVC 4/5 C# developer for a UK base company which is currently operating in Chennai. The successful candidate must have hands on experience and worked on a commercial product recently.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe candidate must have ability to understand the business requirements in Finance/Accounting domain and carrying out technical business analysis. Highly anticipated to deliver agile software solutions using Microsoft technologies and ensure the development life cycle, standards, documents and sharing knowledge on all development.', 'For help please use jobsire.com', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '19 April, 2017', '2017-04-19', 28, '2017-04-19 07:02:01', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(6827128, 74820, ' IT Systems Developer', ' Hennepin Health', '', '2', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '4', '13', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', ' Downtown Minneapolis', 'SQL development Microsoft SQL, SSIS, SSRS, Data warehouse techniques and concepts, Software development', '', '23', '123', '', '', '', '', '', '', ' With moderate guidance, modifies applications programs from detailed specifications.  Analyzes, codes, tests, debugs, documents, and maintains those programs and interfaces.  This level is staffed by individuals who have had sufficient educational background and/or experience to qualify them to start in applications programming.   Position uses problem-solving skills to determine the programming effects on existing systems.  Position is able to identify problems and recommend corresponding solutions', 'FOR HELP PLEASE USE JOBSIRE.COM', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '12 April, 2017', '2017-04-12', 35, '2017-04-12 05:20:06', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(6855865, 19170, 'Sr. PHP Developer', 'Cybernext private limited', 'Cybernext is a leading information technology company that provides highly qualitative, timely delivered and cost-effective IT services to wide variety of global clients. It offers a wide range of creative solutions that are designed to meet specific business needs.<br />\r\nCybernext provides end-to-end business solutions that leverage technology. We provide solutions for a dynamic environment where business and technology strategies converge. Our approach focuses on new ways of business combining IT innovation and adoption while also leveraging an organizationâ€™s current IT assets.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCybernext possesses result oriented team working with right technology for right work assuring total quality with accuracy and high value returns. Our Research & Development Department continuously explore new technologies to give our clients the best, generating a high level of satisfaction in them.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCybernext provides wide range of Software and Web Services that deliver real business results. We work with global clients and new generation technology companies to build new products or services and to implement prudent business and technology strategies in todayâ€™s dynamic digital environment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe are staying on pace with the fast evolving development tools and technologies available in the market today. Cybernext employees are the cream of the talent crop. Because of our experience, the tools we have evolved, and our talented engineers, we can develop quality, customized solutions very quickly. When we have deadlines to meet, we ensure the deadline is met.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur development team provides customized solutions to include specific business requirements to existing solutions. We have experience backed up by completing number of commercial projects related to different business sectors.<br />\r\nWe provide value to our customers by offering several benefits to them including speed to market, high quality people and processes, cutting edge technology expertise and a full service portfolio.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHard work, attitude and dedication, these are not just words for the members of the Cybernext family, they actually implement it. Five days work culture is what Cybernext follows. ', '1', '90', '06 Jul, 2017', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', 'IN', '', '', 'Mohali', 'php, wordpress, codegnitior, magento, joomla, laravel', '', '23', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<br />\r\nCandidate should have experience in PHP, wordpress, codegnitior & other CMS/frameworks.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCandidate must have good communication skills with leadership skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCandidate should be able to understand well project requirements & get work done through others & guide others as well as self involvement.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCandidate must have experience in team handling.', 'Share your CV at hr@cybernext.io', '', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 April, 2017', '2017-04-07', 40, '2017-04-06 22:55:56', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
