f REST,SOAP architecture principles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther Skills & Qualification:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Excellent problem-solving and logical thinking.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Self motivated with strong work ethics.', '', '', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 April, 2017', '2017-04-07', 40, '2017-04-07 00:27:35', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
