017-04-13 05:10:27', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(7075236, 74820, 'Asp.Net Developer', 'IBIZZ TECHNOLOGIES', '', '3', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '', 'Jaipur', 'ASP.Net MVC ASP.Net MVC', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'We are looking for energetic ASP.NET Developers with strong background in building scalable, high-quality and high-performance web applications.<br />\r\nMust have 1-3 years of experience in developing web applications using ASP.NET (C#) and MS SQL/ MS Access/ My SQL.<br />\r\nMandatory Skills Set (Must be expert in all of these): MVC, WCF, SQL Server, ASP .NET, , JavaScript , JavaScript, Web Services<br />\r\nGood Knowledge of HTML, CSS3, JavaScript, jQuery<br />\r\nGood to have knowledge in OOPS/Design Patterns/ MVC.<br />\r\nWeb Services (Web API /WCF http restful)<br />\r\nWeb Scripting Languages (HTML, AJAX, JavaScript and J-Query)<br />\r\nExperience in Developing Web Based Applications from scratch to end.<br />\r\nExpertise in Javascript and use of JQuery in a commercial environment.<br />\r\n', 'Email: info@ibizztech.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 7073063573', '', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '13 April, 2017', '2017-04-13', 34, '2017-04-13 05:14:13', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
