(7603762, 74820, 'Mobile Application Developer - Android/ iOS/ Hybrid, Exp. 2 - 5 yrs, at Andheri', 'VNT solutions', '', '5', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '2', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Thane, Mumbai / Navi Mumbai / Thane', 'Senior Mobile Application Developer IOS Android application development mobile app development Android Mobile Applications Objective C Android IOS Application Development Software Development mobile application Core Java Android Android SDK', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Dear Candidate, <br />\r\n<br />\r\n \"We have Opening for Mobile Application Developer - Android/ iOS/ Hybridâ€<br />\r\n <br />\r\nCompany Name: - <br />\r\nP. S. P. L. is an IT services firm based in Mumbai, India intently serving the needs of all segment businesses related to Real Estate Construction Companies. Our core competencies are Oracle EBS based ERP Implementation, Post Implementation Support and Services, Training and Education, Licensing, BPO, IT Infra & Solutions. Our team of highly skilled professionals works round-the-clock to assure the timely delivery of your applications. We provide solutions that match your budget and schedule so that you cut to market. Dozens of satisfied clients have come to trust and depend on PIPL to deliver solutions they need to move their business forward with confidence<br />\r\n Our development and implementation group has worked in all settings, from small businesses with little or no computerization to large corporations with highly structured IT departments. Our experience in developing bolt-ons and implementation means that consulting recommendations are both practical and technically possible.<br />\r\n <br />\r\n <br />\r\nJob Profile: - Mobile Application Developer in (Hybrid, Android & IOS)<br />\r\n <br />\r\nExperience: - Above 2 - 5 years (Hybrid, Android & IOS)<br />\r\n <br />\r\nCTC: - 3 LPA - 5 LPA (Depending upon Experience & knowledge)<br />\r\n <br />\r\nJob Location: Andheri - E, Mumbai.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nIndustry Experience: IT Sector<br />\r\n <br />\r\nFunctional Area: IT Software - Application Programming , Maintenance<br />\r\n <br />\r\nEducation: Any Graduate / BE / MCA / MCS / M.Sc. / BCA / BSC<br />\r\n <br />\r\n <br />\r\nRole & Responsibilities:<br />\r\n <br />\r\nÂ· Should have knowledge of Android and IOS<br />\r\nÂ· Experience in Android and IOS fragments<br />\r\nÂ· Knowledge in Core Java is preferable<br />\r\nÂ· Excellent understanding of the full mobile development life cycle<br />\r\nÂ· Experience with third-party libraries and APIs<br />\r\nÂ· Knowledge in Google Mobile Ads SDK and In-App Billing API<br />\r\nÂ· Strong debugging skills<br />\r\nÂ· Troubleshooting of issues and improving application performance<br />\r\nÂ· Knowledge of Hybrid platform - Ionic is Mandatory.<br />\r\n <br />\r\nIf you are interested and suitable to this Job Profile, Job Location, Offered Salary, then pls do revert on this same mail with Updated CV in word Format along with below details:<br />\r\nÂ· Relevant Exp.:-<br />\r\nÂ· Current Salary:-<br />\r\nÂ· Expected Salary:-<br />\r\nÂ· Notice Period:- <br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\n Regards,<br />\r\n HR â€“ Monali.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n VNT-Solutions<br />\r\n Landline No.:- 022 - 41239713<br />\r\n', 'Email: resume@vnt-s.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 7718808918', 'BACHELOR\'S', 'FORMAL', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '18 April, 2017', '2017-04-18', 29, '2017-04-18 06:27:29', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
