(8671331, 35270, 'TECHNICAL SUPPORT EXECUTIVE- U.S VOICE PROCESS, CALL 7087088690', 'Geeks Technical Support', 'Geeks Technical Support is an independent provider of technical support services for brands like Dell, HP, Asus, Microsoft, Canon and many others. Use of names and trademarks are for reference only. Geeks Technical Support is a global company employing technicians across US and India. Our team of computer experts and specialists are happy to cater to our customers and resolve issues to serve customer needs! Geeks Technical Support is the next-generation computer support service provider for consumers and small businesses in United States, Canada, United Kingdom and Australia. We use our tools to cater to the needs of our customers and help them with each and every kind of technical issue.<br />\r\n ', '50', '30', '06 May, 2017', '0', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', 'IN', '', '', 'CHANDIGARH, MOHALI', 'Tech Support , Technical Support, Tech Sale, Technical Sale, International voice process, US process, Technical, Sales, Inbound Calls, Inbound Upselling, International call center, International BPO, Fresher', '', '9', '32', '', '', '', '', 'Key Activities:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nÂ· Provide technical support to international customers through REMOTE.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nÂ· Providing technical support related to any of the product lines like computers, laptops, Operating System (Windows, iOS, Android), browser, email, chat, anti-virus, firewall, router, printer, scanner, computer hardware etc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience: 0-5 years in International Process.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWalk In Days: Monday - Friday<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInterview Timings: 12 - 9 PM<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContact Person: Shashi kant / Sanjeev Sharma/ Gagan Kaur Gill<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMail Id: hr@geekexperthelp.com<br />\r\n<br />\r\nContact No.: 01724661486/7087088690 /7087216800 / 9876983850 / 9878994308<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAddress: SCO 142 - 143, Level 2, Above DHL Office, Sector 34A, Chan