(14144006, 45185, 'Branch Sales Officer / Current Accounts Sales Officer', 'Focus Ideas', '', '50', '0', '', '0', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Kolkata, Patna, Bhubaneswar, Chandigarh, ', 'Knowledge of Branch Sales Officer / Current Accounts Sales Officer', 'http://www.focusideas.co.in', '29', '110', '', '', 'Y', 'SALARY RANGES	Qualification 	Category 	Years Of Exp 	Salary pa (Rs) <br />\r\nGraduate 	Fresher 	0	           1,20,000 <br />\r\nGraduates   	Experienced 	1 year - 3 years 	           1,44,000 <br />\r\nGraduates 	Experienced 	3 years + 	           1,56,000 <br />\r\nPost Graduates 	Fresher 	0	           1,44,000 <br />\r\nPost Graduates 	Experienced 	1 year - 3 years 	           1,68,000 <br />\r\nPost Graduates 	Experienced 	3+ years 	           1,80,000 <br />\r\n<br />\r\n', 'KEY JOB RESPONSIBILITIES<br />\r\n1) Quality acquisition of Current Account & Saving Account for Resident / Non-resident Indian by going out into the market & catchment area.<br />\r\n2) Ensure quality sourcing of new customer to sell different banking product like Demat Account, Life Insurance, Credit Card etc<br />\r\n3) Penetration of Fixed Deposit to existing & new customers<br />\r\n4) Generate leads of customer through referral, meeting branch walk-ins customer, associates, e-mailing, direct mailing, ATMs & cold calls in the catchment area.<br />\r\n5) Ensure quality customer service is delivered<br />\r\n6) Meeting productivity norms as defined through support of channels & own efforts<br />\r\n7) Strictly adhere & maintain KYC norms compliance<br />\r\n8) Adhere the norms, regulation & practices of banks religiously<br />\r\n', '', 'POSITION	Branch Sales Officer / Current Accounts Sales Officer<br />\r\nFUNCTION	RETAIL BRANCH BANKING<br />\r\nREPORTING	MENTOR (Branch Head / Assistant Branch Manager)<br />\r\nLOCATION	HDFC Bank Branch<br />\r\nPERIOD OF EMPLOYMENT	Permanent<br />\r\nOBJECTIVE: Providing support to branch profitability by selling bank products through different acquisition channels in the catchment area.<br />\r\nKEY JOB RESPONSIBILITIES<br />\r\n1) Quality acquisition of Current Account & Saving Account for Resident / Non-resident Indian by going out into the market & catchment area.<br />\r\n2) Ensure quality sourcing of new customer to sell different banking product like Demat Account, Life Insurance, Credit Card etc<br />\r\n3) Penetration of Fixed Deposit to existing & new customers<br />\r\n4) Generate leads of customer through referral, meeting branch walk-ins customer, associates, e-mailing, direct mailing, ATMs & cold calls in the catchment area.<br />\r\n5) Ensure quality customer service is delivered<br />\r\n6) Meeting productivity norms as defined through support of channels & own efforts<br />\r\n7) Strictly adhere & maintain KYC norms compliance<br />\r\n8) Adhere the norms, regulation & practices of banks religiously<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCOMPETENCIES REQUIRED<br />\r\nHonesty & integrity	Go getter attitude<br />\r\nHard & smart working	Ability to convince & influence<br />\r\n <br />\r\nPREFERABLE	TWO WHEELER WITH VALID LICENCE<br />\r\n	LOCAL RESIDENCE<br />\r\n <br />\r\nEDUCATION / QUALIFICATION	GRADUATE & ABOVE<br />\r\nWORK EXPEREINCE	EXPERIENCED & FRESHER <br />\r\n <br />\r\nSALARY RANGES	Qualification 	Category 	Years Of Exp 	Salary pa (Rs) <br />\r\nGraduate 	Fresher 	0	           1,20,000 <br />\r\nGraduates   	Experienced 	1 year - 3 years 	           1,44,000 <br />\r\nGraduates 	Experienced 	3 years + 	           1,56,000 <br />\r\nPost Graduates 	Fresher 	0	           1,44,000 <br />\r\nPost Graduates 	Experienced 	1 year - 3 years 	           1,68,000 <br />\r\nPost Graduates 	Experienced 	3+ years 	           1,80,000 <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDOCUMENTS REQUIRED TO GENERATE APPOINTMENT LETTER	1	UPDATE RESUME<br />\r\n	2	DATE OF BIRTH CERTIFICATE (photo copy)<br />\r\n	3	MARKSHEET â€“ 10th, 12th & GRADUATION (photo copy)<br />\r\n	4	VAILD ID PROOF â€“  PAN CARD, AADHAR CARD is must.<br />\r\n	5	VALID ADDRESS PROOF â€“ UTILITY BILL, PASSPORT, BANK STATEMENT (photo copy)<br />\r\n	6	RELEIVING LETTER (IF WORKED / WORKING)<br />\r\n	7	PASSPORT SIZE COLOUR PHOTO (RECENT)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf interested, send updated CV in word file & passport size photograph to career.focusideas@gmail.com Or  call 08961795851<br />\r\n<br />\r\n', 'Interest candidate are apply.', 'Any Graduate ', 'No Require.', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '05 January, 2017', '2017-01-05', 132, '2017-01-05 05:23:12', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(14503938, 0, 'Urgent Hiring For Rm-sales', 'Cybersol Technologies Private Limited', '', '1', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '1', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Delhi', 'sales business Development ', '', '10', '116', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Acquisition of quality clients through networking, data base, market intelligence and references from existing clients.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2. Generating Leads through cold calling and references.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3. Identifying customer needs, assessing their risk appetite and providing them investment solutions through financial planning.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4.Introduce new clients to Relationship Manager Dealing for hassle free transactions and trading services.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n5. Conduct activities for Client Acquisition and Financial Planning.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n6. Ensure compliance as per various regulator and organization guidelines.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n7. Develop and maintain a long term relationship with customers to maintain a high level of retention of client base.', '    Company Name: Cybersol Technologies Private Limited<br />\r\n    Email: careers@cybersol.in<br />\r\n    Telephone: 2228441054', 'Graduation', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '26 April, 2017', '2017-04-26', 21, '2017-04-26 06:53:25', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(14529791, 0, 'Legal And CS- Litigation', 'Waytogo Consultants', '', '1', '90', '02 Jul, 2017', '9', '13', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '5', 'IN', '', '', 'Mumbai ', 'Legal Compliance Litigation Drafting ', '', '10', '120', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Handling pan India litigations (Civil Court, Insurance Ombudsman, Consumer Forum, High Court), Labour Laws and IPR related disputes <br />\r\nArranging tie-ups with advocates on a pan India basis and coordinating with them, and finalizing legal strategies<br />\r\nDrafting of documentation such as replies to legal notices, written statements, affidavit of evidence, written arguments. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nCompliance: <br />\r\nImplementation of Insurance laws and applicable insurance related regulations<br />\r\nCarrying out Publication Reviews <br />\r\nReporting on Anti Money Laundering issues<br />\r\nEnsuring reporting to the Regulatory bodies like IRDA, RBI, FIU, ROC <br />\r\nEnabling investigations into fraud and non-compliances<br />\r\nCarrying out process audit from a legal and compliance perspective', 'Waytogo Consultants<br />\r\nEmail: navin@wtgconsultants.in<br />\r\nTelephone: 8657117700', '', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '03 April, 2017', '2017-04-03', 44, '2017-04-03 02:51:47', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(14716990, 74820, 'Mobile UI Developer', 'Provisions Group', '', '', '90', '12 Jun, 2017', '2', '5', 'Contract', 'USD 50 - 75 Per Hour', '0 - 3 Months', '', '', '', 'US', '', '', 'Nashville, TN', 'Apache Cordova, HTML5, Cross Platform Development, React / REACT.js, Python/Django and REST/Spring API are bonuses', '', '23', '123', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Immediate need for a UI Developer with a company local to Nashville. This is a 4-6 month contract position, working on a mobile application, with possibilities for extension. Work can be done remotely, and the schedule can be flexible for the right individual. The organization we are working with is looking to fill this need immediately! Unfortunately, we can not offer sponsorship with this opportunity.', '', 'Any Postgraduate and Graduate', 'Formal', 'H1B', 'W2-Permanant', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '14 March, 2017', '2017-03-14', 64, '2017-03-14 05:44:50', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(14963592, 0, 'Accountancy/Finance Recruitment Consultant', ' Ruth Moran Consulting', '', '1', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '2', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'West New York, NJ', 'Recruitment', '', '2', '61', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Accountancy/Finance Recruitment Consultants NEW YORK OTE Â£200,000 USD<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEXPERIENCE OF WORKING WITHIN RECRUITMENT IS ESSENTIAL.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOur client is a market leader in its sector. They have experienced over 100% growth year on year Based at their expanding New York site, they genuinely focus on offering a quality service to both clients and candidates, their aim being to provide the best candidates at all times for their clients via both a superb candidate database and a variety of marketing tools As a result of this they have some extremely strong markets and have significant connections to attract the very best.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor further information please contact Ruth Moran weekdays 8am-9pm or apply online. You can also visit the Ruth Moran Consulting website.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRuth Moran Consulting, founded in 1999, is one of the longest established recruitment to recruitment consultancies, working across the UK and Internationally. If you are an experienced recruitment professional looking for advice and guidance about the market and your next role, please do not hesitate to contact us in the strictest of confidence.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlease note we are only able to respond to Candidates who have Recruitment Agency experience. If you have not heard from us within three working days, unfortunately, on this occasion, your application has not been successful.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\'recruitment consultant\' \'senior recruitment consultant\' \'recruiter\' \'senior recruiter\' \'senior consultant\' \'HR\' \'Legal\' \'Accountancy and Finance\' \'Sales and Marketing\' \'Executive Search and Selection\' \'recruitment managerâ€™ \'branch managerâ€™ \'team leader\' \'recruitment branch managerâ€™ \'recruitment team leader\' \'recruitment regional managerâ€™ \'recruitment area managerâ€™ \'divisional managerâ€™ \'area managerâ€™ \'managerâ€™ \'recruitmentâ€™ \'Resourcer\' \'Researcher\'', 'Address: 10 Butts Ct, Leeds LS1 5JS, UK<br />\r\nPhone: +44 113 246 0062', 'Graduation', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '24 April, 2017', '2017-04-24', 23, '2017-04-24 05:25:12', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
