(22415516, 0, 'Senior Software Engineer Professional Services', 'Crossdomain Solutions Pvt. Ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'silverlight   Winforms    .Net', '', '23', '40', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Positions: 2<br />\r\nEducational Qualification: MCA/ BE/ M.Sc./ M.Tech.<br />\r\nExperience: Around 4-5 years of extensive programming experience on Microsoft technologies like ASP .Net, C# on .Net 3.5 and above framework.<br />\r\nJob Discription:<br />\r\n1.Analyze, design, develop, integrate and implement applications in an n-tier environment using Microsoft Technologies <br />\r\n2.Understand 3rd party integration, and build interfaces/connectors for the same with our current application <br />\r\n3.Develop, customize and debug solutions as per customer needs <br />\r\n4.Expert in Microsoft Developer Studio 2008/2010 <br />\r\n5.Maintaining enterprise design and coding standard. She/he should be from professional software development organization (preferably from product development company) using disciplined software development methodologies (SDLC) <br />\r\n6.Demonstrated ability to work independently and to meet tight timelines <br />\r\n7.Actively participate in the project planning and provide relevant input in terms of their assigned tasks <br />\r\n8.Demonstrated ability of being a key team player<br />\r\nDesired Profile:<br />\r\n1.Graduate from reputed institutes (preferably B.E/B.Tech) <br />\r\n2.Good Communication skills (Verbal & Written) <br />\r\n3.Good analytical and problem resolving skills <br />\r\n4.Should have multitasking skills <br />\r\n5.Should be independent to handle any tasks and self-learner<br />\r\nSkills and Qualifications:<br />\r\n1.Consulting exposure', 'Email: anvaikan_lawrence@cross-domain.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 8023016500', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '21 February, 2017', '2017-02-21', 85, '2017-02-21 08:19:29', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
