(22567791, 0, 'Mobile UI Developer', 'Technology Consultants Inc', '', '1', '90', '03 Jul, 2017', '5', '11', 'Contract', '', '3 - 6 Months', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'Seattle, WA', 'Mobile Application Devel', '', '23', '137', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Mobile UI Developer<br />\r\n3 positions available<br />\r\nSeattle WA- locals preferred; if you have someone who will relocate and interview via skype Iâ€™ll submit.<br />\r\n$75/hr W2 + benefits<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNo Visa Candidates! US Citizen/GC/TN only.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMinimum requirements:<br />\r\n5 years mobile development experience<br />\r\n1 year of senior/leadership experience<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJob Description:<br />\r\nResponsible for delivery across the entire IOs mobile application life cycle (Concept, design, deploy, test, and release to app store)<br />\r\nProvides team or technical supervision and drives project/service delivery.<br />\r\nPerforms as technical lead on software development projects with responsibility for overall delivery of software components.<br />\r\nDocuments design decisions, adheres to existing process guidelines, develops software components, mentors junior developers, executes testing, and has oversight during implementation into production.<br />\r\nResponsibilities:<br />\r\nConverts specifications about business problems into programming instructions. Designs and codes programs; creates test transactions and runs tests; revises as necessary.<br />\r\nConducts analysis of organizational needs and goals for the development and implementation of application systems.<br />\r\nReviews, analyzes, and modifies programming systems, including encoding, testing, debugging and installing for a large-scale system. Maintains records to document program development and revisions.<br />\r\nMonitors operating efficiency of existing application systems.<br />\r\nBasic Qualifications:<br />\r\nBachelors Degree<br />\r\nYears experience in Mobile Application development<br />\r\nYears experience as Senior Developer on IT Projects<br />\r\nYears experience in Application Development using Java, JEE, Linux<br />\r\niPhone specific Development<br />\r\nAndroid specific Development<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPreferred Qualifications:<br />\r\n7 Years experience in Application development<br />\r\n4 Year experience as Senior Developer on IT Projects<br />\r\nFamiliarity with commercial banking concepts is desired<br />\r\nMobile development experience (iPhone, Android)<br />\r\n', 'Shankar N Raj<br />\r\nTechnology Consultants Inc<br />\r\nFarmington, MI<br />\r\nwww.techconsultinc.com<br />\r\n +1-248-522-6879', '', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 April, 2017', '2017-04-04', 43, '2017-04-04 03:45:49', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
