(22779537, 0, 'Project Coordinator', 'Ascent', '', '1', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '5', '10', 'Contract', '', '3 - 6 Months', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'Pasadena, CA', ' MS Word, Project, Excel, PowerPoint and Visio.', '', '1', '37', '', '', '', '', '', '', '    Provides technical and administrative support to project manager(s).<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Formats documentation, including creation of templates and shell files.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Creations Adobe files and CDs as necessary.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Uses variety of software tools sufficiently to support all aspects of the project.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Responsible for final assembly and quality of printed materials.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Assists with logistics for arranging off-site and department meetings.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Assists in maintenance of libraries, databases and graphic management logs.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Assists with development of general graphic designs to enhance technical documents.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Ability to resolve problems without delay and/or to seek managerial intervention and operate under stressful, time-sensitive deadlines.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQualifications:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Experience Level: BA or BS preferred plus minimum 3+ years of direct relevant experience.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Expert knowledge of MS Word, Project, Excel, PowerPoint and Visio.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Exceptional Communication and Collaboration Skills Required.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Procurement and finance experience preferred.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Accelerated Implementation Methodologies (AIM) Certification preferred.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Limited Travel to NCAL; Pasadena Strongly Preferred, but NCAL candidates will be considered.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbout Ascent:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Ascent Services Group (ASG) is a nationally recognized technology staffing and consulting firm whose fundamental business is providing staffing services to Small, Medium, and Large Enterprise clients in our core market verticals: Financial Services, Healthcare, Technology and Life Sciences. As consultants for ASG, you will have access to many of the top clients within the industries we serve. Our goal is to deliver innovative talent through proven best practices and effective resource optimization. Become one of ASGâ€™s candidates and experience the difference!', '', '', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '17 April, 2017', '2017-04-17', 30, '2017-04-17 06:04:33', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
