(23289630, 48219, 'Hadoop Developer', 'Daiwik Business Solutions Pvt Ltd', '', '3', '0', '', '2', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Hyderabad, ', 'Development experience in design, implementation and deployment of any ETL tool to load data into Hadoop/NoSQL environment and exposure to UNIX / Linux programming language', '', '23', '79', '', '', 'Y', '', '', '', 'As a Hadoop developer, you will be responsible for strategic and tactical level activities associated with implementing and executing projects in Big Data environment. This role is for a hands-on big data analyst to support the business and work closely with business and technology team to provide scalable and robust big data solutions.<br />\r\n', '', 'Any Degree ', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '21 July, 2016', '2016-07-21', 300, '2016-07-21 02:14:18', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
