(25131637, 0, 'Financial Controller', 'Confidential Company', '', '1', '90', '05 Jul, 2017', '5', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'North Platte, NE ', ' financial reporting and understands the commodity industry.', '', '2', '47', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Embrace the opportunity to grow with<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nKAAPA Ethanol Holdings, LLC<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbrace the opportunity to grow with KAAPA Ethanol Holdings, LLC as we expand to our new office in Kearney. The ideal candidate for our Controller position will be proactive in leading the finance department, take the initiative on implementing process improvements and insuring proper internal controls. A detail oriented person that is responsible for financial reporting and understands the commodity industry. We reward high quality work and loyalty with excellent pay and a great benefits package. Bachelorâ€™s degree in Accounting required, 10-15 yearsâ€™ experience preferred. Please apply online at kaapaethanol.com or send your resume to: Jena Johnson at jjohnson@kaapaethanol.com 308-743-2217 ext. 248. EOE/Drug Testing Required', 'resume to: Jena Johnson at jjohnson@kaapaethanol.com 308-743-2217 ext. 248. ', '', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '06 April, 2017', '2017-04-06', 41, '2017-04-06 00:01:44', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
