\r\nGratuity<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEducation Assistance plan â€“ Annual entitlement of up to INR 24,000.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmployee / corporate discounts at majority of retail chains / hospitals / laboratories.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor telephonic interview or to inquire about more job openings, please connect with Convergys Hiring Specialist OR Walk-In at below mentioned address:-<br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nConvergys Recruitment Center:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nE2/10, 2nd Floor Malviya Nagar, Main Market, Opp Subway Shop above Jogur, Garment, New Delhi, Delhi 110017<br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nContact Details:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRohit-9999125126, Shruti-9999125128<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMohit.Kumra@convergys.com, dsg.mn@convergys.com', 'Email: mohit.kumra@convergys.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 9999125126', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 March, 2017', '2017-03-08', 70, '2017-03-08 03:46:31', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
