(26543907, 0, 'Online - Bidder', 'hr@weproinc.com', '', '', '0', '', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Mohali ( Chandigarh )', '', '', '23', '16', '', '', 'Y', '', '', '', 'mmediate requirement.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nProfile : Online Bidder<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Should have worked on oDesk, Elance, Freelancer, Guru<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Experience in handling Indian and International clients <br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Must be proficient in Proposal writing, keeping follow ups, requirement gathering, communication link between the development team & clients.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJob Responsibilities<br />\r\n<br />\r\n1-Experience: 1-3 Year in Bidding Profile<br />\r\n<br />\r\n2- Key Skills: Business Development (Especially Online), Online Bidding, BDE ( Elance, Odesk, Online Bidding)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n3-Generating business through above online freelancing portals, Excellent English in Read, Write and Verbal are important.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n4-Generating business through above online freelancing portals.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n5-Candidate should know to write proposals for projects without grammatical mistakes. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n6-Setup portfolio on websites and get projects through these websites and should be comfortable in client interaction. For more Information Contact us:<br />\r\nNote:: People with short notice period will be preferred (Maximum 15-30 days).<br />\r\nYou can also refer your friends and colleagues with same profiles who are looking for a job change .<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf interested please send your Updated CV along with the details mentioned below <br />\r\nhr@weproinc.com<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRel. Total Experience:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCurrent CTC :<br />\r\nExpected CTC :<br />\r\nNotice Period:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSignature:<br />\r\nWarm Regards<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSaryu Thakur ( H.R )<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWepro Solution<br />\r\nIndia<br />\r\nTel: 0172-4608444 / 7837074965<br />\r\nwww.weproinc.com<br />\r\n', '', ''