\n<br />\r\nM.Sc Oncological Nursing<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAdvanced Diploma Nursing & Health Sciences<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPG Diploma Acupuncture<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPG Diploma Clinical Cardiology<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPG Diploma HIV/AIDS<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiploma Cardio Thoracic Nursing<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDiploma Nursing', 'Email: hr@yogambpo.in<br />\r\nTelephone: 09840338044', '', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '23 March, 2017', '2017-03-23', 55, '2017-03-23 03:17:53', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(29653387, 0, 'Testing Engineer', 'XEAM Ventures Pvt Ltd.', '', '2', '90', '15 Jun, 2017', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '', 'Delhi', 'ISTQB certification    Any other Testing Certification. ', '', '23', '79', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'B.E./B. Tech. in Computer Science /Electronics and Communication / Information Technology from a recognized University/Institute with minimum 60% marks<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience in Function (System and End-to-End Testing), Performance, Conformance and Load Testing of one of the following products:<br />\r\n1) IP Multimedia Subsystem (IMS) and LTE (SIP, Diameter, HSS, CSCF, HSPA and HSPA+ etc)<br />\r\n2) Routers and Gateways ( terabit/gigabit Routers, Media/Signalling Gateway, SBC etc)<br />\r\n3) Class 4 and Class 5 Softswitch, IN (SSP , SCP, ISUP, INAP, TCAP etc)<br />\r\n4) 3G /2G (RNC, MSC, BSC, NodeB etc)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDesirable: <br />\r\n1) ISTQB certification / Any other Testing Certification.<br />\r\n2) Experience in Test Automation and Test scripting languages like TTCN3, Perl, bash etc<br />\r\n3) Experience in using Test Automation Tools like seagull, SIPP etc', 'Email: hr@xeamventures.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 1724360000', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '17 March, 2017', '2017-03-17', 61, '2017-03-17 02:35:32', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(29663538, 0, 'VP of Marketing: VC backed SaaS Technology Company', 'Tristaff Search', '', '1', '90', '25 Jun, 2017', '4', '13', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'San Diego, CA', 'marketing, (SEO) search engine optimization, paid search advertising, ', '', '1', '62', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'KEY WORDS: VP of Marketing, Marketing Director, Senior Director Marketing, Vice President Marketing, VP Strategy, SMB, B2B, sales collateral, Director of Online Marketing, Senior Director of Digital Marketing, Vice President of Digital Marketing, Customer Acquisition, Pre-IPO, Startup, digital strategy, analytics, big data, analytics platform, digital marketing, SaaS, B2B, enterprise software, SEO, SEM, paid search<br />\r\nJOB DESCRIPTION:<br />\r\nThriving Silicon Valley VC-Backed Startup based in San Diego is hiring a VP of Marketing to their leadership team! They are creating a disruptive technology within a $40B industry (in the U.S. alone) that addresses an underserved area with patented technologies that impact transportation, retail, and logistics for small and medium businesses.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn 2016, they achieved dramatic growth without a dedicated marketing team, so there is a lot of growth and impact potential for this new hire. They are seeking an expert in marketing and demand generation to help them scale customer acquisition and revenue growth in 2017 and beyond.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Senior Director/VP of Marketing will develop and implement their marketing strategy and translate their company goals into a demand generation plan with measurable objectives. The ideal candidate has an entrepreneurial spark and will take ownership and be able to deliver significant results with little guidance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis is a rare opportunity to be an early addition in a well-funded startup that is heralded to be San Diegoâ€™s next â€œtech startup unicornâ€, so please only apply if youâ€™re the type of visionary, roll-up-your-sleeves leader who would thrive in a fast-past startup environment.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf you are someone who wants to evoke positive change in the world using revolutionary technology, love to mobilize and motivate people, build inspired things, and solve difficult problems with likeminded peopleâ€¦ we want to hear from you!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo apply, send your resume for confidential review to Kanani Masterson (Click here to Apply). This is a full-time position based in San Diego, CA. Company will relocate qualified candidate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrimary Responsibilities:<br />\r\nâ€¢ Develop and implement strategic marketing plan that achieves their customer acquisition and revenue growth objectives.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Set lead generation goals and forecasts, budget spend, and measure results against plans. They are currently focused on paid search, and looking to move into more SEO and other marketing arenas.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Implement marketing tactics specific to the lead lifecycle stage.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Manage their portfolio of marketing and demand generation programs, including campaign management, email/drip marketing, (SEO) search engine optimization, paid search advertising, inbound/content marketing, and sales funnel optimization.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Establish processes to track metrics, and continually assess campaign and program performance against goals.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Manage agency partners, as well as build and manage in-house marketing team.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Work in with customer success and product development teams to collect customer insights to drive current and future marketing initiatives.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Create sales tools including videos, presentations, whitepapers, datasheets, infographics and campaigns.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSalary Range and Bonus Potential:<br />\r\nâ€¢ $160,000 to $220,000 base (depending on experience)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBenefits:<br />\r\nâ€¢ Significant Pre-IPO Stock Options/Equity<br />\r\nâ€¢ Comprehensive health benefits<br />\r\nâ€¢ Performance bonus<br />\r\nâ€¢ Relocation expenses for qualified candidate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJob Requirements:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nâ€¢ Must have minimum of 10 years in B2B or Technology Marketing experience, with focus in digital marketing.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Strong experience with modern demand generation techniques such as inbound marketing, search and display advertising, and email marketing.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Strong analytical and project management skills.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Hands-on experience using CRM systems, marketing automation platforms, website CMS, analytics and A/B testing tools.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Demonstrated ability to lead and work with marketing and sales teams.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Excellent writing skills.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Experience working in a fast-paced, start-up environment.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Experience in the software industry, especially SaaS.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Ideal Personality Traits: Strong analytical skills, collaborative and communicative, able to deal with uncertainty, committed to ethical behavior, ideally possess a positive and constructive sense of humor, Entrepreneurial nature, non-political, no-ego, pragmatic, level headed, proactive, able to herd cats<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEducational Requirements: Bachelorâ€™s degree in Business, Engineering or other technical discipline required. MBA degree preferred.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFOR OTHER OPPORTUNITIES AND TO REGISTER WITH TRISTAFF, PLEASE VISIT OUR WEBSITE AT www.tristaff.com', 'www.tristaff.com', '', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '27 March, 2017', '2017-03-27', 51, '2017-03-27 04:10:08', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(29691112, 37579, 'Android Developer', 'Vibrantappz Technolgies', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Chandigarh, Mohali', '', '', '23', '16', '', '', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Location: Chandigarh/Mohali<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAt Vibrantappz Technology Mohali<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe have opening for Android developers.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- JSON API implementation will be a plus point.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Google APIs and Map will be plus point.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSalary : upto-20,000 based on experience and skills.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nResponsibilities : App Layout Design, API integration, App Build APK, Testing and Bug Fixing,<br />\r\n', 'Interested can send cv at shikha.vibrantappz@gmail.com<br />\r\nContact us - 0172-456-2525', 'Any Graduate', 'No', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 February, 2017', '2017-02-08', 98, '2017-02-08 01:14:52', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
