(30301196, 0, 'Packaging Operator Line Maintenance', 'Baker Cheese', '', '1', '90', '20 Jun, 2017', '5', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'Saint Cloud, WI', 'Maintenance - Machines', '', '1', '56', '', '', '', 'Benefit package includes: Health insurance, life insurance, paid vacation/holidays, 401(k) profit sharing programs and a discretionary bonus program.<br />\r\n ', '', '', '2nd Shift<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDuties: operating equipment with frequent packaging film changes, maintenance of packaging equipment to keep machines operating efficiently.  Ability to read electrical schematics is preferred.  Second shift hours are approximately 2:00 pm to 1:00 am.  Schedule shifts are usually Monday - Friday with some weekend/non-production hours expected at various times during the year.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHourly wages starting at $21.55 an hour. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\nContact Information<br />\r\nNO PHONE CALLS PLEASE', 'Applications available at our facility and at www.bakercheese.com or by emailing careers@bakercheese.com to request that an application be emailed to you.', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '22 March, 2017', '2017-03-22', 56, '2017-03-22 01:27:33', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', '');
