(32854841, 74820, 'Telecom Engineer / Fresher Engineer : Immediate Joining', 'Edu Encrafters', '', '', '90', '12 Jun, 2017', '0', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '2', 'IN', '', '433979', 'Chandigarh', 'Telecom Engineer, RF, BTS, DT, fresher, Engineer, B.Tech, ECE, telecom, fresher jobs, Telecom, Telecommunication, Trainee walk', '', '24', '35', '', '', '', '', 'Only male Candidates willing to relocate any where in India can apply.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMale Candidates with B.E./B.Tech/ Diploma in Electronics & Communication (2014/15 and 2016 pass-outs) can apply<br />\r\nMust be physically fit & willing to relocate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nwill be responsible for various Telecom related RF/ wireless activities like survey, I&C etc', 'If Interested visit: B-57, III Floor, New Krishna Park,Near Janakpuri West Metro. 9654672651/ 965467', 'Urgently required Telecom Engineer/ Trainee<br />\r\nOWN PROJECT NOT CONSULTANCY', 'Send your resume hr@eduencrafters.com', 'Bachelor\'s degree in computer science', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '14 March, 2017', '2017-03-14', 64, '2017-03-14 03:32:56', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
