(36901511, 0, 'ASM , SALES OFFICERS VARIOUS LOCATION - WALL PAPER COMPANY', 'SIARAM LIBAAS', '', '1', '90', '07 Jun, 2017', '2', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '', 'Kolkata', 'Merchandising', '', '1', '80', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'We are looking for a well established, 20 years old Plywood ,Laminates and wall paper manufacturing company having plant near Delhi.Company\'s products are already available and well appreciated all over PAN India.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis job is for WALL PAPER DIVISION.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPOST & LOCATION :- ASMs and SALES OFFICERS FOR VARIOUS LOCATIONS PAN INDIA .<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJob Description :- Wall paper division is the new addition in company. So sales team is to develop distributors and dealers PAN India under guidance of Sales head .<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDesired candidate must be from WALL PAPER industry itself and from good brands such as \"Marshal\" etc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSalary no limit for a deserving candidate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSend resume clearly mentioning present salary drawn and details of area covered so far to - siaram.ps@gmail.com. Mention \"FOR WALL PAPER SALES - JOB LOCATION\" in e-mail subject matter.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nNote :- All levels sales candidates can apply, but only from WALL PAPER INDUSTRY. This is for all India sales openings.', 'Email: siaram.ps@gmail.com', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '09 March, 2017', '2017-03-09', 69, '2017-03-09 02:17:59', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
