(37312425, 0, 'back locks graduate puc has good opportunity for freshres', 'Career Dotcom Hiring For candiadtes', '', '2', '90', '21 Jun, 2017', '0', '0', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '2', 'IN', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'fresher graduate under graduate fresher graduate under graduate ', '', '9', '11', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Freshers openings for Day shift.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJD:<br />\r\nQualification:10+2/10+2+3/Any Graduate<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSkills: <br />\r\n- Flexible in shifts<br />\r\n- 6 days working<br />\r\n- Sunday off<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRequired languages:<br />\r\n- English+Tamil<br />\r\n- English+Telugu<br />\r\n- English+Kannada<br />\r\n- English+Hindi(Punjabi,Gujarati,Bengali)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWork Location: Hebbal<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWe required only Freshers.!!!<br />\r\nIf your interested please mail to the below details:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nRegards<br />\r\nDeepthi 8088934501<br />\r\ndeepthikv@careerdotcom.in', 'Deepthi 8088934501<br />\r\ndeepthikv@careerdotcom.in', '10+2', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '23 March, 2017', '2017-03-23', 55, '2017-03-23 03:07:05', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(37418108, 0, 'Sr. Business Systems Analyst (Finance/Trading)', 'Modis', '', '1', '90', '25 Jul, 2017', '5', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'El Segundo, CA', 'BRD, FRD and supplementary documentation. ', '', '41', '100', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Our client located in El Segundo, CA has an opportunity for a Sr. Business Systems Analyst to join their team. The ideal candidate will have prior experience within the Financial services industry in one or more of the following: Brokerage Services, Wealth Management, Advisory, trading platforms/systems, finance, online account services, cash management<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrinciple Responsibilities/Duties/Functions/Tasks:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nâ€¢ Formulates and defines system scope, objectives, and requirements through best practice disciplines, research and fact-finding, requirements elicitation techniques, combined with the knowledge of applicable business processes and systems and industry requirements when applicable.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Owns full responsibility and accountability for developing business and functional requirements for assigned project.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Lead and/or assist business and technical team where necessary to develop/modify processes to resolve moderate to complex business issues by using system solutions, considering systemsâ€™ capacity and limitations, operating time, and form of desired results; includes analysis of business and user needs, elicitation, organization and documentation of business requirements, and translation of business requirements into functional requirements.<br />\r\nâ€¢ In support of solution definition and functional specification definition â€“ when available, performs review of impacted systemsâ€™ technical and logical design for the ability to lead through creating or updating system / process / data flow diagrams with minimal support.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Knows basic SQL to perform data queries that are simple to medium in complexity to support analysis as needed throughout all phases of the project.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Supports design, build and test phases for assigned projects as is determined by the project<br />\r\nâ€¢ Supports project manager by developing detailed project information for their task assignments such as detailed tasks, estimates, risks, issue management etc..<br />\r\n<br />\r\nQualifications & Preferences:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecific Knowledge/Experience<br />\r\n<br />\r\nâ€¢ Professional best practices of Business Analysis / Business Systems Analysis<br />\r\nâ€¢ SQL to perform data queries that are simple to medium in complexity<br />\r\nâ€¢ Release and Change management best practices<br />\r\nâ€¢ Software Development Life Cycle best practices<br />\r\nâ€¢ Workflow and process modeling and diagrams<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAbilities/Skills:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nâ€¢ Senior level analyst with 10+ years of experience of business analysis, business systems analyst or both.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Highly experienced in eliciting and being able to pick out requirements in a conversation, not necessarily being literally told what the requirement is. A good analyst will â€˜hearâ€™ the requirements in conversations when others might not.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Strong ability to lead meetings and conversations â€“ asking questions, managing the dialogue to achieve the objectives and agenda of the discussion.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Proven proficiency in leading through completion of high quality business, functional and non-functional requirement documentation.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Proven talent in ability to develop a business analysis plan in support of providing meaningful project phase estimates for all business analyst activities - especially takes ownership and accountability for the requirements phase and is highly capable to plan the tasks, effort and duration of all the tasks necessary to complete the BRD, FRD and supplementary documentation.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Proven ability to learn quickly and operate effectively in a fast paced environment.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Proven talent in communication and problem solving skills, detail-oriented<br />\r\nâ€¢ Proven talent in strategic thinking/thought leadership, necessary for understanding goals and objectives as well as the detailed activities within a project.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Proven talent in ability to work within a virtual teams, including utilizing available tools for efficient meeting facilitation and communications.<br />\r\nâ€¢ Proven talent to drive towards effective and timely results of all tasks and assignments<br />\r\nâ€¢ Proficient in standard business toolsets: Word, Excel, Visio, SharePoint, Outlook, PowerPoint, online meeting collaboration tools, IM, etc.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEducation:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nâ€¢ Bachelorâ€™s Degree or equivalent experience in a directly related field<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYears of Experience Required: ', '10 Bay Street, 7th Floor<br />\r\nToronto, Ontario<br />\r\nM5J 2R8<br />\r\nTel: 416.367.2020<br />\r\nToll Free: 800.842.5907<br />\r\nFax: 416.366.2001<br />\r\ntoronto@modis.com', 'Graduation', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '17 April, 2017', '2017-04-17', 30, '2017-04-17 06:02:35', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
