(68677640, 0, 'QUALITY ASSURANCE', 'Cybervox Network Ltd.', '', '1', '90', '27 Jun, 2017', '1', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '', 'Ahmedabad', 'Knowledge of tools concepts methodologies of QA', '', '41', '117', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Assisting in the creation and modification of technical documentation, including specifications and manuals<br />\r\nCreating and updating test plans, cases, data, scripts, performs regression and integration testing, and drives defect resolution with development staff<br />\r\nPerforming quality assurance checks, including the testing and validating of software developed<br />\r\nDocumenting, reporting, and managing the resolution of bugs by working closely with the development staff<br />\r\nPerforming manual and automated product testing on existing and new software products<br />\r\nReproducing defects and retesting from existing defect reports<br />\r\nDocumenting and managing the resolution of defects, creating defect log entries, and assigning defects to the development team.<br />\r\nCollaborating with the development and infrastructure teams for software deployments<br />\r\nQualifications and Experience:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBachelors degree preferred<br />\r\nCertifications an advantage including Quality Auditor, Quality Engineer, Quality Improvement Associate, Six Sigma<br />\r\nQuality inspection, auditing and testing experience<br />\r\nExperience with implementation of corrective action programs<br />\r\nProduct or industry-specific experience<br />\r\nKnowledge of tools, concepts and methodologies of QA<br />\r\nKnowledge of relevant regulatory requirements', 'E<br />\r\nmail: bhavina@vox360.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 7930070300', 'Bachelor\'s', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '29 March, 2017', '2017-03-29', 49, '2017-03-29 07:24:37', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
