tion Of  I-Views<br />\r\nESS -MSS Configuration Design<br />\r\n<br />\r\nplease revert back with following details below.<br />\r\nName: <br />\r\nDOB:<br />\r\nQualification:<br />\r\nExperience:<br />\r\nCurrent company:<br />\r\nDesignation:<br />\r\nPermanent/ Contract: <br />\r\nCurrent CTC:<br />\r\nExpected CTC:<br />\r\nNotice Period:<br />\r\nAny Offer : Y/N<br />\r\nPassport:<br />\r\nCurrent Location:<br />\r\nReason for Job change:<br />\r\n', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '20 July, 2016', '2016-07-20', 301, '2016-07-20 07:52:50', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
