(80507780, 0, 'Business Head', 'Harsha Human Capital', '', '1', '90', '27 Jun, 2017', '5', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Industry Standards', 'IN', '', '', 'Delhi', 'sales business Development', '', '23', '130', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'SkillSet: Pharma, Medical, Healthcare Sales, Business Development domain. The individual would be part of the core and founding team of next generation Healthcare platform in digital environment. Self-Drive, Entrepreneurial and getting hands dirty are the foundation of the role. - Building the foundation for a scalable business in Healthcare and ability to connect/work on the ground would be key to the initial focus of the role. The role initially comes with Sweat Equity compensation only.', 'Email: om@harshaitventures.in<br />\r\nTelephone: 9999013222', '', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '29 March, 2017', '2017-03-29', 49, '2017-03-29 07:34:42', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
