ubstantive, and performed on a timely basis.<br />\r\n    Ensures that assigned monthly, quarterly, and year-end reporting targets are met.<br />\r\n    Reviews financial accounting and regulatory requirements as well as client accounting policies and procedures, and ensures compliance.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nkindly revert with following details & send your updated CV on<br />\r\npriyanka@peshr.com<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTotal Exp:<br />\r\nRelevant Exp:<br />\r\nCurrent CTC:<br />\r\ncurrent company:<br />\r\nNotice period:<br />\r\nThanks & Regards,<br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nPriyanka Gupta<br />\r\nJr Recruiter<br />\r\nPES HR Services<br />\r\nT: 022 49856817 (Direct)', 'Email: priyanka@peshr.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 02249856817', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 March, 2017', '2017-03-07', 71, '2017-03-07 01:43:38', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
