(94216416, 28595, 'Hiring Business Development Executive (BDE)  with Experience 1- 4 yrs', 'Browsewire Consulting Pvt. Ltd.', '', '', '0', '', '1', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Chandigarh, Mohali ', '', '', '23', '16', '', '', 'Y', '', '', '', '<br />\r\nAbout The Company: <br />\r\nBrowsewire Consulting Pvt Ltd is India based global IT solution provider focused on providing Web Application Development, Design and IT Consulting Solutions to SMEs across the globe. Globally, Browsewire customers benefit from exceptional experience. Our focus is mutual growth for the employees and the customers.<br />\r\nBrowsewire has an extensive services portfolio spanning: Web Application Development, Web Designing, Mobile App Development and Digital Marketing.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPosition : Business Development Executive (Lead Generation)<br />\r\nJob Location: Mohali<br />\r\nJob Description:<br />\r\n1. We are looking for self-motivated and resourceful Lead Generation Specialists who will pursue clear and defined goals in lead qualification, brand-building, prospect discovery and conversion.<br />\r\n2. Discipline in research and execution of integrated sales and marketing campaigns to achieve desired results is a strong requirement.<br />\r\n3. A strong skill in research is desirable.<br />\r\n4. Prior experience and training in sales or IT sector is strongly desired along with bsic knowledge about Web Development using PHP.<br />\r\n5. The speacialist will identify business opportunities by developing new prospects and interacting with existing prospects in order to increase interest and qualify leads.<br />\r\n6. You will have a keen understanding of Browsewireâ€™s service offerings, and have the ability to nurture prospects while communicating the value we deliver through our leadership position in the industry<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJob Responsibilities and Expectations:<br />\r\n1. Prospect and build a lead pipeline via Online Bidding, email, professional social media networks and other direct marketing methods.<br />\r\n2. Create a database for a specific target audience and identify decision-makers & decision influencers.<br />\r\n3. Meet daily, weekly, and monthly lead generation goals in accordance with overall marketing and sales plan.<br />\r\n4. Consistently generate regular activity reports.<br />\r\n5. Conduct market research through various mediums to extract and identify business of each marketing initiative.<br />\r\n6. Keep a tab on the market developments and related technology and/or technology needs.<br />\r\n7. Apply Company wide project management standards in preparing bids and contracts, responding to customer needs and managing the sales process from opportunity identification to customer sign off<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience and Abilities:<br />\r\n1. 1-4 years of experience in Online Bidding, Web Development or a similar role<br />\r\n2. Ability to comprehend services provided by Browsewire and to communicate our value proposition to prospects.<br />\r\n3. Must be able to interact effectively with all levels of management and staff, internally and externally.<br />\r\n4. Must be adaptable, professional, courteous and motivated.<br />\r\n5. Must work well individually or as a member of a team.<br />\r\n6. Strong Internet research skills required.<br />\r\n7. Excellent verbal and written communication skills.<br />\r\n8. Self-starting with follow-through and multi-tasking capabilities<br />\r\n9. Ability to handle a multi-pronged strategy and challenging work.<br />\r\n10. Highly motivated with a strong desire to succeed<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSALARY : 30% hike in the current salary<br />\r\nBENEFITS : Monthly Appraisal + Incentives and Bonus + Unlimited Planned Leaves<br />\r\nKEY SKILLS :<br />\r\n# Online Bidding through Elance and Up work<br />\r\n# Sales Planning<br />\r\n# Sales Proposal Making<br />\r\n# Excellent Communication Skills<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEDUCATIONAL QUALIFICATION :<br />\r\n# UG: B.Tech/B.E. Computers, B.Sc- Computers, BCA â€“ Computers<br />\r\n# PG: MCA - Computers, M.Tech - Computers, M.Sc - Computers, MBA- Marketing<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJob Type: Full-time', 'ishar@browsewire.net', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '13 January, 2017', '2017-01-13', 124, '2017-01-13 03:53:04', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(94256301, 0, 'Accounts Officer', 'CLASSIC SIGNAGES PVT LTD', '', '1', '90', '22 Jun, 2017', '2', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '', 'Jaipur', 'TDS Tax Reporting Treasury VAT LEGAL Accounting Liaise Service Tax', '', '2', '13', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Manage the entire domain of Finance & Accounts function of the company.<br />\r\nFinance and Accounts functions involve the following areas:<br />\r\na) Accounting : Ensuring that the day to day accounting and transactions are accurately posted in system and guiding the subordinates accordingly. Ensure receiving or issuing of \"C\" Forms, \"F\" Forms, e-VAT 47/49<br />\r\nb) Accounting interpretation : Provide accounting solutions / interpretations of new / evolving transactions / lines of business in compliance with Indian legal requirements / accounting standards etc.<br />\r\nc) Treasury : Manage the treasury of the company including parking of funds, manage remittances etc. Responsible for all banking transactions, bank reconcilliation, NEFT/RTGS Payments<br />\r\nd) Liaise with auditors : Ensure finalization of accounts and completion of audits on time under different laws & internal guidelines<br />\r\ne) Accounting compliances : Manage proper compliance with Service Tax, VAT, TDS and other such accounting related compliances. Coordination with chartered accountants for timely filling of all these returns. and ensuring timely e-payments of all taxes.<br />\r\nf) Accounts receivable : Payment follow ups from all customers<br />\r\ng) Accounts Payable : ensure timely payments to vendors<br />\r\nh) Reporting : Ensuring the timely monthly accounting closures and daily/ Weekly reporting to manager finance and / or director', 'Email: sharmad@allusign.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 9929106270', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '24 March, 2017', '2017-03-24', 54, '2017-03-24 04:43:28', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(94312759, 0, 'Executive Assistant', 'TM Inputs and Services Pvt. Ltd', '', '1', '90', '18 Jun, 2017', '5', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '5', 'IN', '', '', 'Hyderabad', 'executive assistant personal secretary personal assistant secretary', '', '1', '64', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Urgent Opening for Executive Assistant for a leading Insurance Industry.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience : 5 - 10 Years <br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nEligibility Criteria : Candidates should be from Insurance Industry <br />\r\n<br />\r\nResponsibilities :<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Assist the CEO in his business related execution.<br />\r\n    Second the CEO in all his activities and handle the queries<br />\r\n    Should be able to help the CEO in quick decision making<br />\r\n    Should be able to understand & Analyse the Life Insurance Business<br />\r\n    Well versed in presentation skills<br />\r\n    Providing assistance as required helping maximize his contribution to the company.<br />\r\n    * Provide confidential support and display good judgment and discretion and confidentiality.<br />\r\n     Produce, proofread, and edit complex correspondence and presentations for all the work related to CEO.<br />\r\n    * Compile and analyze information for inclusion into reports and prepare comprehensive presentations for the CEO.<br />\r\n    To support in preparation of all documentation required for key decision making as required and to compile correspondence and reports for the CEO.<br />\r\n     Should possess knowledge on comparative analysis<br />\r\n     Help minimize risk of financial loss.<br />\r\n    Delegates work as needed.', 'Email: sandhyadevi@tminetwork.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 4066306303', '', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '20 March, 2017', '2017-03-20', 58, '2017-03-20 02:16:44', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(94340507, 0, 'Recruitment Executive it Recruitment', 'Intellicraft Consulting And Technologies.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', 'IN', '1283', '434686', 'Bangalore, ', 'payroll ', '', '23', '119', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Recruitment Executive ( IT, Engineering domain)Experience: 0 to 1 yearWe are looking for a Fresher with Any degree or Diploma with good communicationComplete Recruitment and Technology training will be provided, Successful candidate need to have Good English communication, Need to be a good learner and team playerMust be able to follow our recruitment techniques.General responsibilities of Job matching, screening, sourcing, interview schedulingMust be able to work on Information technology, Engineering requirements.', 'Intellicraft Consulting And Technologies.<br />\r\nEmail: vetri@intellicraft.in<br />\r\nTelephone: 8041147839', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '24 February, 2017', '2017-02-24', 82, '2017-02-24 01:27:36', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(94415999, 74820, 'Digital Marketing Manager - Homecentre', 'Lifestyle International Pvt Ltd.', '', '', '90', '12 Jun, 2017', '4', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', 'IN', '', '434686', 'Bengaluru', 'Digital Marketing, SEO, Social Media Marketing, PPC, Brand Positioning, Media Strategy', '', '40', '15', '', '', '', '', 'KEY RESPONSIBILITIES <br />\r\n<br />\r\nDefine the strategic road map and prepare brand strategy documents for digital performance of the brand<br />\r\nDevelop a digital marketing calendar for each brand / concept, in association with the concept, ATL and BTL team and oversee effective implementation and monitor performance<br />\r\nDevising strategies to drive online traffic to the company website.<br />\r\nTracking conversion rates and making improvements to the website.<br />\r\nPerformance Marketing <br />\r\nManaging the redesign of the company website.<br />\r\nImproving the usability, design, content and conversion of the company website<br />\r\nDeveloping and managing digital marketing campaigns<br />\r\nUtilize strong analytical ability to evaluate end-to-end customer experience across multiple channels and customer touch points<br />\r\nCollaborate with agencies and other vendor partners<br />\r\nUtilising a range of techniques including paid search, SEO and PPC.<br />\r\nOverseeing the social media strategy for the company.<br />\r\nManaging online brand and product campaigns to raise brand awareness.<br />\r\nDevising store activation driven digital engagement ideas and execution of them. <br />\r\nResponsibility of Footfall increase with Digital and social media marketing strategies<br />\r\nResponsibility for planning and budgetary control of all digital marketing<br />\r\nEvaluating customer research, market conditions and competitor data.<br />\r\nReview new technologies and keep the company at the forefront of developments in digital marketing.<br />\r\nDevelop alliances with trading brands, banking partners, other brands to leverage the potential of partners and deploy partnerships to achieve objectives / enhance business performance<br />\r\nAlign creative agency partner to business objectives and constantly motivate them to achieve desired results. <br />\r\nDevelop effective store launch strategy, implement and monitor performance of new stores<br />\r\nOversee implementation to ensure that new stores perform to potential from the day of launch<br />\r\nMotivate and lead a team of brand/ category managers to align them to common business objectives<br />\r\nDevelop, implement and adhere to systems and processes to ensure compliance with statutory / internal audit norms', '', 'Develop and implement the brand building strategy for the allocated portfolio in line with business objectives including brand mapping, generating consumer understanding, defining and implementing brand positioning, implementing strategic and tactical marketing programs to achieve top-line and bottom-line objectives', '', 'B.Tech/B.E. - Any Specialization PG - Any Postgraduate', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '14 March, 2017', '2017-03-14', 64, '2017-03-14 03:55:17', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(94418574, 0, 'Chartered Accounts (CA) Freshers', 'Wings Techno Solutions Hiring For Wings Techno Sol', '', '1', '90', '26 Jun, 2017', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', 'IN', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'CA Chartered Accounts General Ledger Accounts payable Accounts receivable ', '', '2', '1', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Hiring CA freshers for Accounts & finance <br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAccounting Specialist:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEducational Qualification: CA <br />\r\n<br />\r\nTotal work experience: Freshers<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKnowledge in Accounts Payable, Accounts Receivable and General ledger Process<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGood communication skills: written and verbal<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSa1lary: 4Lpa to 6Lpa + Variable & Benefits<br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFor more details call komal@9916330011<br />\r\n<br />\r\nmail to wingstechnosolutions@gmail.com<br />\r\n<br />\r\n <br />\r\n<br />\r\nREFER YOUR FRIENDS', 'Email: wingstechnosolutions@gmail.com<br />\r\nTelephone: 9916330011', 'CA', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '28 March, 2017', '2017-03-28', 50, '2017-03-28 01:22:03', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(94446922, 0, 'Security Site Supervisor (Elkhorn, WI)', 'G4S Secure Solutions', '', '1', '90', '15 Jun, 2017', '2', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', 'Market', 'US', '', '', 'Elkhorn, WI', 'Management and Supervision, Security/Loss Prevention', '', '1', '130', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'The world\'s leading private security organization, G4S, has an immediate job opportunity for an experienced supervisor with a background in security. As a Site Supervisor, you will be responsible for the professional operation, administration, profitability, and quality assurance of uniformed services for a client\'s site.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nG4S is a security provider for the United States government, fortune 500 companies, nuclear power plants, oil and gas companies, airport, ports, banks, hospitals, factories, warehouses, commercial facilities, residential communities and much more.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nG4S offers job security, excellent pay and benefits, and career opportunities. We offer entry level careers, management careers, sales careers and executive careers across the United States and internationally.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecific Duties and Essential Functions<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Oversee that all aspects of the security function on-site is performed in a diligent manner (staffing, scheduling, and on-site training all G4S Secure Solutions (USA) Inc. personnel assigned to his/her site).<br />\r\n    Ensure that contract-required training and screening elements for security personnel have been met.<br />\r\n    Maintain overtime to a preset requirement designated by G4S.<br />\r\n    Ensure quality of service and contract compliance by regularly inspecting security personnel assigned to his/her site.<br />\r\n    Perform other operations related functions (e.g., payroll, review and maintain incident reports, issue uniforms, coordinate fleet vehicles, assist in preparation of security surveys and post orders).<br />\r\n    Make recommendations for positive and negative personnel actions for those under his/her direct supervision.<br />\r\n    Respond to client requests.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEducation, Licenses and Certifications Required<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Must possess a high school diploma or equivalent<br />\r\n    Must complete any State-required training or other qualifications for licensing<br />\r\n    Must successfullycompletea State licensing test if driving a company-owned or client-provided vehicle<br />\r\n<br />\r\nType and Length of Specific Experience Required<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Must have one or more of the following:<br />\r\n        Service in Military Occupational Specialty related to law enforcement, security (such as Military Police, Elite Military Forces, combat arms) or any support role in a Combat Zone<br />\r\n        Graduate of a Certified Public Safety Academy (military or civilian) in the law enforcement, adult corrections, or firefighter field<br />\r\n        Bachelor\'s degree in law enforcement or criminal justice related studies<br />\r\n        A minimum of 8 or more years of active service in any military branch<br />\r\n        Associate\'s degree (or 60 credits) or higher in law enforcement or criminal justice with current or prior active military service<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSkills Required<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Proficient computer skills including Microsoft Office<br />\r\n    Effective oral and written communication skills<br />\r\n    Active listening skills<br />\r\n    Ability to assess and evaluate situations effectively<br />\r\n    Ability to identify critical issues quickly and accurately<br />\r\n    Attention to detail<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOther<br />\r\n<br />\r\n    Must be at least 18 years old or the minimum age<br />\r\n    Must be a U.S. citizen or a foreign citizen authorized to legally work in the United States<br />\r\n    Must not use illegal drugs. Must submit to a pre-employment drug test<br />\r\n    Must submit toan extensive background check, including criminal history, personal references, employment and education verifications, and Department of Motor Vehicle and credit checks if applicable<br />\r\n    Must be able to provide, upon job offer, a DD214 discharge document with discharge status indicated, if prior military<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPhysical Requirements and Environment<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEnvironment: Office; minimal to no work in extreme temperatures is expected<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMajor activity: Working on PC while sitting; telephone use; driving; standing<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPhysical efforts to carry out job duties: Limited, to include some standing, bending, light lifting, and limited stretching and reaching<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNumber Of Positions: 1<br />\r\n<br />\r\nClosing Date: 2017-04-15', '', '', 'Formal', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '17 March, 2017', '2017-03-17', 61, '2017-03-17 02:51:27', 'US', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
