(95985464, 0, 'Urgent opening for Project Manager', 'Elagoon Business Solutions', '', '2', '0', '', '5', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Kolkata', 'project management, team management, help members, finance management, task management, documents and reports generation', 'https://www.elagoonites.com/career_detail/project-manager/?position=project-manager', '41', '37', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', 'Excellent command on PHP and MySQL using MVC Architecture\r\nKnowledge of multiple open source technologies like Drupal, Smarty, Magento, Joomla, WordPress\r\nKnowledge of Ajax, JQuery, JavaScript, XML, CSS, XHTML, HTML\r\nKnowledge of web front-end development including browser capability.\r\nKnowledge of one of the JavaScript libraries like Angular, Backbone, and Node will be an advantage.\r\nShould have experience with 3rd party APIs like Twitter, Facebook, Google, and Payment Gateways\r\nShould have excellent Communication skills.\r\nMust possess strong problem solving and multi-tasking abilities.\r\nShould be able to understand and handle tasks independently\r\nAbility to meet the deadlines.\r\nStrong knowledge of Digital marketing processes', '', 'Ensuring smooth delivery of the project\r\nExcellent ability to handle team of hardcode professionals\r\nExposure to handling international client\r\nEstimation of various modules\r\nDevelopment of the modules\r\nFixing bug and maintenance of the product.\r\nAnalyzing the open projects and distributing tasks to the members as per their expertise.\r\nPlay an inspiring role for each and every team member to perform and encourage them to give the best.\r\nCoordinating with teams members working on the same project.\r\nInteracting with the client to understand the project and finalize its scope.\r\nReporting any problem or fault in the project to the project manager.', '', 'NA', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '01 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-01 11:49:17', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', 