(95985468, 0, 'Technology Lead-Dot Net Developer', 'Deloitte', '', '', '0', '', '6', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '5', '', '', '', 'bangalore', 'SDLC Ajax SSIS Testing Forms Unit Testing CSS Consulting Visio Framework Unit testing WCF MVC Agile JavaScript Management C# SQL Server Risk Management WPF Reports Architect SSRS Design Web development OOPS ASP Performance Tuning workflow .Net ASP.NET Audi', '', '23', '30', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Function: U.S. India Enabling AreasService Area: USI ITSService Line/Market Offering: Deloitte Application StudiesWork Location: Bangalore The key job responsibilities include the following:  \r\n\r\n    Candidate with minimum 6-8 years of experience to lead a team of developers and responsible for the development deliverables. \r\n    Design and develop quality Web Front End and WCF/ Web API Applications. Implement custom workflow solutions & reports to enable business requirements. \r\n    Requires high level of skills in coming up with high level design document and working with the architect on the application design/ DB structure design. Must be innovative.\r\n    Good analytical skills to understand the requirements and lead the team for removing technical roadblocks and also perform hands on coding\r\n    Soft skills needed: Self-starter, proactive, approachable, solution oriented, team player\r\n    Good knowledge or working experience in Agile projects \r\n    Work experience in designing modules, estimation, task management for self and team\r\n    Strong trouble shooting skills to resolve the technical skills.\r\n    Very strong in web development which includes ASP.NET (4.5 / 4.6), ASP.NET MVC (4.0 / 5.0), HTML, HTML 5, CSS.\r\n    Very strong in C# as development language, .NET framework concepts and implementation and OOPs concepts.\r\n    Very Strong SQL Server (includes working with DML, DDL, Stored procedures,)\r\n    Strong in services development and hosting for WCF, ASP.NET Web API.\r\n    Strong in Ajax, Jquery, Javascript etc \r\n    Strong in writing automated unit testing code.\r\n    Strong in SSIS, SSRS.\r\n    Demonstrate ability to apply Microsoft Practices and Patterns \r\n    Working experience on Performance Tuning of an application using C# and SQL.\r\n    Used Application Blocks like logging, exception handling, etc. \r\n    Have worked with 3rd-party web controls \r\n\r\nNice to have\r\n\r\n    Knowledge on front end frameworks like Durandal, Knockout etc.\r\n    Knowledge of Client side applications using windows forms, WPF. \r\n\r\nSupport:\r\n\r\n    Provide consultative support in designing web applications solutions\r\n    Support QA team with clarifications/ doubts.  \r\n    Delivery and deployment of the projects to different environments.\r\n    Liase with a learning group to provide input into training materials\r\n    Provide input to standards and guidelines and implement best practices to enable consistency across all projects\r\n    Participate in the continuous improvement processes, as assigned \r\n\r\n         ', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '02 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-02 00:37:45', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985469, 0, 'Hiring for Engineering Designer Job', 'Nura Engineering Pvt Ltd', '', '1', '0', '', '1', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Noida', 'AutoCAD Mechanical Industry Mechatronics Engineering Auto Cad Design CAD Assurance LTD Solid Works Project Development PM Maintenance CAN', '', '23', '114', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', ' Engineering Design / Construction Fresher (No Experience)', '', 'Functional Area : Engineering Industry : Manufacturing / Maintenance Role Category : Auto CAD Engineer/Electrical Engineer/Electronics Engineer/Maintenance Engineer/Electrical Maintenance Engineer\r\n\r\nGender : only male Job Country :\r\nIndia Job Details :\r\nWe require Engineering / Diploma - Mechanical / Mechatronics / Automobile / Electrical. Qualification : Engineering / Diploma - Mechanical /Automobile/ Electrical. Experience : 0 to 1 years Required in : Manufacturing Job Type : Full-time -Functional Area : Design / Project Development / Manufacturing -Industry : Manufacturing, Service -Skills : Electrical Concepts , AutoCAD , CATIYA, SOLID WORKS We give you a 100% assurance for your selection by enhancing your skills and a referral backup (Backdoor) for your joining. Contact for inquiry Monday to Saturday (10am to 4 pm.) INTERESTED CANDIDATES CAN CALL- Desk\r\n\r\nBest Regards,\r\nSonali Sinha\r\n\r\nHuman Resource (Recruitment)\r\n\r\nM +917210361682,+919643376734,+919873435747\r\nEmail: hr.tanviarora(at)gmail.com.\r\nN E Project Corporation(P) Ltd.\r\n', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '02 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-02 00:41:22', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
