011-43583768 / 011-43073768', 'hiring@sanskriticonsultancy.com ', 'Graduation', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '02 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-02 00:46:01', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985471, 0, 'Sales Manager', 'Capgemini', '', '2', '0', '', '8', '11', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'hyderabad', 'Salesacle Oracle ', '', '14', '16', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Position : Sales Manager â€“ CAPTIVES & Services\r\nLocation : Hyderabad\r\nExperience : 8 â€“ 10 years\r\n\r\n1. This is a direct sales (Services and CAPTIVES Business) role (Individual Contributor role) with Yearly revenue ownership - sales (Booking & revenue) achievement.\r\n2. The candidate should have direct sales experience. \r\n3. Ability to identify and acquire new logos, create new business opportunities.\r\n4. Should be able to engage C level executives. \r\n5. Should have good understanding of the Captives industry segment with experience of managing atleast 2 large customers.\r\n6. Added experience in Enterprise Applications (SAP, ORACLE, KRONOS, SFDC) market in south (Hyderabad).\r\n7. Should be a good communicator with articulative skills. This role being customer facing will require leading presentations / discussions with the customers including price and contract negotiation.\r\n8. Should be a go getter and be able to own and drive the internal teams towards achieving the stated goals.', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '03 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-03 04:38:48', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985472, 0, 'Direct Sales SFU Job', 'ASK IT Solutions India Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '0', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '29', '13', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'This position will required daily check in with their leader via a daily call and or face to face. 90% of the position is based outside; thus the individual will be dealing with the weather on a daily basis.\r\nDirect Sales Representative, conversing door-to-door selling the client services.  As an Outside Sales Representative, you will play a pivotal role in the continued stability and growth of our organization, by serving as a front-line representative of the client brand. In this role, you sell video, voice, data and home security services to residential customers via door-to-door canvassing within an assigned territory of single family units(SFU).\r\n \r\nRequirements: \r\nThe location consists of Gainesville and Ocala\r\nThis is an outside residential door - to - door sales position. The position will have monthly quotas and will be required to work evenings and weekends (Saturday). The typical hours for this position are 10am - 7pm T - Sat. Also, the person will be required to received local government permits.', '', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '03 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-03 04:40:30', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985473, 0, 'Direct Sales - Manager Job', 'utkarsh staffing solutions', '', '1', '0', '', '3', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '5', '', '', '', 'bangalore', 'sale ', '', '29', '117', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'MBA/Graduate with 03 to05years of experience in sales, preferably from direct sales bg-IT, Media, Telecom, Hot deals, FMCG, BFSI, Service Industries-Hloidays, hotels, resorts, aviation, etc\r\n* Should understand recent marketing and advertising trends like- online sales, hot deals, B2B sales etc.\r\n* Should have high level of leadership managerial ability\r\n* Must own a two wheeler and Android\r\n\r\nRoles: \r\n* Develop attach plans for key Direct prospects and close Direct customer business\r\n* Consistently meet and exceed sales targets\r\n* Meets and/or exceeds sales goals as established by local market\r\n* Lead generation\r\n* Communicates and develops rapport with customers. Evaluates customers\' existing and potential product needs and make recommendations. Increases customer understanding of Shentel products and pricing models, as well as, competitive advantage over other service providers. Evaluates competitive offers and frame responses to show the benefits of Shentel', '', 'MBA', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '03 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-03 04:42:51', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
