nd floor Unit no 1, koramangala industrial layout, near to Punjab grill, opposite to forum mall Bangalore- 560095\r\n\r\nDont Forget to mention SOURABH on the top of your CV.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNote: - Refer your friends and come come along with your friends who are looking out for Job.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSpot offer Letter.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nSOURABH\r\n\r\n7204053192\r\n\r\nRecruitment Consultant.', 'sourabh.kumar@ikyaglobal.com', '', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '03 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-03 04:46:29', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985475, 0, 'Security Consultant- SME Job', 'IBM India Pvt Ltd', '', '2', '0', '', '8', '11', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '6', '', '', '', 'bangalore', 'Basic Unix TCP/IP Consulting Linux IT security Analytics Scripting Routing CISCO Security MULTIPLE Protocols Management Audit', '', '23', '130', '', 'Y', 'Y', 'How we ll help you grow:\r\n\r\n    You ll have access to all the technical and management training courses you need to become the expert you want to be\r\n    You ll learn directly from expert developers in the field; our team leads love to mentor\r\n    You have the opportunity to work in many different areas to figure out what really excites you', '', '', 'About IBM\r\nIBM is a global technology and innovation company present in India since 1992. It is the largest technology and consulting employer in the world, with approximately 380,000 employees serving clients in 170 countries. In this new era of Cognitive Business, IBM is helping to reshape industries as diverse as healthcare, retail, banking, travel, manufacturing, and many more, by bringing together our expertise in Cloud, Analytics, Security, Mobile, and the Internet of Things.  We are changing how we create. How we collaborate. How we analyze. How we engage. IBM is a leader in this global transformation\r\n\r\nBusiness Unit Introduction:\r\nIBM Global Technology Services (GTS) helps clients plan, implement and manage an efficient, resilient, flexible IT infrastructure. IBM GTS is the partner of choice for infrastructure services   be it transformational outsourcing tied to business outcomes or integrated managed services or discrete\r\n\r\nWho You are: \r\n\r\n    You will be an individual contributors responsible for providing IT security services to clients within the IBM Security Services Managed Security Services organization. \r\n    As a SIEM Administrator you will create, modifiy and tune the SIEM rules to adjust the specifications of alerts and incidents. \r\n    You will work with the customers designated personnel to provide continual correlation rule tuning, incident classification and prioritization recommendations, report query adjustments, and various other configuration activities in order to help customers fully optimize the SIEM system capabilities as well as the audit and logging features of the event log sources. \r\n    You will work closely with the assigned Managed Services SIEM resources to ensure client\'s customized solution is functioning optimally and is continuously tuned to the client\'s needs. \r\n    You should have excellent problem solving skills and also basic knowledge of TCP/IP and OSI layers, network routing & switching protocols, and experience in one or more best-of-breed Firewall/UTM, IPS/IDS, SIEM, Proxy and Advanced Threat Prevention platforms/security products from various vendors such as Check Point, Cisco, Juniper, Palo Alto, Blue Coat, Websense, IBM QRadar, and HP Arcsight. Working familiarity with Unix, Linux, Windows OS and scripting language \r\n\r\n\r\nWhat you ll do:\r\n\r\n    Create, modify and tune the SIEM rules to adjust the specifications of alerts and incidents. \r\n    Work with the customer designated personnel to provide continual correlation rule tuning, incident classification and prioritization recommendations.\r\n    Report query adjustments, and various other SIEM configuration activities. \r\n    Assist customers to fully optimize the SIEM system capabilities as well as the audit and logging features of the event log sources. \r\n    Work closely with the assigned Managed Services SIEM resources to ensure client\'s customized solution is functioning optimally and continuously tuned to the client\'s needs.\r\n    Interface with a variety of customers in a polite, positive and professional manner. \r\n    Work under pressure on multiple issues & projects (i.e. multi-task) with tight schedules.\r\n    Resolve problems related to Network, Device, Policy, connectivity issues etc.\r\n\r\n\r\nHow we ll help you grow:\r\n\r\n    You ll have access to all the technical and management training courses you need to become the expert you want to be\r\n    You ll learn directly from expert developers in the field; our team leads love to mentor\r\n    You have the opportunity to work in many different areas to figure out what really excites you', '', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-04 01:25:23', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985476, 0, 'SAP Basis Migration Consultant Job', 'Growel Softech Pvt. Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '8', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '5', '', '', '', 'hyderabad', 'System copies User Management ', '', '23', '19', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Experience : 5 to 14 years experience in administering SAP Applications - ABAP/JAVA Stack administration (SAP Business Suite, SAP Basis, SAP Solution Manager, Portal, PI, Netweaver etc.,) along with at least two full cycle implementation Should have played the role of Technical Lead managing at least one end to end project (Upgrades, Implementation etc.,) Technically fluent in Operating System (Unix/Windows/Linux), Database (Oracle/DB2/SQL Server/MaxDB ) administration Knowledge/Experience in performance tuning, User Management, System copies, Unicode Conversions Ability to troubleshoot/analyze and resolve technical problems Ability to work on activities involved in Plan areas ( Sizing, Scoping , Client/Landscape Strategy, High Availability/Disaster Recovery Strategy etc,)', '    Company Name: Growel Softech Pvt. Ltd.\r\n    Company Description:\r\n    Growel Softech Pvt. Ltd.\r\n    Email: shital.j@growelsoftech.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-04 01:28:20', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985477, 0, 'Java Developer Java Script Ajax Job', 'VibrantWorx TechServe Private Limited.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Noida', 'Java Script Web Services JQuery AJAX ', '', '23', '16', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'looking for Java Developer candidates who having minimum 3 years experience on Java Script & Ajax and good knowledge on Knockout.js, drop Wizard.Java/J2EE, Java Scripts AJAX, JQUERY,, RESTFul Web Services.\r\nExperience is Ajax based web application\r\nKnowledge of Knockout.js, DropWizard, Nosql is a PLUS', '    Company Name: VibrantWorx TechServe Private Limited.\r\n    Email: hr@techno-tree.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-04 01:30:26', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985478, 0, 'SeniorProject Manager Job', 'IntegralMinds Software Solutions Pvt Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'hyderabad', 'Scope Management Cost Management  Integration Management ', '', '23', '37', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Urgent Opening For Dot Net Developer with 4 to 10 Years Of Experience.\r\n\r\nDescription of Service/ product that needs to be provided\r\nProvide Project Management skills to manage Group IT projects as and when required.\r\n\r\nScope of work/supply\r\nProvide project management for Group IT projects through the solution delivery process as per the PMBOK knowledge areas for projects assigned:\r\n\r\nIntegration Management\r\nScope Management\r\nCost Management\r\nSchedule Management\r\nQuality Management\r\nRisk Management\r\nCommunication Management\r\nProcurement Management\r\nHuman Resources Management\r\nStakeholder Management\r\nElimination Criteria\r\nThe candidate will be disqualified if he/she does not meet the following criteria:\r\n\r\nDoes not possess extensive experience in IT Project Management\r\nDoes not possess extensive understanding of PMBOK knowledge areas\r\nDoes not meet the shortlisting criteria', 'Email: shara@integralminds.co.in', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-04 01:33:50', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985479, 0, 'Urgent hiring for voice & Non voice Backend profile Job', 'Navjyoti Global Solutions Pvt. Ltd', '', '5', '0', '', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Delhi', 'Fresher', '', '1', '13', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'LOOKING FOR JOB!\r\n\r\n100% JOB SELECTION\r\n\r\nUrgent Opening for Backend, Voice & Non Voice Profile\r\n\r\nNavjoyti Global Solution Pvt Ltd is an elite Training & Development center focused on providing stellar services like skill development training, corporate, training, e-commerce and it solutions etc. NGSPL started in April 2011 and has worked extensively towards designing a custom and well optimized curriculum for training candidates. It is one of the few training institutes who have been blessed with the amazing opportunity of teaming up with Pradhan Mantri Kaushal Vikas Yojana, STAR schemes, national digital literacy mission, MORD, Uttrakhand Skill Development and with Haryana to impart employability training and placement youth with fortune 500 companies. \r\n It has trained over 35,000 people and placed over 15,000 people with large companies.\r\n\r\n We invite you to grab this opportunity to join the World\'s best Company. You don\'t get only the job, but promising career and bright future.\r\n\r\n If you are Graduate and want to get job in backend and voice & Non voice profile, please visit us to apply with the World\'s best Company and get your dream job. We assure you 100% placement. \r\n\r\n This is totally Free of Cost!!! No Charges at all. \r\n\r\n Qualification: Any Graduate\r\n\r\n Job Location: Delhi/NCR\r\n\r\n Salary Package: Up to 20,000\r\n\r\n Date of interview: 7 Oct\'16 to 10 Octâ€™16\r\n\r\n\r\n Time of Interview: Morning 10 am to 4 pm.\r\n\r\n\r\n Venue: Navjyoti Global Solution Pvt Ltd, 364/2, 3rd Floor, Next to Kalyani Hospital, Opp Govt. Girls College. Sector 14 Near MG road Metro station. Gurgaon.\r\n\r\n\r\n Thanks & regards\r\n Team Navjyoti\r\n Contact: 8130341133 / 81303401144\r\n Email ID: navjyoti.jobs@gmail.com\r\n', '    Company Name: Navjyoti Global Solutions Pvt. Ltd\r\n    Email: navjyoti.jobs@gmail.com\r\n    Telephone: 81303401144', 'Graduate', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-04 01:36:55', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985480, 0, 'HR Service Delivery Job', 'Accenture Job Referrals Powered by Round One', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', ' General / Operations Management', '', '38', '130', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'The IG HR Manager/ Senior Manager will supervise a headcount pyramid (MGR - ~3000-4000 & SMR 10000 FTEs) supported by a team of HR Representatives. The main focus would be to drive HR processes/ initiatives across the four stages of the employee lifecycle (Talent Acquisition, Talent Management, Talent Development and Talent Engagement/ Retention) along with supporting client visits/ discussions, managing employee escalations/ grievances and applying Accenture policies to support delivery and execute growth programs as directed.', '', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-07 02:58:28', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985481, 0, 'HEAD AND REGIONAL HR MANAGER SR.MANAGER Job', 'oasis human resources', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Jaipur', 'HR', '', '21', '119', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Manage end to end HR activities for a corporate functions (CFO Patch comprising of Finance, Financial Planning & Analysis, Risk, Internal Assurance, Procurement, Facilities, BPMA, Strategy) within the organization\r\n\r\nCounsel business leaders in people issues within the organization with the objective of nurturing and encouraging service excellence and quality by building a capable and motivated team in the assigned functions\r\n\r\nImplement initiatives to develop organizational culture, train and develop Managers for succession, and improve Employee Engagement\r\n\r\nDevelop and maintain a team of competent employees\r\n\r\nKEY RESPONSIBILITY:\r\n\r\nTranslate HR objectives into a workable HR plan. Deploy and implement in consultation with business in order to ensure a sufficient HR plan exists to support Business Plans\r\n\r\nAssist management to determine the most effective organization structure in support of evolving business requirements; Propose & deploy structure for assigned functions in order to ensure that the structure facilitates high quality interactions and decision making while eliminating gaps and overlaps\r\n\r\nSupport business in decision making (Fitment) and allocation of compensation quantum for assigned functions; Drive moderation of ratings for the assigned patch; Arrive at judicious mix of compensation and the justification balanced with cost\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDevelop the sourcing strategy for corporate functions; Deploy recruitment plan; Conduct interviews and select candidates for Band 3 (Asst. Vice President) and below in order to meet the assigned functions manpower requirements\r\n\r\nEnable implementation of Performance Management process for the functions; Assist the business heads in making promotion decisions; Sign off on exceptions till Band 4 (Manager); Identify critical positions and suitable candidates for development, Formulate individual career development plans in conjunction with Management; Oversee implementation of annual performance appraisal process in order to ensure timely completion of performance management cycle\r\n\r\nEvolve training and development in corporate functions in line with business strategy; Monitor execution of full training loop (TNA, delivery and feedback), Identify potential leaders and pipeline; Monitor and review implementation of policy in order to develop a skilled and motivated team\r\n\r\nOverall responsibility for employee engagement in corporate functions; design and execute employee engagement plan for various functions depending upon their unique engagement needs; ensure retention\r\n\r\nImplement reward and recognition schemes, communicate new schemes as appropriate with relevant guidelines in order to ensure that talent is appropriately recognized, motivated and developed\r\n\r\nManage EDAP (Employee Disciplinary Action Process) the process of investigation and action taken on Employee Grievances / Disciplinary issues / Workplace Harassment, violation of ethical norms. Monitor compliance with policies; Manage critical incidents; Handle grievances; Track and report issues and actions taken. Provide coaching and counseling in order to build a motivated team; and ensure smooth and cordial relations\r\n\r\nRead more\r\n\r\nIndustryInsurance\r\n\r\nFunctional AreaHR , Recruitment , Administration IR\r\n\r\nRole Category HR/ Recruitment / IR\r\n\r\nRoleHR Business Partner\r\n\r\nKeyskills senior manager business partner\r\n\r\nDesired Candidate Profile\r\n\r\nUG - Any Graduate - Any Specialization\r\n\r\nPG - MBA/PGDM - HR/Industrial Relations\r\n\r\nDoctorate - Any Doctorate - Any Specialization, Doctorate Not Required\r\n\r\nShould be a Management Graduate (MBA degree with specialization in HR preferred)\r\n\r\n9-10 years of professional experience of working in a progressive HR Organization.\r\n\r\nTeam Player with excellent communication and interpersonal skills who can function effectively at all levels of an organization\r\n\r\nAbility to negotiate and actively facilitate change in culture, strategy, process, etc. Exposure to change management will be an added advantage\r\n\r\nProject management skills with a par.\r\n\r\nCall for details\r\n\r\nDhruva Singh.9887555232\r\n\r\nPrincipal Consdultant\r\n\r\nOasis Pan India Hr Consultancy\r\n\r\noasiscv@gmail.com', 'Call for details\r\n\r\nDhruva Singh.9887555232\r\n\r\nPrincipal Consdultant\r\n\r\nOasis Pan India Hr Consultancy\r\n\r\noasiscv@gmail.com', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-07 03:00:00', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985482, 0, 'Am-employee Engagement Job', 'Home Credit India Finance Pvt Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Mumbai', 'Hr', '', '21', '119', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Develop, promote and execute frameworks viz. skip level discussions, cross functional connect forums, onboarding experience, employee assistance program etc. that contribute to employee experience. \r\nHR Communication\r\n\r\nManage employee communication boards like Intranet, mails, posters etc.\r\nDesign HR Communication\r\nManage and coordinate HR Communication\r\nSupport other HR verticals in creating communication plan\r\nHandling end to end execution of various engagement activities like events, Open House session within defined budget for the Zone.\r\nInduction Process\r\n\r\nProgram management for new hire induction\r\nNew hire Induction twice a week\r\nManaging content for new hire induction\r\nProgram management / execution\r\n\r\nActs as HR ambassador and promotes HR processes locally including Rewards & Recognition program, Performance Management etc.\r\nIdentifying corporate deals for employees with various vendors & publishing on intranet portal, notice boards.', '    Company Name: Home Credit India Finance Pvt Ltd.\r\n    Email: vishnu.sidharth@homecredit.co.in', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-07 03:01:32', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985483, 0, 'Engineering Manager / Senior Engineering Manager - Commerce platform Job', 'Flipkart', '', '4', '0', '', '0', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'COREMAJORProduct ManagementarchitectUser ExperienceSciencebusiness developmentLeadership SkillsDesignIndustryEngineeringComputer ScienceAgileBusiness DevelopmentOperationsWHOPredictive AnalyticsEvaluationArchitectureWELLManagementSystemsAnalyticsCAREERArchitectStorageAlgorithmsProject ManagementStrategyEnvironmentSoftwareagileDetectionAgile EnvironmentFraud Detection', '', '29', '123', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Flipkart defines the eCommerce industry in India and and is a leader with the core value of putting customer first. Flipkarts employees are a fun-loving, hard-working and diverse bunch. they love being themselves and their independence of thoughts pave way for disruptive innovation on technology. \r\n \r\nWe are looking for engineers who are well rounded - quality conscious, product thinkers, business congnizant and smart  not mere coders. Engineers get to significantly amplify their impact with the scale that Flipkart operates at. The same scale also demands the engineers to produce super-efficient solutions. Engineers participate and propagate a culture where initiative and merit is valued highly. \r\n \r\nFlipsters in the commerce platform work on problems such as advanced information-retrieval algorithms, massive scalability, elastic storage, predictive analytics, fraud detection and large-scale applications that enrich the user experience, to name a few. Working with the market leader, engineers mostly solve challenges-never-seen-before. \r\n \r\nAt Flipkart we miss no opportunity to celebrate our accomplishments. While we work hard, we party harder. \r\nWhat we would like you to do at Flipkart: \r\n \r\nHave the technical chops to roll up sleeves and provide technical leadership to major projects, and also build and manage a team of 10-15 top notch engineers. \r\nOptimize your own code but make sure engineers are able to optimize theirs. As an Engineering Manager you manage your business goals, contribute to product strategy and help develop your team \r\nCreate clear career paths for team members and help them grow with regular and deep mentoring. Perform regular performance evaluation and share and seek feedback. \r\nOperate with scale and speed amidst flux, there is just a LOT happening.   \r\nMentor your team! Our world-class software engineers are just getting started -- and as a manager, you guide the way. \r\nWork closely with Product Management, Business Development and Operations team and enable them by providing scalable and high quality technology solutions at a rapid pace \r\nSet up best practices for development and champion their adoption and at the same time Architect and design technically robust, flexible and scalable solutions \r\nWork with designers, business analysts, and product managers to estimate and plan projects in an Agile environment \r\nPerform well in uncertainties and collaborate and work with unclear interfaces to other teams in our rapidly evolving organizations \r\nHave high technical competence, strong technical background with track record of individual technical accomplishments  Ability to play the role of the architect for the team \r\n \r\n \r\nWhat experience wed like you to have: \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nExcellent leadership skills to mentor the engineers under you. \r\nDeep understanding of technologies and architecture in a highly scalable and available set-up. \r\nDeep understanding and expertise with highly transactional, large relational and complex systems. \r\nStrong object oriented design skills, and an uncanny ability to design intuitive module and class-level interfaces \r\nSuperior project management skills to manage multi-engineer projects and experience of delivering high quality projects on time \r\nAround 9 years of experience with technology depth as well as good people skills \r\nA BE/BTech in Computer Science or some equivalent.  \r\n APPLY NOW', '', 'BE/BTech', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-07 03:04:31', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985484, 0, 'Manageror SDK Engineering Job', 'Connectpro Management Consultants Pvt Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '    business goalsAbility to work across overlap multi -disciplinary internal groups    ', '', '16', '123', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Graduate (MS/ME/MTech) engineering degree from top schools in EE or CS with 8 years of hands -on performance software development experienceor particularly as a product architect3 years of engineering management experience including team -building Strong technical skills in software product development using C / C in Windows and/or Linux environment in relevant domains especially multimedia Experience in data -parallel/GPU computing preferred(e.g.: OpenCLor CUDA)Experience in customer -facingor contract -management or other external business -oriented roles Adaptable to changing business requirements including ability to implement quick decisions based on business relevance and company priorities Flexible to learn new skills and drive completion of technical and business goalsAbility to work across and overlap with multi -disciplinary internal groups', 'Company Name: Connectpro Management Consultants Pvt Ltd.\r\nfarheen@sankhya.net', 'Graduate (MS/ME/MTech) ', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-07 03:06:35', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985485, 0, 'US Accounting - Account Executive- BPO KPO - Andheri Job', 'Talent Corner HR Services Pvt Ltd', '', '4', '0', '', '2', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Mumbai', ' Accounts payableUS Accounting', '', '9', '47', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', '    Should be currently working in BPO / KPO .\r\n    Should be a male candidate only\r\n\r\n    Passing accounting entries of Sales in sales journal, Purchase invoice & booking Payroll\r\n\r\n    Preparing of reports and statements.\r\n\r\n    Preparation of Financial statements by scrutinizing ledger accounts of Accounts Payable/Receivable, general accounting\r\n\r\n     Interacting clients in US through chat and video conferencing\r\n    Should be ready to work in shifts\r\n\r\nInterested candidates can share their resume on akshata.tchr@gmail.com / hrp2@talentcorner.in / contact : 7718881113', 'Interested candidates can share their resume on akshata.tchr@gmail.com / hrp2@talentcorner.in / contact : 7718881113', 'Any Graduate', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-08 04:05:21', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
