(95985489, 0, 'BUSINESS MANAGER - SALES for NOIDA Location Job', 'INDOWAYS E COMMERCE AND SALES PRIVATE LIMITED', '', '1', '0', '', '4', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Noida', '    Business Manager - Sales Sales Manager    ', '', '28', '82', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Startups are the lifeblood of innovation. As a Startup Program Lead, you will help guide and recruit startups to bring their imagination and innovative ideas and deliver them using INDOWAYS platform, tools, apps, and services. You will empower startups to leverage the full opportunity of working with INDOWAYS, give them access to our innovation by enabling their business and technology, and build successful paths for these startups to go-to-market.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\nÂ· Enable at-scale platform partnerships across INDOWAYS for Work - INDOWAYS Apps.\r\n\r\nÂ· Work closely with developers, partners, INDOWAYS product management and engineering to enable and drive open API level integration with platform partners.\r\n\r\nÂ· Shape the marketplace to provide superior monetization options and models for the long-tail of platform partners and startups.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMinimum qualifications:\r\n\r\nÂ· Min.4-5 years of work experience, including 3 years of experience at a startup or VC, incubator/accelerator.\r\n\r\nÂ· 2 years of experience working with cloud and application platforms and application delivery for web-based applications. Experience with cloud platforms and applications landscape.\r\n\r\nÂ· Experience working in a technical environment.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPreferred qualifications:\r\n\r\nÂ· Graduation/Post-Graduation, Any.\r\n\r\nÂ· Min. 3-4 years of rich experience in Sales.\r\n\r\nÂ· Good Convincing skills.\r\n\r\nÂ· Strong analytical and financial modeling skills with Profit and Loss ownership. Demonstrated ability to think strategically about complex issues and develop thoughtful recommendations and action plans.\r\n\r\nÂ· Product savvy, and passionate about making startups successful and growing our platform business.', 'Email: hrnoidaindoways@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9718890525', ' Graduation/Post-Graduation', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-08 04:16:05', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
