(95985494, 0, 'Marketing Executive - Thyrocare Technologies Ltd Job', 'Thyrocare Technologies Ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Mumbai', '    Marketing executive Sales executive    ', '', '31', '72', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Dear Candidate,\r\n\r\nThyrocare Technologies Ltd is hiring for \"Marketing Executive\", below is the job description of the same :\r\n\r\nJob Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n    Visit the clients & give them information regarding the health checkup profiles.\r\n    Guide the customers about the health checkup profiles specifications by understanding their needs\r\n    Cold calling to the clients.\r\n    Responsible for Strategic Tie up and Alliances with brands critically centric to growth\r\n    Identifying new target segments for business alliances to multiply revenue\r\n    Create Thyrocare brand awareness in the market through online & offline Marketing tie-up\r\n    Initiating various offline activities through corporate tie-ups\r\n    Selection and forming alliances with new offline channel partners\r\n\r\nPerson Specification:\r\n\r\n    Readiness for field marketing\r\n    Good written and verbal communication\r\n    Age : 21 to 27 years\r\n\r\nQualification: Any Graduate\r\nDesignation: Marketing Executive\r\nExperience: 0 to 1 year\r\nGender: Male\r\nCTC: 2 LPA to 2.5 LPA\r\nJob Location : Metro Cities\r\n\r\nInterested candidates can forward their resumes to jobs@thyrocare.com with subject line \"Marketing Executive\"', ' jobs@thyrocare.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '10 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-10 03:12:51', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
