re being already mentioned to you, on the due date.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe concern person you have to Report is Ms.Simran\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPlease confirm your availability and if you have any query please feel free to contact me.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNote: You needs to carry 2 copies of your Profile , ID Proof, Last three months payslips, Hard copy of this mail and other docs the candidates need to carry the particular interview.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nInterview Venue:Â­\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThanking you,\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMs.Simran\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHR Executive\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n9818151857 , 9873300814\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEmail--Excellentjobsolutionpvtltd@gmail.com\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNote : Calling timing is 10:30am to 5:30pm\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nD246/10, BALAJI CHAMBER 2nd FLOOR, NEAR METRO STATION GATE\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNO.1, IN FRONT OF DR. KHULLAR CLINIC, Delhi ,LAXMI NAGAR110092', '', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '11 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-11 01:54:57', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985499, 0, 'CS (company Secretary) Job', 'DaVita Care (India) Private Limited', '', '2', '0', '', '2', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'Finance Database Company Secretarial Activities RBI ', '', '31', '121', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Having handled listed company\'s all secretarial responsibilities independently, including but not limited to, filing, registering any document including forms, returns and applications by and on behalf of the company as an authorized representative; ensuring that all company secretarial procedures are both followed and regularly reviewed; maintenance of secretarial records, statutory books and registers; arranging board/general meetings and preparing minutes thereof; etc.\r\n\r\n2. Very well aware on 2013 Company\'s Act Compliance as well as RBI and SEBI compliances from a private companys perspective.\r\n\r\n3. Experienced in FDI compliance.\r\n\r\n4. Management of database - updating, tracking, renewing, and working with teammates, working with Legal Head in creating templates.\r\n\r\n5. Acting as repository for legal and secretarial matters.\r\n\r\n6. Preferably a background in either legal or finance.', '    Company Name: DaVita Care (India) Private Limited\r\n    Email: pawan.kerketta@davita.com', 'CS', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '11 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-11 01:57:11', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985500, 0, 'Company Secretary Job', 'BFC Forex & Financial Services Pvt. Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Mumbai', '', '', '10', '121', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'To arrange the meetings of the Board of Directors and to prepare and maintain the agenda and minutes for the same.\r\n*To arrange the general meetings of the members of the company and to prepare and maintain the agenda and minutes for the same.\r\n    Company Name: BFC Forex & Financial Services Pvt. Ltd.\r\n    Company Description:\r\n\r\n    BFC Forex & Financial Services PVT LTD (BFC Forex) is part of the BFC Group.  In India, BFC Forex and Financial Services Private Limited was incorporated on December 21, 2004. The Company is licensed by the RBI to act as a \"FFMC since 2005\r\n    Email: leena.khaire@bfcforex.com', '   Email: leena.khaire@bfcforex.com', 'CS', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '11 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-11 01:58:45', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985501, 0, 'BDM - IT Only Job', 'Conscious Foundation.', '', '2', '0', '', '2', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Jaipur', '  Post-SalesBDMBIDDINGMarketing', '', '23', '48', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Business Development Manager\r\n\r\nQualification & Skills\r\n1. Ability to present in a professional, confident and friendly manner, both in person and over the phone\r\n\r\n2. Outstanding communication and inter personal skills\r\n\r\n3. Exceptional proven business development and networking skills\r\n\r\n4. Ability to motivate and follow through on leads generated and reporting their status\r\n\r\n5. Dynamic and sales focused\r\n\r\n6. Ability to use MS Word, Excel and Power point confidently and professionally\r\n\r\n7. Mature approach while handling clients\r\n\r\nKey Responsibilities\r\n1. Handling pre-sales, post-sales and knowledge of bidding on Freelancer, Upwork, etc.\r\n\r\n2. Develop and implement sales plans in order to win business of corporate clients and competitors\r\n\r\n3. Coordinate between Development Team and Operations Manager\r\n\r\n4. Write Business Proposals\r\n\r\n5. Manage sales process from lead generation to conversion\r\n\r\n6. Deliver sales presentations to new and key corporate clients\r\n\r\n7. Ensure promotion of eSageIT activities are maintained and assist the organisation in various promotional events\r\n\r\n8. Generate reports of sales, marketing strategies and determine client needs\r\n\r\n9. Possess technical knowledge of Web Designing and Digital Marketing to explain intricacies to clients, if need be\r\n\r\n10. You will have to move around in the market to get business\r\n\r\nWork Experience: Minimum 2 years\r\nLocation: Jaipur', 'Email: shikha@consciousfoundation.in\r\nTelephone: 9799356878', 'Any Graduate', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '11 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-11 02:02:12', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985502, 0, 'VACANCY IN FINANCIAL ANALYST Job', 'bright future career solution', '', '3', '0', '', '0', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', ' HNIBank AuditBanking OperationsKYCBank GuaranteeCasaAccounting ConceptsEconomicsSalesBank DebtOperations ConsultingOperationsMarketingPOManagementAccount HandlingRTGSBillingAcquisitionBusiness developmentBank AccountingBranch salesCorporate salesKYCOperations Management', '', '10', '1', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Financial Analyst Job Description\r\n\r\n\r\nPosition Description: Financial Analyst\r\n\r\nBasic Function: The financial analyst position is accountable for reviewing larger investment proposals for return on investment, investigating a variety of internal financial and operational issues, and staying abreast of industry conditions and competitor activities.\r\n\r\nPrincipal Accountabilities:\r\n\r\n1. Investigate operational and financial results and make recommendations for improvements\r\n\r\n2. Conduct cost-benefit analyses\r\n\r\n3. Review capital budgeting proposals and make acceptance recommendations to management\r\n\r\n4. Review indicators of business activity published by the government and trade associations\r\n\r\n5. Create forecasts of future business conditions using multiple scenarios\r\n\r\n6. Review and recommend different types of investments based on risk and return analysis\r\n\r\n7. Stay abreast of developments in those industries in which the company operates\r\n\r\n8. Prepare and periodically update an analysis of the industries in which the company operates\r\n\r\n9. Prepare and update a competitor analysis\r\n\r\n10. Create financial models using electronic spreadsheets\r\n\r\n11. Create PowerPoint presentations summarizing the results of analyses and present the results to senior management\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nLocation: Pan India\r\n\r\nQualification: Minimum Graduation\r\n\r\nWe are hiring fresher candidates\r\n\r\nSalary will be-2.5lac to 3.5lac p/a\r\n\r\nExperienced candidates salary will be 30% hike from the last salary\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOnly interested candidates send resume between 10am to 5:30pm monday to Saturday.\r\n\r\nMISS. KANGANA KAUSHIK\r\n\r\n09910284797\r\n\r\nbrightfuturecareersolution45@gmail.com', 'Email: brightfuturecareersolution45@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9910284797', 'Graduate', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '14 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-14 02:38:34', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985503, 0, 'Operation Manager, Bank Job', 'subrata kanti das', '', '3', '0', '', '0', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Bilaspur', 'sales Branch sales acquisition RTGS Banking Operations Corporate sales KYC Hni Marketing Business development Casa PO ', '', '28', '1', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'job desription\r\n\r\n- Looking for new clients including corporate deposit, treasury, credit limit assessment and others cross sell businesses.\r\n\r\n- Meeting own volume & value target.\r\n\r\n- Generating new to bank business.\r\n\r\n- Helping others department to finish transactions with his clients including settling in deferral list, negotiating with clients.\r\n\r\n- Ability to analyze Balance Sheet and Financial Statements and prepare the credit proposal in line with bank\'s process of credit approval\r\n\r\n- Exposure to MME and Corporate Clients (No retail finance experience required)\r\n\r\n- Maintaining the existing facilities and deposit customers relationship.\r\n\r\n- Creating new relationships from existing customers- referral.\r\n\r\n- Concerning the situation about each existing facilities customers, passing whole information to supervisor and credit department, if necessary, shift the overdue customers to watching list (early warning) and account planning even calling back the loan.\r\n\r\n- Helping others department to finish transactions with his clients.\r\n\r\n- People with Public Sector Banks with Credit Analyst back ground would be given preference.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nfresher salary=1.5lac to 5.5laqc\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nexperinced salary  will be 35%hike from the last\r\n\r\nsalary\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nfor further query contact miss riya singh', 'GLOBAL SERVICES & TEAM\r\n\r\n \r\nEmail: hrglobalservices233@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 09717003138', 'Graduate', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '14 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-14 02:42:14', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
