(95985510, 0, 'Software Test Engineer, QC Software Testing for IT Company at Jankpri Location', 'CMTS (Core Management & Technical Services)', '', '1', '0', '', '3', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Noida ', 'QC Software Testing for IT Company at Jankpri Location Software Test Engineer ', '', '16', '123', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Urgent Positions for Software Testing Profile for Renowned IT Company at Jankpuri Locations.\r\n\r\nPost- Software Test Engineer, QC Software Testing\r\n\r\nExp-4-6 Yeras\r\n\r\nsalary-4.5-6,Laks\r\n\r\nLocation-Jankpuri East Location\r\n\r\nJob Detail and Responsibilities-\r\n\r\n1. 4+ years of relevant experience.\r\n\r\n2. Test Planning and Execution.\r\n\r\n3. Developing and executing test cases.\r\n\r\n4. Should have knowledge of Defect Management, Bug life cycle.\r\n\r\n5. Proficient in different types of Testing like Integration, Regression, Sanity, User Acceptance testing etc.\r\n\r\n6. Understanding of QA metrics and reporting.\r\n\r\n7. Ability to work together with other QA staff to accomplish all daily QA tasks on-time with a high level of quality.\r\n\r\n8. Excellent written and verbal communication skills.\r\n\r\n9. Must be a team player with the ability to manage multiple tasks in a deadline driven environment.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nInrested candiadtes can call to Aditya kumar 8527750087 or mail your cv on hr@cmts.in', 'Email: hr@cmts.in\r\nTelephone: 9631857963', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '16 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-16 06:38:00', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985511, 0, 'Lab Executive - Thyrocare Technologies Ltd', 'Thyrocare Technologies Ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Navi Mumbai', '    M.Sc Biochemistry Lab Processing MLT B.Sc Biochemistry    ', '', 'Select Industry', '106', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Dear Candidate,\r\n\r\nThyrocare Technologies Ltd is hiring for \"Lab Executive\", below is the job description of the same :\r\n\r\nJob Responsibilities :\r\n\r\n    To receive, analyze, archive, carry out QC and attend to complaints for the specimens (urine / blood /serum) received for the analysis on one of few of the following technology/department: CLIA, Biochemistry, Photometry, ELISA, Flowcytometry, Nephelometry, RIA, Hematology, Analytical Chemistry, Water Testing unit, Cytogenetic.\r\n    To run the QC on analyzers and monitor quality of reporting. Co-ordinate with engineering and quality team for down-time or reviewing the standard operating procedures as per requirement.\r\n    To gain knowledge and develop operational skills and expertise through trainings conducted by supervisors and automation providers.\r\n    Keep abreast with scientific and technological advancements in this space.\r\n\r\nSkill Requirements:\r\n\r\n    Keen interest in learning automation, technologies and Science\r\n    Attention to details and precision\r\n    Good analytical skill and sensitivity to reporting\r\n\r\nDepartment : Laboratory\r\n\r\nDesignation : Executive\r\n\r\nQualification : B.Sc / M.Sc Biochemistry, DMLT, MLT\r\n\r\nJob Location : Navi Mumbai\r\n\r\nInterested candidates can forward their resumes to jobs@thyrocare.com with subject line \"Lab Executive\"', 'Email: jobs@thyrocare.com', 'B.Sc / M.Sc Biochemistry, DMLT, MLT', '', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '16 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-16 06:41:42', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985512, 0, 'QA EXECUTIVE FOR PHARMA', 'Connecting corporate Placement Service', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bhopal', 'Pharma ', '', '31', '106', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'JOB TITLE: QA EXECUTIVE (FROM PHARMA BACKGROUND ONLY)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n No. of Position:   04 (Male/Female)\r\n\r\n Salary:      for 3 profile (15000-20000pm)\r\n\r\n                 for 1 profile (20000-25000pm)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDIMENSONS OF THIS ROLE:\r\n\r\n-   Review of Analytical / Inspection Specifications:                Medication, Bulk, Packed Product and RM & PM.\r\n\r\n-   Review of Master Batch Records: Medication & Bulk â€“         BPR and PDR & report to Manager QA for Approval.\r\n\r\n-   Notify the OOS and report to Manager QA.\r\n\r\n-   Calibration of equipment: Review of annual calibration     plan and make sure that lab should follow the same.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for preparing SOPs related to QA.\r\n\r\n-   Prepare SIP audit schedules and track action plan             completion.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for review of Raw and Packing Material,         Bulk and FG Specifications.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for tracking the consumer/customer and       Regulatory complaints.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for tracking the Deviations and Change         Control at the site.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for preparing Quality events (RM and FG)       and forward to Manager QA/QC.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for preparing the validation (process)           protocol, BPRâ€™s and PDRâ€™s.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for Mock recall exercise as per SOP. &             forward to Manager QA.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for preparing annual product review for         the products as per SOP & forward to Manager QA\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for handling of                                               Product/process/packaging validation & forward to           Manager QA for approval.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for the equipment validation as per               validation master plan.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for updating the PQM data.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for updating Quality score card.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for receiving and reviewing the technical       standards.\r\n\r\n-   Responsible for distribution of relevant technical               standards to QC.\r\n\r\n-    Responsible for updating RM/PM approved supplier          list and distributing the same to Warehouse and QC. .\r\n \r\n\r\nKEY RESPONSIBILITIES:\r\n\r\nControl Function: Inspection of in-process materials.\r\n\r\nTechnical Function: Documentation Control (SOPâ€™s), Preparation of QA SOPâ€™s and reviews of Protocols, specifications and master production records and process/product validation.\r\n\r\nCompliance Function: Responsible to carry out investigation for consumer/customer complaints and non compliances etc.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nKEY BEHAVIOURAL COMPETENCIES REQUIRED:\r\n\r\n- Leadership skills - Communication skills\r\n\r\n- Technical Knowledge - Decision making\r\n\r\n- Managerial skills - Analytical skills\r\n\r\n- People Management - Planning skills\r\n \r\n\r\nEXPERIENCE/KNOWELDGE/TECHNICAL SKILLS REQUIRED:\r\n\r\n3 to 5 yrs â€“ at least 2 yrs in senior levels in Quality Assurance at Pharmaceutical Companies.\r\n\r\nPost Graduate Professional Qualification like M.Sc. M. Pharm or PhD.\r\n\r\nMS Office-Familiar with Excel, Word, Power point\r\n\r\nThorough knowledge of Various Pharmacopoeia, Manufacturing processes and Test Methods of Drug Forms, cGMP norms, should be trained in QA systems & auditing.\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nInterested candidate send resume at :\r\n\r\n connecting.indore108@gmail.com\r\n\r\n connecting.indore114@gmail.com\r\n\r\n Time : 10:00 AM To 6:00 PM\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nNote : Kindly Revert back with your conformation about your availability\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThanks\r\n\r\n Pooja \r\n\r\nAddress : Connecting Corporates Services\r\n\r\n   212, 4rth Floor Sterling Tower Near Apollo Tower M.G Road Palasia Indore - 7400709360, 7400709361, 0731- 4209695', '', 'B.Sc / M.Sc Biochemistry, DMLT, MLT', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '16 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-16 06:43:52', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
