(95985514, 0, 'Business Development Executive', 'EXCEL NET SOLUTIONS PVT. LTD.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Gurgaon', 'Good com Skill m.b.a', '', '29', '123', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Job brief\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a competitive and trustworthy Sales Executive to help us build up our business activities. You will be responsible for discovering and pursuing new sales prospects and maintaining customer satisfaction.\r\n\r\nThe goal is to meet and surpass the companyâ€™s expectations to drive rapid and sustainable growth .\r\n\r\nResponsibilities\r\n\r\nConduct market research to identify selling possibilities and evaluate customer needs\r\n\r\nActively seek out new sales opportunities through cold calling, networking and social media\r\n\r\nSet up meetings with potential clients and listen to their wishes and concerns\r\n\r\nPrepare and deliver appropriate presentations on products/ services\r\n\r\nCreate frequent reviews and reports with sales and financial data\r\n\r\nEnsure the availability of stock for sales and demonstrations\r\n\r\nParticipate on behalf of the company in exhibitions or conferences\r\n\r\nNegotiate/close deals and handle complaints or objections\r\n\r\nCollaborate with team to achieve better results\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n\r\nProven experience as a sales executive or relevant role\r\n\r\nProficiency in English\r\n\r\nExcellent knowledge of MS Office\r\n\r\nThorough understanding of marketing and negotiating techniques\r\n\r\nFast learner and passion for sales\r\n\r\nSelf-motivated with a results-driven approach\r\n\r\nAptitude in delivering attractive presentations', 'Find us at www.investwellonline.com\r\n\r\n \r\nEmail: sweta@investwellonline.com\r\nTelephone: 9711199690', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '17 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-17 03:28:18', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985515, 0, 'Business Development Executive', 'Envision Recruitment Services Group', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'Business Development Presentation ', '', '29', '123', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Greetings from Indira manpower Consultancy ,\r\n\r\nRoles : Business Development Executive\r\n\r\nWork Location : Nellore ,Hyderabad , Bangalore , Chennai, Coimbatore , Pune ,Mumbai ,Delhi , Mysore , Trivandrum ,Cochi, Trichy, Madurai ,Salem .\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nEXP : Fresher Or Experience\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGender : Females\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSkills : \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nGood Looking\r\n\r\nExcellent Communication skills\r\n\r\nMaturity leve\r\n\r\n\r\nDynamic\r\n\r\nGood Presentation Skills \r\n\r\nflexible to traveling .\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nQlf : Any Degree / PG\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSalary : 2.4 To 3.6 Lacs\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nInterested candidates kindly send me your cv to Indirajobs5@gmail.com / 9494968949 / 8686967919\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    Functional Area:\r\n    Sales / BD Sector / Business Research\r\n    Industry:\r\n    IT - Software\r\n    Skills:\r\n    Business Development Presentation \r\n\r\n \r\nRecruiter details\r\n\r\n    Company Name: Indira Manpower Consultancy\r\n    Company Description:\r\n    Indira Manpower Consultancy\r\n     \r\n\r\n    Greetings from Indira Manpower Consultancy.\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    We are contacting you for serving your esteemed organisation. Here we would like to introduce our Company Indira Manpower Consultancy..., a mid size IT and NON IT service firm based out of Nellore. For your convenience I am sharing our Company Profile, request you to review the same and revert back with an option to get in touch with you in regards to our recruitment services to your company.\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    It gives us immense pleasure introducing ourselves as an organisation which is into the business of providing innovative & customized staffing solutions. Indira Manpower Consultancy has been established Feb - 2016 with an aim to offer the best of the services to its clientele at every point in time.\r\n\r\n    Furthermore, our core competency lies in our own people who have got huge experience under their belts and have served organisations of repute before joining us. This gives us a cutting - edge in offering the best of the desired services to our clients. We have been offering staffing solutions to a lot of prominent companies, across India .And, we wish to serve you in the same way, if given a chance.\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    As the business environment is changing at a rapid pace, and people employed in organisations have always played a pivotal role. Therefore, finding the right talent and nurturing them in alignment to the organisation goals have remained as one of the biggest challenges for every organisation world over. We at Indira Manpower Consultancy understand the significance of the understanding the business and then offering the most appropriate candidate with the pre-requisite skills for the same.\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    We would remain obliged if you could give us an opportunity of serve you with our consultative services with prime focus on staffing. We assure you the best of the services as desired always.\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    Our Services :\r\n\r\n    * Out Sourcing \r\n\r\n    * Pay Role - Contact to hire\r\n\r\n    * Liasoning works .............\r\n\r\n     \r\n\r\n    Thanks & Regards\r\n\r\n    Naresh P â€“ Proprietor\r\n\r\n       Indira Manpower Consultancy\r\n\r\n               Indiraclients@gmail.com\r\n\r\n               Mob: +91 9494968949 / 8686967919 - \r\n\r\n    LIG-2, Housing Board Colony, Kallurupalli, Nearby Saibaba temple - Nellore - AP\r\n\r\n    FOLLOW YOUR HEART BUT TAKE YOUR BRAIN WITH YOU\r\n    Email: indirajobs5@gmail.com\r\n    Telephone: 9494968949', 'Email: indirajobs5@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9494968949', 'Graduate', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '17 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-17 03:32:15', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
