growth, in line with the set targets. Implement customer contact programs to ensure his share of wallet with the bank increases. Close monitoring of average revenue per customer.\r\n\r\nRetention â€“\r\nEnsure top class service delivery to clients to be in line with the best in the industry.\r\nMonitor high net worth accounts closely to ensure that customers continue regular use the account and grow balances.\r\nWork towards reactivating accounts which have stopped transacting or depleted in balances.\r\n\r\nDesired Candidate Profile â€“\r\nCandidate should have experience in servicing or sourcing clients of 20 lacs+ relationship. Candidates from Banking / Premium Club Membership / (Paid) High End Credit Card Sales background will be preferred.\r\nCandidate should have excellent communication in English and well groomed.\r\nMinimum qualification required is Graduation.\r\n\r\nSalary: 1.8 Lacs to 5.8 Lacs\r\n\r\nIndustry: Banking / Financial Services/ Back Office / Broking / Operations / Sale & Marketing\r\n\r\nFunctional Area: Financial Services, Banking, Investments, Insurance\r\n\r\n Selection Process : Interview and BFSI Examination (Mandatory)\r\n\r\nRole Category: Mutual Funds/Fund Management/Asset Management\r\n\r\nKey skills: Banking Operations Branch Banking bank\r\n\r\nEducation :- Graduates and Post Graduates (Any Stream)\r\n\r\nDocuments Required :- One Any ID Proof Xerox, One 10th Class Certificate Xerox, Four Passport Size Photographs and Updates C.V., Printout of this Advertisement is Mandatory\r\n\r\nJ\r\n\r\nPost Resume :- jobtalent.cth@gmail.com\r\n\r\nNow Can \'Walk In\' at Our Corporate office of given below.\r\n\r\nInterview Timings: - 12:30 PM to 04:00 PM\r\n\r\nVenue : B-120, 1st Floor, Ganesh Nagar, Near Janak Puri East Metro Station (Blue Line Metro), Opposite Metro Pillar Number 548 or Opposite Vijay Sales Outlet, Janak Puri, Delhi-110058.\r\n\r\n(We are not any Consultancy or Placement Office) If it is Irrelevant, so please Ignore it.\r\n\r\nRegards\r\n\r\nCorporate Talent Hunt\r\n\r\nContact No. (9643189689)', 'Email: corporatetalenthunt.ashwin@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9643189689', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '22 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-22 00:51:39', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
