(95985537, 0, 'Vacancy in Financial Analyst', 'bright future career solution', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '   HNIBank AuditBanking OperationsKYCBank GuaranteeCasaAccounting ConceptsEconomicsSalesBank DebtOperations ConsultingOperationsMarketingPOManagementAccount HandlingRTGSBillingAcquisitionBusiness developmentBank AccountingBranch salesCorporate salesKYCOperations Management', '', '10', '1', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Financial Analyst Job Description\r\n\r\n\r\nPosition Description: Financial Analyst\r\n\r\nBasic Function: The financial analyst position is accountable for reviewing larger investment proposals for return on investment, investigating a variety of internal financial and operational issues, and staying abreast of industry conditions and competitor activities.\r\n\r\nPrincipal Accountabilities:\r\n\r\n1. Investigate operational and financial results and make recommendations for improvements\r\n\r\n2. Conduct cost-benefit analyses\r\n\r\n3. Review capital budgeting proposals and make acceptance recommendations to management\r\n\r\n4. Review indicators of business activity published by the government and trade associations\r\n\r\n5. Create forecasts of future business conditions using multiple scenarios\r\n\r\n6. Review and recommend different types of investments based on risk and return analysis\r\n\r\n7. Stay abreast of developments in those industries in which the company operates\r\n\r\n8. Prepare and periodically update an analysis of the industries in which the company operates\r\n\r\n9. Prepare and update a competitor analysis\r\n\r\n10. Create financial models using electronic spreadsheets\r\n\r\n11. Create PowerPoint presentations summarizing the results of analyses and present the results to senior management\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nLocation: Pan India\r\n\r\nQualification: Minimum Graduation\r\n\r\nWe are hiring fresher candidates\r\n\r\nSalary will be-2.5lac to 3.5lac p/a\r\n\r\nExperienced candidates salary will be 30% hike from the last salary\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOnly interested candidates send resume between 10am to 5:30pm monday to Saturday.\r\n\r\nMISS. KANGANA KAUSHIK\r\n\r\n09910284797\r\n\r\nbrightfuturecareersolution45@gmail.com', '', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '28 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-28 05:19:57', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985538, 0, 'Banks are hiring freshers for banking operations', 'Optimist Solution', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', ' salesBranch salesacquisitionRTGSBanking OperationsCorporate salesKYCHniMarketingBusiness developmentCasaPO', '', '10', '13', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Job Role and Responsibilities: \r\n\r\n1. Maintain productivity\r\n\r\n\r\n2 .Perform compliance, service and operations in branch\r\n\r\n\r\n3. Generate revenue through privilege customers \r\nMeet annual targets\r\n\r\n4.Handling Customer Issues and providing a proper resolution on day to day basis.\r\n\r\n5.Assist and support administrative staff in day to day operation.\r\n\r\n6.Support Sales staff in handling and documenting customer accounts/information.\r\n\r\n7.Data management refers to drafting checking various documents required by the management.\r\n\r\n8.On request of clients checking their portfolio or bank statements as per their need.\r\n\r\n9.Reverting on e-mails and other important information related to Financial and Non Financial Transactions.\r\n\r\n10.Cross-checking and Verifying KYC, Financial Transactions and forwarding to local CAMS for further Processing.\r\n\r\nJob location=PAN INDIA,NEAR BY LOCATION\r\n\r\nFRESHER SALARY=1.5lac to 3.5lac \r\n\r\nexperinced salary will hike from the 35% to 45%\r\n\r\nfor further query contact and interview call \r\n\r\nMISS RAINA GROVER=9717930724\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nand send to resume optimistsolution333@gmail.com', '    Company Name: Optimist Solution\r\n    Email: optimistsolution444@gmail.com\r\n    Telephone: 9717930724', 'Any Graduate', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '28 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-28 05:21:50', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985539, 0, 'Hiring Fresher candidates for Java', 'Iskylar Technologies', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Jaipur', 'software developer java jobs in jaipur Fresher java developer ', '', '23', '40', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Position Overview \r\nEmployee will be responsible for acting as a key participant in design, development, testing, support and maintenance of new projects, and ongoing enhancements. \r\nDesignation: Software Developer\r\n\r\n\r\nSalary is no bar for the right candidate.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTechnical Requirements \r\n1) J2EE/JavaWeb\r\n\r\n2) JSP/Servlet\r\n\r\n3) Java: JDBC connectivity\r\n\r\n4) MySql Database : basic configuration / simple and complex queries / Queries optimization\r\n\r\n5) Javascript : Ajax / validation / jQuery components\r\n\r\n6) HTML/CSS\r\n\r\n7) Tomcat : basic configuration/ installation/ full application deployment/ partial application deployment.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBenefits\r\n\r\nBest Professional Experience\r\nOpportunity for Career & Professional Growth\r\nHealthy Work Environment', 'Email: iskylar.technologies@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 0141404309', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '28 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-28 05:24:48', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985540, 0, 'Opening for Software Trainee', 'Squad Infotech Pvt Ltd', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '0', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', 'Pune', 'Java Core Java', '', '23', '40', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Greetings for the Day. !!\r\n\r\nUrgent opening for Java Developer profile.\r\n\r\nPosition:- Java Developer\r\n\r\nNo.of Positions:- 05\r\n\r\nExperience:- Fresher\r\n\r\nGender:- NA\r\n\r\nProfessional Course:- Must have done Certification / Course in Java (Mandatory for Freshers).\r\n- Should have strong knowledge of Javascript,HTTP/HTML,SQL,MYSQL.\r\n- Should have strong knowledge of algorithm programming.\r\n- Ability to understand complex concepts and bridge the gap between technology and business.\r\n- Excellent written and oral communication skills and the ability to communicate with on shore teams.\r\n- Ability to work independently and part of a team Additional Skills.\r\n- Should have good analytical and problem solving skills.\r\n- Should be technically strong & smart.\r\n- Should have good verbal & written communication\r\n\r\nQualification:- BSC.IT, BSC.CS, BE.IT, BE.CE, BE.EXTC, MCA\r\n\r\nPercentage Criteria:- NA\r\n\r\nPass Out Year:- NA\r\n\r\nJob Location:- Pune\r\n\r\nBond:- NA', 'Email: itfresher2@squadinfotech.in\r\nTelephone: 8108174005', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '28 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-28 05:26:19', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
