(95985542, 0, 'SAP Hybris Architect', 'Talon Project Management Pvt. Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '10', '20', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '7', '', '', '', 'Hyderabad', '    Skills:     SSOApplicationB2CesbApplication DevelopmentarchitectHibernateSoftwareB2BJMS', '', '23', '22', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Hybris Architect shall provide technical leadership to Hybris implementations and support new business efforts. The role collaborates with development teams and client stakeholders for the design, development, and deployment of Hybris Solutions / integration, in an effort to exceed the needs of our customers.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nÂ· 10+ years of experience building enterprise applications and 6+ years implementing Hybris applications for B2B and B2C clients\r\n\r\nÂ· Experience in architecting full-lifecycle implementations of at least 4 projects using Hybris and JEE.\r\n\r\nÂ· Experience implementing all modules of eCommernce (Product Information, Content Management, Order Management, Pricing and Promotions in both B2B, B2B, B2B2C environments).\r\n\r\nÂ· Experienced in architecting JEE based applications using Spring/OSGi, Hibernate, JMS, REST, SOA, ESB and SSO technologies.\r\n\r\nÂ· Extensive implementation knowledge of Software Design Patterns & multi-threaded Asynchronous Programming Models\r\n\r\nÂ· Experience with various code management and continuous integration tools: Maven, Jenkins, Bamboo\r\n\r\nÂ· Experience with complete application development life-cycle including requirements gathering, analysis and design, development, integration, testing, deployment, maintenance and support.\r\n\r\nÂ· Experience in driving development using Agile/Scrum processes\r\n\r\nÂ· Ability to drive complex estimates that take one or more projects into account and to effectively communicate risks and dependencies to client.\r\n\r\nÂ· Manage multiple tasks and projects in a very dynamic environment\r\n\r\nPossess good organizational, interpersonal and communication skills.', 'Email: deepika.singh@talonpvt.com', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '29 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-29 06:02:41', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
