candidates salary will be 30% hike from the last salary\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOnly interested candidates send resume between 10am to 5:30pm monday to Saturday.\r\n\r\nMISS. KANGANA KAUSHIK\r\n\r\n09910284797\r\n\r\nbrightfuturecareersolution45@gmail.com', 'MISS. KANGANA KAUSHIK\r\n\r\n09910284797\r\n\r\nbrightfuturecareersolution45@gmail.com', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '30 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-30 00:53:36', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', '');
