(95985552, 0, 'R&D', 'Indifoss Analytical Pvt. Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '3', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Denmark', 'R R&D Development D ', '', '32', '117', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'As assembly worker will work with installation of mechanical high precision components for our test setups and instruments. Additionally, you will work with assembly and soldering of connectors and wires and machining. Part of the work also consists in carrying out final tests and preparing test reports.\r\n\r\nYou will be working in Instrument Development / Test Equipment, which is an exciting interdisciplinary department with 10 employees with expertise in electronics, mechanics and SW.\r\n\r\nqualifications\r\n\r\nFor this position it is not your education, but your qualifications and your experience is crucial. We imagine that you have experience with print and cable / connector hand soldering, including lead-free solder. We emphasize that you have your hands properly tightened and can swing a file and handle a drill. You know how to get the job done in an efficient manner, without dwelling too much on the details. It is also necessary to have good English language skills, as all descriptions are drafted in English.\r\n\r\nPersonal characteristics\r\n\r\nYou are a team player with a positive attitude and courage to learn. You work systematically and are quality conscious, but knows how to get efficiency and quality to go up to a higher level. Because tasks often will change and priorities may change, it is important that you can quickly familiarize yourself with new tasks.\r\n\r\nWe offer\r\n\r\nAn international and dynamic working environment, where there are good opportunities to develop professionally and personally. At FOSS, we put the employees and the quality of cooperation loud. We believe that cooperation based on trust, open dialogue and clear objectives gives job and good colleagues who help each other. We want to motivate our employees to take responsibility and influence.', 'Indifoss Analytical Pvt. Ltd.\r\nEmail: vishal.chaudhari@indifoss.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '30 November, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-11-30 01:09:57', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985553, 0, 'Assistant Manager or Deputy Manager - Sales', 'Fever 104 FM', '', '1', '0', '', '3', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Hyderabad', '', '', '29', '48', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Roles & Responsibilities:\r\n\r\n    Maximizing sales revenues and achieving given sales targets.\r\n    Make proposals, agreements.\r\n    Promoting and selling advertising space on Radio and organizing On-ground activation for clients brand promotions.\r\n    Negotiating on rates and deliverables of a campaign with the buyers and managers and closing deals.\r\n    Interacting with clients:\r\n\r\n1. Creating briefs according to clients needs.\r\n\r\n2. Pitching of properties.\r\n\r\n3. Ensuring timely delivery of briefs.\r\n\r\n    Coordinating and integrating with the Programming and the Creative team.\r\n    Gathering market and customer information.\r\n    Carrying out research on clients to understand their marketing strategy\r\n    Keep Business information and customer records up to date and finely tuned\r\n\r\nTechnical skills:\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Excellent knowledge of MS Office.\r\nâ€¢ Needs to be able to analyze and interpret any given data.\r\n\r\nBehavioral skills:\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Exceptional interpersonal & communication skills \r\nâ€¢ Good at both written & oral skills.\r\nâ€¢ Strategic thinker.\r\nâ€¢ Strong client relationships.\r\nâ€¢ Understanding of client needs and brands', 'Email: resumes@fever.fm\r\nTelephone: 9711955560', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '05 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-05 02:16:25', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985554, 0, 'Requirement of Deputy Manager- Delhi Location', 'WaterMelon Management Services Pvt. Ltd', '', '1', '0', '', '4', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Delhi', 'Deputy Manager Service Sales', '', '7', '82', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'KRAs of Branch Manager & DY. Manager, (Level VI and VII)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n    Responsible for sale and service of all the Spares businesses of the entire state. \r\n    Responsible to achieve assigned targets of the assigned state. \r\n    Responsible for all strategic planning (objective based)\r\n\r\na) Long Term\r\n\r\nb) Short Term\r\n\r\nand implementation as well in order to achieve the assigned target of the state.\r\n\r\n    Monitoring and mentoring of the entire team members down the line. Maintaining harmony & Team sprit among team members. Responsible for the accountability and productivity of each and every team member.\r\n    Data base periodic review (Target V/s achievement) and maintaining records of the same. \r\n    Collecting information regarding opportunities for sales such as a constructive activity.\r\n    To be work as visionary to expand BPâ€™s network while understanding GAP analysis and strengthening the existing BPâ€™s network.\r\n    Introduction of new developed products successfully among the entire assigned state.\r\n    Responsible to launch the companyâ€™s promotional scheme in respect of products as well as sales to all concerned BPs.\r\n    Collecting information about competitorâ€™s Product, sales & promotion schemes, etc.\r\n    Timely sending all monthly reports as per provide formats (self as well as of the entire state team).\r\n    Responsible for the smooth day to day operation in respect of all manner to achieve BPs delight. \r\n    Efficiently participate in any promotion activity of territory assigned as per company norms. \r\n    Co-ordination with Regional Manager and implementation of Objective/Goal in line with the vision of the company. \r\n\r\n           5s Activities.\r\n\r\nMore Information on\r\n\r\n9873908903', 'More Information on\r\n\r\n9873908903', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '05 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-05 02:18:54', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(95985555, 0, 'Hiring for Deputy Manager into Service Department for a Automobile Industry', 'Indus Global Resources Portal', '', '1', '0', '', '5', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Delhi', ' WarrantyQuality ControlSalesEquipment MaintenanceWorkshop', '', '7', '72', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Mandatory \r\n\r\n    Should have experience from Auto Industry.\r\n    Should be from 4 wheeler(Passenger Vehicles) Industry only.\r\n    From Service and Marketing Industry.\r\n    Experience of more than 6 Years in the same field.\r\n    For Malad Location-Into dealership.\r\n    With Attractive Package.\r\n\r\nMAIN RESPONSIBILITIES:\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Ensure that the Service Department contributes to CS by providing optimal customer care.\r\nâ€¢ Increase customer market share.\r\nâ€¢ Meet dealerships sales goals (various).\r\nâ€¢ Establish Yearly Staff Training Targets.\r\nâ€¢ To prepare and submit accurate KPI report by end of every month.\r\nâ€¢ Identify potential Service & Service Parts marketing opportunities.\r\nâ€¢ Audit & review General Tools and Equipment maintenance register every month.\r\nâ€¢ Audit & review open and closed RO on a daily basis.\r\nâ€¢ To monitor & audit Toyota Warranty Claims on monthly basis.\r\nâ€¢ Ensure Safety & 4S in workshop, and customer vehicle care.\r\nâ€¢ To audit the results of Quality Control Inspections.\r\nâ€¢ To monitor FIR\'s sent to TKM.\r\nâ€¢ Attend all new model-training courses and conduct in-house training for all technicians.\r\nâ€¢ Audit & ensure all required Special Service Tools are available and in good working order.\r\nâ€¢ Conduct regular Technician meetings.\r\nâ€¢ To conduct regular internal meets between parts, service & sales.\r\nâ€¢ Monitor record and identify the causes of vehicle carryovers & Repeat repairs.\r\nâ€¢ Monitoring product technical bulletins and repair manuals.\r\nâ€¢ Motivate the Customer Service Staff.\r\nâ€¢ Conduct Analysis of Market Competitors, Market Conditions & Campaign Effectiveness.\r\nâ€¢ Advise SAs possible sales and profit opportunities.\r\nâ€¢ Ensure TQS & TSM standards are always maintained. \r\nâ€¢ Ensuring Training plan and implementation.\r\nâ€¢ Ensure efficient execution of all repair orders through providing sufficient tools and equipment.\r\nâ€¢ Monitor Expense control.\r\nâ€¢ Meet dealer performance & profit guidelines.\r\nâ€¢ Maintain zero comebacks by conducting random quality inspections and instructing Chief General Technician on self check procedures.\r\nâ€¢ Ensure technician retention and satisfaction (meet minimum Technician turnover rate).\r\nâ€¢ Maintain Technician motivation and morale.\r\nâ€¢ Ensure TQS & TSM standards are always maintained.\r\nâ€¢ Posses good people handling and leadership skills.\r\nâ€¢ Product and general Automobile Business knowledge.\r\nâ€¢ Proven customer relations skills both in person and over telephone.\r\nâ€¢ Proven ability to communicate and determine customerâ€™s needs and to sell the dealership\'s parts, service capabilities based on features, advantages and benefits', 'Email: hr1.igr@outlook.com\r\nTelephone: 02265656900', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '05 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-05 02:20:53', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
