(98979113, 0, 'Visa Executive - Pitampura (Delhi)', 'Streamsource Services.', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Delhi', 'Visa AssistanceVisa DocumentationVisa Processing', '', '37', 'Select Functional Area', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Dear Jobseeker,\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWe are looking for the Visa Executive for Pitampura location - Delhi. Please find the details below.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPlease find below the Company Profile & Job Description for Visa Executive.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCompany Profile: It is an IATA Accredited and IRCTC approved tours & Travel Company that provides one-stop travel solution to retail customers, network of travel agencies and corporate clients.\r\n\r\nIt is a part of PCTI Ltd. which is a multi-industry business group with businesses in education, travel, corporate training, and software development, web hosting and other industries.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\n\r\nMust have complete knowledge of all countries visaâ€™s(Should be able to fill visa applications independently and have complete knowledge of documentation requirement and visa procedures). \r\n Must have latest 6 months experience in handling visa in travel industry.\r\n Should have interest in rail and air ticket bookings. \r\n Good communication skills and good liaisoning skills with embassy.\r\n Responsible to fill visa applications independently and have completed documentation requirement and visa procedures of all countries.\r\n\r\nShould have interest in rail and air ticket bookings.\r\n\r\nGood communication skills and good liaisoning skills with embassy.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSalary Offered: Between 15 - 20 k pm\r\n\r\nJob Loaction: Pitampura - Delhi\r\n\r\nGender : Male / Female\r\n\r\nExperience: 6 Months - 1 Year\r\n\r\nNotice Period: Immediate Joiners.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPlease apply if you are interested.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNote: Its an urgent requirement.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nStreamsource Services\r\n\r\njobs@streamsourceindia.com', 'Streamsource Services\r\n\r\njobs@streamsourceindia.com', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-07 00:55:14', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
