(98979117, 0, 'Senior Web Developer', 'Divine Pixel & Codes Pvt Ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Delhi', '  CSSXHTMLJavascript', '', '40', '123', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'PHP5 - Candidate should be a top- notch PHP5 developer, familiar with the latest features in PHP 5.3.X and 5.4.X. \r\n MySQL - Modern database development expertise, words like \'trigger\' and \'view\' should be part of your vocabulary. \r\n Object\r\n\r\nOriented Development - Ideal candidates should understand object \r\n\r\noriented development, and apply OO concepts to everything they do. \r\n XHTML/ CSS/ Javascript/ AJAX - Expert level Javascript/ XHTML/ CSS development will be necessary. jQuery experience preferred. \r\n Self- Starter - Looking for candidates who can jump in quickly without a lot of direction. Php Skills: \r\n\r\n Hands- on any PHP based framework like CakePHP, CodeIgniter or YII \r\n Web Services - Experience building modern RESTful JSON / XML based Web services. Special Skills:', '    Company Name: Divine Pixel & Codes Pvt Ltd.\r\n    Email: hr1@divinepnc.com', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-07 01:06:10', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979118, 0, 'D & D ENGINEER', 'Panchal Manufacturing Co Private Limited', '', '2', '0', '', '4', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Faridabad', ' Product DevelopmentUG NXPPAPDesignDRAWINGCADDesigningIntegration', '', '23', '22', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Generate conceptual design in 3D and their 2D manufacturing drawings, installation drawings and apply GD&T by using UG NX\r\n\r\nWorks with Product development team and manufacturers and involved in the problem solving, if any, during the manufacturing stage.\r\n\r\nPrepare BOM and release CAD Model & drawing using NX7.5/8.5 in Teamcenter.\r\n\r\nAssembly & sequencing of various variants in Tractors using UG NX7.5/8.5 with integration with TeamcenteResponsible for New Product Development.\r\n\r\n\r\nCosting of New Product.\r\n\r\n\r\nDesigning of Tooling & Gauges.\r\n\r\n\r\nPPAP Documents submission.\r\n\r\n\r\nCoordination with customer', '36-A, Industrial area, NIT Faridabad 121004\r\n\r\n0129  2234453\r\nEmail: HR@PANCHALAUTO.COM\r\nTelephone: 7840816161', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-07 01:08:21', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979119, 0, 'Manager-Human Resource (Statutory Compliance)', 'Advance Group of Companies.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Delhi', ' BudgetPfAudit CompliancesPAYROLLESICLabour Law', '', '21', '139', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', '1) Understand/identify the key business challenges and people/organisation implications, derive an HR plan for the market\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Proactively identify people and organisation issues, and build agreement with the management team for the appropriate courses of action and priorities\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Manage the HR budget to deliver best value for money\r\n\r\n2) Develop, maintain and implement HR policies and processes to ensure transparent treatment for all staff, and compliance with all local labour law requirements\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Manage salary review and bonus planning and payout processes\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Ensure performance dialogues are held by all employees across the country to a high standard, and that managers have the necessary skills\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Ensure compliance with labour law in all markets\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Create a clear and compelling employment proposition, plan and implement the necessary processes and tools to deliver it\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Plan, design and implement policies and processes that support the growth agenda, drive employee engagement and development, and foster the conditions for high performance\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Communicate policies and process.\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Audit compliances with policies and processes; develop action plans to close gaps\r\n\r\n3) Build a strong pipeline of high potential talent that enables internal succession to key roles\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Identify critical roles and people (top 10% to 20% of roles) with management team (ie individual roles that create or protect significant value, or roles with high headcount levels to do the same)\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Identify talent pools for critical roles and ensure development plans and moves are implemented to provide the experience and learning required to realise their potential\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Develop the policies, processes and culture required to support this\r\n\r\n4) Manage senior recruitment processes, identify and manage recruitment suppliers and internal recruitment standards and practices/hiring skills\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Manage senior recruitment processes, and recruitment of critical positions\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Identify and evaluate recruitment partners; manage supplier relationships and performance versus value for money\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Support the assessment of senior management performance, and action planning\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Ensure there is an effective on boarding programme for new hires\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Develop recruitment skills/know-how amongst management (ie designing jobs, defining candidateâ€™s profiles required, designing recruitment process/selecting recruitment partner, managing selection process and decision making\r\n\r\n5) Support the growth of business through capability building programs focused on core competencies\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Diagnose capability gaps with management, and advise on appropriate actions\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Lead the design/sourcing and delivery of training and development solutions\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Develop a management development program to ensure managers keep pace with the challenges of growth and the market place\r\n\r\n6) Manage headcount planning inputs to annual budget process and advise on labor cost structures and organization/job design changes as necessary\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Track headcount, FTEs, outsourcing and associated costs\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Develop metrics for employee productivity and evaluate the correct sizing of headcount\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Provide productivity and cost structure analysis, working with finance\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Monitor and manage employee retention, satisfaction, absence rates\r\n\r\n7) Design/size, manage and develop the HR organization as appropriate, manage interface with Unit HR functions\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Specify job design and candidate profiles to promote an effective and high performing HR team\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Support the hiring and managing performance and development of HR team\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Support managing the exit of poor performers (create a strong performance culture)\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Develop and coach the team, and create the conditions necessary for the team to succeed\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Implement HR policies and programs as agreed , manage relationships with regional stakeholders', 'http://www.advancegroup.biz/\r\nEmail: tejendra.singh@advancegroup.biz\r\nTelephone: 9958111295', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-07 01:12:17', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979120, 0, 'Openings for Customer support executive with top MNC companies', 'Quess Corp Limited', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '  Customer Service Skills', '', '9', '11', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', ' Customer support executive role.\r\n\r\n*Voice/ Non voice process.\r\n\r\n* Salary from 12k to 24k ( take home).\r\n\r\n* UK/US/Day shift available.\r\n\r\n* Cab facility avaialable.\r\n\r\nCALL Neha@7676606556', '    Company Name: Quess Corp Limited\r\n    Email: meena.kumari@ikyaglobal.com\r\n    Telephone: 7676606556', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-08 02:16:47', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979121, 0, 'customer support executive', 'Squircle IT Consulting Services Pvt. Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'interpersonal skills', '', '24', '11', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Customer Service Executive plays a critical role in providing an interface between customers and the client company.We are looking for candidates who have good communications skills, interpersonal skills and can handle stress well.  A clear and pleasant speaking voice and fluency in English is also desired. The major skills and competencies that employers look for in a candidate are.\r\n \r\nGood communications skills.\r\nAbility to listen and active problem solving skills.\r\nGood interpersonal skills.\r\nAbility to handle pressure.', '    Company Name: Squircle IT Consulting Services Pvt. Ltd.\r\n    Email: recruiters.squircle@gmail.com', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-08 02:18:42', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979122, 0, 'Customer Support Executive', 'Stryde Consulting Services.', '', '2', '0', '', '1', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', ' Customer SupportVoice ProcessCSE', '', '9', '11', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'CSE (Customer Support Executive) are responsible for maintaining and developing client-business relationships. The work of the CSE can help make the public more aware of the business.\r\nThe CSE should demonstrate a sense of professionalism and courtesy that earns the trust of customers.\r\nFollow up on every customer related issues. Identify and develop problem-solving methodologies to resolve customer issues.\r\nCoordinating with Partners and Operation Team.\r\nTake full responsibility for managing a growing customer portfolio within the assigned region.\r\n\r\nSkills Required:-\r\n\r\nExcellent Communication\r\nCustomer Handling\r\nEnthusiastic\r\nCreative\r\nDetail-oriented', 'Email: edwin@strydeconsulting.com', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-08 02:20:41', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979123, 0, 'Marketing Executive', 'Career MAnagement CEnter', '', '2', '0', '', '1', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Dehradun ', '  Buisness DevelopmentSALESMARKETING', '', '29', '72', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'we need candidates for our company in bawana narela & Dehradoon location. \r\n\r\nREQUIREMENT:-\r\n1. 5 Marketing Executives.(SALARY UP TO 10000)\r\n2. 1 Marketing manager (SALARY UP TO 25000)\r\n3. 5 Marketing boys (for door to door marketing)(up to 5000 FIX SALARY BESIDE THAT INCENTIVES POLICIES )\r\n\r\nQUALIFICATION & OTHER \r\n1. For marketing manager candidates must have the experience of (3 to 4 years ) in same industry. \r\n2. He should be good command on English.\r\n3. He should be MBA in marketing.\r\n4. He should have good presentation skill.\r\n5. He must have the capability to handle a team of 10 marketing executive.\r\n6. Target achiever.\r\n7. For marketing executive we need at least graduate candidates.\r\n8. For door to door marketing we need 10th &12th pass candidates.\r\n\r\nCall us asap at 8800967303,8059509055,7404562453 & Visit us at Below Adress:\r\n\r\nRegards-komal\r\n\r\n_______________________________________\r\n\r\nBlue Panther Placement services.\r\n\r\nAbove ICICI Bank ATM,Nr. Vijaya Bank, Samaypur, Delhi.\r\n\r\nNearest Metro Station: Badli (Yellow Line)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTk2540@gmail.com', 'Email: tk2540@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 7404562452', 'MBA', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-08 02:22:54', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979124, 0, 'Marketing Manager', 'SHAZ LOGISTICS Pvt Ltd', '', '2', '0', '', '9', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Hyderabad', 'Logistics SalesFTLBusiness DevelopmentSalesTransportCommercialBusiness DevelopmentMarketing  Apply Send me similar jobs ', '', 'Select Industry', 'Select Functional Area', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Experience into Logistics Industry is necessary & should have handelled Marketing / Sales / Business Development profile in previous Organisation .\r\n\r\n2. Experience in filed of Surface Transportation, PTL, FTL, Cargo is neccessary.\r\n\r\n3 .Should be cable of developing indirect channel like BA or Franchisee.\r\n\r\n4 .Strong capability to generate business and achieve business growth from sales Team.\r\n\r\n5. Should have a good knowledge about Transport Industry in terms of Commercial transportation or Courrier Transportation.\r\n\r\n6 .Well versed with the concept PTL FTL Cargo .\r\n\r\n ', 'SHAZ LOGISTICS PVT Ltd ', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-08 02:25:26', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979125, 0, 'REQUIRED- BRANCH MARKETING MANAGER', 'Alpha One Management Services Hiring For Alpha One Management Services', '', '2', '0', '', '5', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Jaipur', '  Marketing ManagementBTLBusiness DevelopmentDirect MarketingMarketing', '', '37', '125', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'PLEASE MAIL your CV - anu.alphaoneindia@gmail.com\r\n\r\nPOSITION- Branch Marketing Manager\r\nCTC - Rs 6 Lacs PA + Incentives + Other Benefits\r\nBASE- Jaipur\r\n\r\n- Will be expected to handle entire Rajasthan, with a large team\r\n- Must have exposure of People Management and Leadership under marketing enviornment\r\n- Must understand BTL based marketing Planning & Execution.\r\n\r\nPLEASE MAIL your CV - anu.alphaoneindia@gmail.com\r\n\r\nRegards\r\n\r\nAnu\r\n\r\n9555757571\r\n\r\nAlpha One Management Services', 'Email: anu.alphaoneindia@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9555757571', 'MBA', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-08 02:27:46', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979126, 0, 'HIRING FOR BANK Investment Banking', 'Optimist Solution', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'Branch Operations Banking Bank Cash Retention Branch Manager Equity Investment Cashier Mutual Fund Branch Banking Branch Handling Operation Branch head ', '', '10', '10', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'JOB DESCRIPTION\r\n\r\nin branch\r\n\r\n3. Generate revenue through privilege customers \r\nMeet annual targets\r\n4.Handling Customer Issues and providing a proper resolution on day to day basis.\r\n5.Assist and support administrative staff in day to day operation.\r\n6.Support Sales staff in handling and documenting customer accountsinformation.\r\n7.Data management refers to drafting checking various documents required by the management.\r\n8.On request of clients checking their portfolio or bank statements as per their need.\r\n9.Reverting on e-mails and other important information related to Financial and Non Financial Transactions.\r\n10.Cross-checking and Verifying KYC, Financial Transactions and forwarding to local CAMS for further Processing.\r\nJob location=PAN INDIA,NEAR BY LOCATION\r\nFRESHER SALARY=1.5lac to 3.5lac \r\nexperinced salary will hike from the 35% to 45%\r\nfor further query contact and interview call \r\nMISS SANA KHAN=9818051599\r\nsend to resume optimistsolution666@gmail.com', 'OPTIMIST SOLUTION & TEAM\r\nEmail: optimistsolution666@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9818051599', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '13 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-13 01:41:37', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
