tomer pulse & need\r\n\r\nÂ§ Ensure customer queries are responded to satisfactorily as per MLIC standard.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDesired Competencies\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Sourcing & Selection capability\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Nurturing & Developing talent\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Result orientation\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Customer centricity\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Planning & Execution\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMOS:\r\n\r\nq Achievement of business plan & GPA\r\n\r\nq Recruitment / Development & Activisation of agent as per plan.\r\n\r\nq Persistency as per MLIC grid\r\n\r\nq Achieve GOLD Score as per MLIC standard\r\n\r\nq Number of EC/MDRT agent\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nInterested candidates can reach us at sudha@bhavyahr.com or 8309707155 or 8106919430\r\n\r\nif this mail is not relevant to you, kindly ignore. we appreciate your references.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nSudha Tammisetty\r\n\r\nHR-Recruiter\r\n\r\nSudha@bhavyahr.com\r\n\r\n8309707155 or 8106919430', 'Sudha Tammisetty\r\n\r\nHR-Recruiter\r\n\r\nSudha@bhavyahr.com\r\n\r\n8309707155 or 8106919430', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '13 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-13 01:45:44', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', '');
