nsure customer queries are responded to satisfactorily as per MLIC standard.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDesired Competencies\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Sourcing & Selection capability\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Nurturing & Developing talent\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Result orientation\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Customer centricity\r\n\r\nÃ˜ Planning & Execution\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMOS:\r\n\r\nq Achievement of business plan & GPA\r\n\r\nq Recruitment / Development & Activisation of agent as per plan.\r\n\r\nq Persistency as per MLIC grid\r\n\r\nq Achieve GOLD Score as per MLIC standard\r\n\r\nq Number of EC/MDRT agent\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nInterested candidates can reach us at sudha@bhavyahr.com or 8688223303 or 8106919430\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nif this mail is not relevant to you, kindly ignore. we appreciate your references.', 'Sudha@bhavyahr.com\r\n\r\n8688223303 or 8106919430ii', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '13 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-13 01:47:37', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979130, 0, 'Agency Development Manager', 'Apsire ERP Systems', '', '1', '0', '', '4', '9', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', ' SalesBusiness DevelopmentMarketing', '', '29', '111', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Urgent Openings for AGENCY DEVELOPMENT MANAGER WITH MULTI NATIONAL NO.1 LEADING LIFE INSURANCE CO.LTD\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTO APPLY BELOW JOB PLEASE CALL SUMIT PH: 9225666629\r\n\r\nEMAIL ID : aspireerpjobs4@gmail.com\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nTo be part of improving skills at managerial level pl apply with your cv.\r\n\r\nA Professional Process oriented with strong L&D, Training and development.\r\n\r\nJOB LOCATION : Mumbai, Banglore, Pune, Kolkata, Chennai.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSales/ Manager Distribution and\r\n\r\nCareer Growth Manger Sales - Sr. Manager- ABM- BM- Territory Manager.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJoin us and be a part of our ongoing endeavor to be the \"Most Admired Life Insurance Company in India. We are looking for Manager-Sales who want to take their career to soaring heights & thrive on challenges. Those who feel they can take up the challenge may join us with our expansion please reply with your updated cv\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nQualification: Gradauate+ 3Yrs exp.\r\n\r\nMBA +2Yrs minimum.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJOB Description(JD) : Profile - Handling the Team of Fos.(Chartered Accountants, Builders, Share Brokers, Real estate Agents, Small Scale Proprietors, Loan Agents, Dealer& Distributer,Commission Agents, Muti level marketing Professionals)\r\n\r\nRecruiting and Managing the team of Financial Consultants.\r\n\r\nTraining & Development of Agencies\r\n\r\nMarketing & Promoting the brand\r\n\r\nIRDA Licensing\r\n\r\nGiving business opportunity seminar to the Masses\r\n\r\nArranging IRDA training for the FC S\r\n\r\nGetting maximum business and achieving the sales target\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBusiness Development/ Sales Distribution through individual agencies.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAgency Recruitment Model.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n1. Targeted Area