(98979147, 0, 'SR. PHP DEVELOPER- SERAMPORE', 'Technokrats.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Kolkata', 'AJAXMYSQLPHPPHPWORDPRESSCODEIGNITER', '', '23', '138', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Position: Sr. PHP DEVELOPER\r\n\r\nJob Type: Full Time, Permanent.\r\n\r\nExperience: Min 2 yrs\r\n\r\nSkill: Sound in algorithm Core or Custom Development in either of â€“ PHP, MySQL, JavaScript, AJAX And/or Knowing different other technologies like OPPs, MVC, CI, Zend, Yii And/or Sound in CMF like WordPress/Joomla/Drupal, Magento/OpenCart/PrestaShop, And/or Specialization in any Payment Gateway like PayPal, Checkout, etc\r\n\r\nQualification: No Bar, we prefer skill and subjective knowledge rather than degrees.\r\n\r\nPreference: Capability of leading a web development project independently within deadline.\r\n\r\nAge Limit: 18+\r\n\r\nSalary: As per industry standards, no constraints for the right candidate.\r\n\r\nMin Vacancy : 2\r\n\r\nResponsibilities :Required candidate must be- 1. Competent in the areas as described above and should be able to lead any web development/software development project independently. 2. Should be a 100% team-man and co-operative to team-mates. 3. Should be sincere, dedicated & hardworking. 4. Should able to learn quickly with a strong devotion. 5. Should be able to meet aggressive deadlines without excuse. 6. Should be open and compatible with work culture of IT-industry.', 'Email: hr@technokrats.in\r\nTelephone: 9830158077', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '16 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-16 02:24:41', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979148, 0, 'PHP Developer', 'PSR TECHNO SERVICES PVT.LTD.', '', '2', '0', '', '5', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Kolkata', '', '', '23', '138', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Dear candidates,\r\n\r\nGreetings from psr techno servicess!!!\r\n\r\njob description:\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a PHP Developer responsible for managing back-end services and the interchange of data between the server and the users.\r\nYour primary focus will be the development of all server-side logic, definition and maintenance of the central database, and ensuring high\r\nperformance and responsiveness to requests from the front-end. You will also be responsible for integrating the front-end elements built by your coworkers\r\ninto the application. Therefore, a basic understanding of front-end technologies is necessary as well.\r\nResponsibilities\r\nIntegration of user-facing elements developed by front-end developers\r\nBuild efficient, testable, and reusable PHP modules\r\nSolve complex performance problems and architectural challenges\r\nIntegration of data storage solutions including traditional databases, key-value stores\r\nSkills And Qualifications\r\nStrong knowledge of PHP web frameworks such as Laravel, Yii\r\nUnderstanding the fully synchronous behavior of PHP\r\nUnderstanding of MVC design patterns\r\nBasic understanding of front-end technologies, such as JavaScript, HTML5, and CSS3\r\nString knowledge of object oriented PHP programming\r\nProficient understanding of code versioning tools, such as SVN\r\nKnowledge of Moodle will be added advantage\r\nExperience - 5 to 7 years\r\n\r\nkindly, forward me your updated resume as soon as possible.', 'Mobile:7997997225  Tel Direct: 040-40034122  Email: recruiter@psrtech.com', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '16 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-16 02:26:06', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979149, 0, 'PHP Developer', 'Flyonit Solutions Pvt Ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Kolkata', ' MYSQLCSS3MagentoWordpress', '', '23', '22', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'We are looking for an experienced, knowledgeable developer who can take the lead on executing and implementing development initiatives. You will work closely with our growing marketing team to execute high-profile projects including website optimization, user-facing and internal portals, and other web-based applications. The ideal candidate will be a seasoned applications developer masterful in Custom PHP , MYSQL, HTML5, CSS3 , Javascript , jQuery , Pay pal/Ecommerce and other related server technologies used to implement .\r\n\r\nJob Responsibilities :\r\n\r\n    Develop functional and appealing web- and mobile-based applications based on usability best practices\r\n\r\n    Develop, optimize, and maintain CMS theme files\r\n\r\n    Design responsive web layouts utilizing current techniques and frameworks\r\n\r\n    Design, develop, and maintain SQL database schemas and scripts, including views, triggers, and stored procedures\r\n\r\n    Regularly communicate project progress, issues, and risks to project manager via project management tool\r\n\r\n    Write well-structured, well-tested, and easily maintainable code\r\n\r\n    Coordinate requirements, schedules, and activities; contribute to team meetings; troubleshoot development and production problems across multiple environments and operating platforms\r\n\r\n    Stay up-to-date on emerging technologies\r\n\r\n    Support users by developing documentation and assistance tools', 'Email: hr@flyonit.com\r\nTelephone: 760296843', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '16 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-16 02:27:52', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
