(98979164, 0, 'Oracle DBA', 'Growel Softech Pvt. Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '3', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '5', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '  DataguardRMANRAC  Apply Send me similar jobs ', '', '23', '17', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Oracle Production database administration with knowledge of Oracle 10g, 11g databases, sql loader, RMAN, Physical Standby Databases, Dataguard, ASM, RAC databases.\r\nOracle Database Performance Tuning.\r\nShell Scripting knowledge on unix platforms specially on Solaris.\r\nShould be ready to provide 24 X 7 support. Should be ready to work in shifts. Preferably Male candidates.', 'Company Description:\r\nGrowel Softech Pvt. Ltd.\r\nEmail: shital.j@growelsoftech.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '21 December, 2016', '', 17303, '2016-12-21 06:28:23', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
