(98979197, 0, 'Oracel DBA - Walk -in', 'CSS Corp.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Chennai', '', '', '23', '138', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Walk-in Details\r\nVenue: CSS Corp Pvt Ltd B-14 Phase1 MEPZ SEZ Tambaram Sanatorium (Opp. Tambaram Sanatorium Railway Station) Chennai - 60004\r\n\r\nPosition: Oracle DBA (Strictly Looking for Immediate Joiners or Max of 30 Days of Notice Period)\r\n\r\nL2 Role\r\n\r\nExperience : 3 to 6 Years\r\n\r\nLocation : Chennai Mepz\r\n\r\nShift : Rotational Shift 24/7\r\n\r\nNo Of Positions : 4\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWalk-in Dates: 07-Jan-2017 (Saturday)\r\n\r\nTime: 10:00 AM to 4:00 PM\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\n\r\nÂ· At least 3-5 yrs experience in Production support\r\n\r\nÂ· Creation and configuration of database server and databases.\r\n\r\nÂ· Installation, upgrade and maintenance of database software\r\n\r\nÂ· Monitor database for availability and performance optimization\r\n\r\nÂ· Experience in backup and recovery\r\n\r\nÂ· Having exposure of working on RMAN\r\n\r\nÂ· Having good experience of working on UNIX environment, preferably Linux.\r\n\r\nÂ· Performance Tuning & Troubleshooting techniques\r\n\r\nÂ· Shell scripting\r\n\r\n. Knowledge in PL/SQL\r\n\r\n. Oracle RAC â€“ Installation, Implementations, Upgrade, Tuning and maintenance\r\n\r\n. Oracle Database Upgrade, Migration\r\n\r\n. Database Cloning\r\n\r\n. Database Tuning\r\n\r\n. Backup and Recovery (RMAN, DATADUMP, EXP/IMP, HOTBACKUP)\r\n\r\n. Hands-on in UNIX environment, preferably Linux (Redhat/Suse),\r\n\r\n. Understand shell or Perl script.\r\n\r\n. ITIL Concepts / Certification', 'Email: Gerard.Andrews@csscorp.com', 'MCA/B Tech./ M Tech.', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '02 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-02 06:48:11', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
