(98979202, 0, 'Assistant General Manager (AGM) Sales', 'Miric Biotech Ltd', '', '1', '0', '', '4', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Noida', '', '', '31', '116', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Position: Assistant General Manager (AGM) For Sale\r\n\r\nLocation: Delhi/NCR\r\n\r\nSalary: Best in industry\r\n\r\nJob Description:-\r\n\r\n  \"Understand The Gap Between Industry And Academia.\"\r\n\r\nRequirements: \r\n\r\n    3-5 years of sales experience in FMCG / OTC/ Consumer Pharma /Startup.\r\n    Should be well versed with local market scenario.\r\n    Know your people, grow your people, help grow your business, build relationships with all key stakeholders.\r\n\r\nResponsiblity:\r\n\r\n    Responsible for achieving targets and distribution in assigned territory.\r\n    Lead the Sales Executives in the region and set up the General trade business in Pan India Basis \r\n    Coordination with company and distribution network in regard with smooth distribution of companyâ€™s Stock.\r\n    Drive business development activities of the region through channel sales.\r\n    Responsible for meeting the revenue and margin targets for the region.\r\n\r\nEligibility/Who can apply:\r\n\r\nExperience: At least 15-20 years out of which minimum 5 years as working and grasping knowledge about the role of AGM.\r\n\r\nRequired Profile: You must be a Management Graduate from a premier institute with 8-12 years of post qualification experience.\r\n\r\nYour background must include an analytical/ strategic role in sales and demand planning with exposure to an MNC company in the consumer segment, preferably consumer Pharma/FMCG.\r\n\r\nEmoluments: We Match best in our industry.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHow to Apply: MAIL US gmops@miricbiotech.com', 'Email: gmops@miricbiotech.com', 'B.Sc / M.Sc Biochemistry, DMLT, MLT', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '03 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-03 03:12:15', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979203, 0, 'URGENT HIRING FOR ACCOUNTANT', 'RC Careers Hiring For RC Careers', '', '1', '0', '', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Jammu', '', '', '10', '1', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'RC CAREERS \r\n\r\n Urgent Hiring for Bank Accounting Agent.\r\n\r\nInterview Timings :- 10 am to 6 pm\r\n\r\nPlease find the skills required as below :-\r\n\r\nQualification:\r\n\r\nANY UNDER GRAD/ GRADUATED\r\n\r\nPOSITION:- Accounting, Back Office\r\n\r\nSALARY:- 2 L.K. PA. TO 8L.K. P.A.\r\n\r\nSKILLS\r\n\r\n*Strong verbal communication skills ,Good Grammar.\r\n\r\n*Excellent personality\r\n\r\nADVANTAGES:-\r\n\r\n1. OPPORTUNITY TO JOIN THE FASTEST GROWING ORGANIZATION.\r\n\r\n2. AFTER COMPLETING 15-18 MONTHS YOU CAN APPLY IN ANY RESPECTIVE DEPT RELATED TO YOUR FIELD.\r\n3. OPPORTUNITY TO LEARN WHILE YOU EARN.\r\n4. LUCRATIVE PACKAGES\r\n\r\nNOTE:- Candidates are requested to carry their 2 updated resume,3 passport size photograph.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBetween the Ages of 18 to 35. All experience shown would have to backed up by papers.\r\n\r\nFor any clarifications on the please feel to call:SATYAM-7836028812', 'Email: hr.brightjobservices@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9811520415', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-04 03:11:46', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979204, 0, 'BRANCH OPERATION MANAGER-BANKING MANAGER', 'J R SERVICES', '', '2', '0', '', '1', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Guntur ', ' Bank AccountingEconomicsAccount PlanningBanking OperationsManagement  Apply Send me similar jobs ', '', '10', '10', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'A banking operations manager helps establish, maintain, and facilitate a financial institutionâ€™s method of doing business. The operations manager likely oversees all transaction reports and ensures that a high degree of accuracy is maintained by the bank. They also work to ensure that procedures related to cash on hand totals, armored car pickups, facility maintenance, and other subjects are handled properly.\r\n\r\nSince many banks are multiunit operations, the operations manager typically has a template for the various procedures at their bank; it is their duty to make sure these standards are adhered to and maintained. Every transaction at a bank creates a record, and these records must also be examined carefully for accuracy. In most cases, the operations manager signs off on the final reconciliations for their bank at the close of business. With many banks, the operations manager also participates in the hiring process and is expected to help train new hires. Other tasks performed by the operations manager include ensuring that invoices in areas such as utilities, rent, and maintenance are approved and paid in a timely manner.\r\n\r\nA banking operations manager typically must possess a strong background in accounting or finance, as well as a bachelor\'s degree. Additionally, most banks only consider applicants for this position who have extensive experience in banking at a junior-management level. The operations manager should expect to work during regular business hours in an office environment.\r\n\r\n\r\nOperations Manager, Banking Tasks\r\nTrack and monitor daily workload to ensure client and operations expectations are met.\r\nProvide staff direction in analyzing and resolving escalated operational problems.\r\nEstablish work flows, practices and standards to ensure that ongoing support is provided for operations.\r\n\r\nShristi - 9560639065\r\n\r\nMail me at --  Jrservices7@gmail.com', 'Email: jrservices7@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9560639065', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-04 03:13:28', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
