(98979207, 0, 'Warehouse Executive for Pitampura with WMS knowledge', 'People Mart', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Delhi', '', '', '37', 'Select Functional Area', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Company: - Logistic & Transportaion\r\n Designation:- Warehouse Executive\r\n\r\nSalary:- 12k to 15k \r\n Location:- Jamalpur Bhiwani Haryana\r\n\r\nSAP knowledge must, will not consider resume without sap knowledge.\r\n\r\nReceiving Stocks quantity check with as per bill or DC wise tally\r\n Stocks segregation size wise colour wise to be done\r\n T.O Tranfer out to Stores wise as per requirement to be done\r\n Stocks tally after reaching the stores to be done\r\n Stores Stocks out and warehouse inwards checking\r\n Damage out to be done\r\n GRT - Goods return transfer has to be done\r\n Debit Note to accounts department hand over\r\n\r\nWarehouse is in time and out time and leaves should be aviod .\r\n Every weeks dispatching the Stocks Wednesday only preparing the before that time.\r\n Warehouse in staff and helpers should be in hand whatever to say ready to work no excuses\r\n Warehouse internal whatever activity should be interfere in Manager responsibilit\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCall us:-9891645409, 9467640331\r\n Or\r\n Drop us your resume :-hr@peoplemart.in', '    Company Name: People Mart\r\n    Email: hrdelhi50@gmail.com\r\n    Telephone: 9891645409', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-04 03:18:59', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979208, 0, 'BDM (4 Yrs. of Exp.in Education Industry only) - BLR, Mangalore & Davangere', 'Streamsource Services.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Davanagere', '   SalesTrainingBusiness Development', '', '36', '46', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Dear Job Seeker,\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWe have an urgent requirement for Business Development Manager post in a Reputed Education Industry in Bangalore, Mangalore & Davangere locations - Karnataka. Please find the details below.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDesignation / Position: Business Development Executive / Manager\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRelevant Experience: 3 - 8 Years.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nQualification: Any Graduates / Preferred M.B.A in Marketing / B.B.M / B.B.A\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSalary Offered: Up to 6.0 LPA / Depending on the experience, performance & competency level of the candidates.\r\n\r\nNotice Period: Immediate Joiners \r\n\r\nJob Location : Bangalore, Mangalore & Davangere â€“ Karnataka.\r\n\r\nTwo Wheeler Preferred\r\n\r\nGender: Males Only\r\n\r\nAbout the Company: A reputed College recognizes that human talent flourishes most readily in facilities where the most effective tools exist. We believe that it is the teacher that makes the difference, not just the classroom. We pride ourselves with a perfect blend of curriculum, co-curricular and pro-academic activities. Our teachers are motivated and our students inspired. At our college it is not just about mentoring but motivating. Not just educating but evolving. We are iconic, innovative and inclusive in our approach. Here inspiration for learning comes from within.\r\n\r\nAryan Foundation is engaged in imparting education in Karnataka, Maharashtra, Gujarat & Uttar Pradesh.\r\n\r\nThis college currently operates from 21 locations at Karnataka: Mangalore, Nagara Bhavi (Bengaluru), ISRO Layout (Bengaluru), Kurubarahalli (Bengaluru), Yelahanka (Bengaluru), Chamrajpet (Bengaluru), Belgaum, Bidar, Chitradurga, Davangere, Dharwad, Gulbarga, Hubli, Kolar, Mandya, Mysore, Tumkur, Udupi, Shivamogga, Vijayapura & Tumakura and Muttam in Kerala.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJob Description - Business Development Manager\r\n\r\n\r\nThe position is responsible for: \r\n\r\n (1) Generating lead from various Schools/Colleges for integrated coaching / Resource Sharing.\r\n (2) Identifying new areas of potential business opportunities. Developing new and existing and other accounts in the territory.\r\n (3) Responsible for admission target for the respected Area. Manage direct parent enquiry handling and also manage telephonic enquiry handling.\r\n (4) Visiting colleges by taking prior appointment and present MT service details to the concerned authorities.\r\n (5) Cold-calling from a given data base for lead generation and from database.\r\n (6) Visiting students Home by taking appointment with the Parents and present MT service details for potential admission.\r\n (7) Follow up with the decision makers /parents for tie-ups /admissions.\r\n (8) Arranging and conducting the Educational / Career Guidance Seminars in consultation with the Manager.\r\n (9) Daily Call Report, Visit Report and progress report.\r\n\r\n\r\nCandidate must have:\r\n\r\n\r\n - Excellent Communication skills. Knowledge of English / Hindi / Kannada is must. \r\n - Knowledge of MS office specifically Excel and PowerPoint.\r\n - 1 to 3 yearsâ€™ experience in Sales, Education related Academic counseling for student enrollment or any customer facing role.\r\n - Should acquire the knowledge of various School level competitive exams viz, NTSE, Homi Bhabha, Olympiads and Entrance Exams for Medical and Engineering.\r\n Candidate is required to travel 25% of their time for Business development related work. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBehavioral Competencies: \r\n\r\n\r\n - Should be a Go Getter with excellent Negotiating and Convincing abilities.\r\n - Drive for results, Customer Focus, Integrity and trust. Passion for selling.\r\n - Smart Personality.\r\n - Presentable and well groomed.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPlease apply if you are interested & fill the below mandatory details:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAvailability for F2F Interview:\r\n\r\nTotal Years of Experience as BDM / BDE:\r\n\r\nRelevant Experience as BDM / BDE in Education Industry/ Training / Coaching / Any School, College & other Institute:\r\n\r\nCurrent Salary:\r\n\r\nExpected Salary:\r\n\r\nNotice Period:\r\n\r\nQualification:\r\n\r\nLanguages Known:\r\n\r\nCurrent Location in Bangalore:\r\n\r\nAge:\r\n\r\nOwn Two Wheeler: Yes / No:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNote: It is an urgent requirement. Candidates with relevant experience of 4+ Years in BDM towards Education / Training / Any College or School / Coaching Institute only can apply.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nStreamsource Services,\r\n\r\njobs@streamsourceindia.com\r\n\r\n9916906580', 'jobs@streamsourceindia.com\r\n\r\n9916906580', 'MBA', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-04 03:21:08', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979209, 0, 'Education Coach (Min. 1 Year Teaching Exp.)', 'CareerzInn Placement Consultancy Pvt. Ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '1', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '  AdmissionsBusiness DevelopmentManagementMarketing  Apply Send me similar jobs ', '', '36', '88', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Dear Candidates,\r\n\r\n Greetings !\r\n\r\n We are hiring for a Leading Education Group for the subject role. Details below:\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\n\r\nKPI\r\n\r\nA) To solve implementation problems, renew schools, and maintain a great relationship, and zero outstanding specifically ensuring seamless implementation of Organisation in schools through active engagements with the key stakeholders in the schools.\r\n\r\nB) Build relationship with all key decision makers in the school.\r\n\r\nC) Become the single point of contact for all support and query resolutions for the schools.\r\n\r\nD) Collect all outstanding due from the school.\r\n\r\nE) Renew & expand the relationship with the schools at the end of every academic year.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJob :\r\n\r\n A)Education Coach will be the face of Organisation In the school therefore the roles require high level of ownership, customer focus and commitment\r\n\r\n B) Require extensive travel to schools within the assigned geography and sometime even outside the assigned territory.\r\n\r\nC) The role requires imparting training to the teachers, coaching & support to the school leaders and ongoing observation & coaching to the teachers on the Organisation implementation in the school.\r\n\r\nD) To provide clarifications, suggestions and answers to Organisation implementation related queries of the school and openly communicate issues & challenges in the schools with the Senior EC and RIM.\r\n\r\nE) Needs to follow-up and collect all outstanding and renew school contracts every academic year.\r\n\r\nDesired Candidate Profile\r\n\r\nPast teaching experience (at least 3-5 years) preferably with exposure to experiential learning\r\n Degree in education/key subjects (Science, Mathematics, English, Social Science) is desirable, not essential Past experiences of training & coaching is desirable\r\n\r\n\r\n SHOULD BE OPEN TO TRAVEL (15-18 days in a month)\r\n\r\n    Ability to demonstrate a good Organisation class\r\n    Ability to run group sessions including training and circle time\r\n    Ability to communicate clearly across levels Need to work closely with Owners, Principals and teachers.\r\n    Time management Calendar discipline as the person would be travelling meeting multiple people\r\n    Customer orientation & quick response time.\r\n    Zeal to understand the customer requirements and support them\r\n    Assertive &confident: Will have to deal with older/more experience/difficult people, must be able to hold their own\r\n    Ability to learn and un-learn and generally should be a thoughtful person\r\n\r\n**Interested Candidate can apply with their updated resume on the below mentioned Email id.\r\n\r\nPreferred Resume Format- Ms-Word\r\n\r\nPass this message to your friends colleagues in case if its suits them.\r\n\r\nNOTE :- Pl call us at the below mentioned number for any queries', 'Email: educareerzinn@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 7884091008', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '04 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-04 03:22:48', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
