(98979211, 0, 'Branch/Cluster Manager', 'Fairwealth Securities Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Gurgaon', '', '', '10', '13', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Team Management and Team Requirement * Handling a team of Sales Managers / Relationship Manager * Helping team in their meetings and lead closers. * Responsible for Promoting Fairwealths Research Calles to all their Team and clients. * Acquisition of new clients for Demat- Equity,Commodity &Currency Account with Margin * Revenue Generation from acquired or assigned clients. * Justifying his / her salary via account acquisition and revenue generation * Build and manage strong independent relationships clients * Providing day to assistance to all acquired / assigned clients who have traded. * Responsibile for Justifying Team Cost via account opening and revenue generation in equity/commodity/currency. * Responsible for Clients /franchisee Acquisition for broking products. * Responsible for Compliance and other issues related with the branch/s.', 'Fairwealth Securities Ltd.\r\nEmail: joining@fairwealth.in', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '05 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-05 03:19:35', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
