(98979219, 0, 'Electrical Engineering in Noida, Delhi for freshers.', 'Regatta Recruiters. Hiring For Different Companies', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '0', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', 'Noida', '  electronicsElectronicsElectronics EngineeringCommunicationInstrumentationElectrical EngineeringElectronics', '', '16', '55', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'We do have 166 current hiring for Fresherâ€™s Electronics & Electrical candidate 2015 & 2014 ONLY \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCore Electronics jobs in Delhi/ NCR; \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJob Description are as follows \r\n\r\nQualification: B.Tech and Diploma\r\nLocation: IMT Manesar, Delhi NCR, Gurgaon\r\nExperience: Fresher only (NO EXPERIENCE REQUIRED)\r\nJob Type: Off Role [On Role after 3-6 months]\r\nSalary: 8,000 to 12,000 CTC\r\nDepartment: Production, Maintenance, Quality & Testing \r\nWork: PCB | IC\r\nESI/ PF: YES \r\nMeal/ Food: One Time \r\nSalary Slip: YES\r\nExperience Letter: Minimum 6 Months\r\n\r\n\r\n100% Job Guarantee Programme; No Registration fee.\r\n\r\nInterested candidates can give us a MISS CALL to\r\n\r\n\r\nMs. Sapna: +91-9212443222\r\n\r\nMs. Pooja: +91-9266543222\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRegards:\r\nRegatta Recruiters \r\n(A SBU of Regatta Solution Private Limited )\r\nE-Mail: jobs@regattasolution.com \r\nPhone (Direct): +91-92-12-44-3222\r\nAddress: B-11, Sector 64, Noida', 'Ms. Sapna: +91-9212443222\r\n\r\nMs. Pooja: +91-9266543222', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '06 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-06 01:23:38', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
