(98979223, 0, 'Field Sales Executive (For 5 Star Property)', 'CareerzInn Placement Consultancy Pvt. Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Ahmednagar', ' InsuranceBusiness DevelopmentField SalesSalesNBFCBFSILead GenerationCustomer ServiceTelecomField sales', '', '37', '116', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Dear Candidates,\r\n\r\nGreetings !\r\n\r\nWe are hiring for the subject role for a Leading 5 Star Hospitality Group. Details below:\r\n\r\nResponsibilities:\r\n\r\n- To build and maintain strong client relationships by effectively handling objections and resolve member/customer conflicts thus building customer trust.\r\n\r\n- To identify potential customers, create and close new business opportunities in line with the strategic direction of the company.\r\n\r\n- To prepare pre-sales proposals for prospective clients.\r\n\r\n- To make inspiring sales presentations to the prospective clients by creating a dream.\r\n\r\n- Regular liaison with telemarketing and member relations department to achieve stretched targets in a result-focused environment.\r\n\r\n- To build and maintain strong client relationship and high level of customer service.\r\n\r\n- To keep abreast with the organization\'s products and services and to crack profitable deals and referrals to achieve sales targets.\r\n\r\nInterested Candidate can apply with their updated resume on the below mentioned Email id.\r\n\r\n\r\n Preferred Resume Format- Ms-Word\r\n\r\n\r\n Pass this message to your friends colleagues in case if its suits them.\r\n\r\n\r\n NOTE :- Pl call us at the below mentioned number for any queries.\r\n\r\n\r\n Contact : 0788-4091008 / 0788- 4901008', 'Email: jobscareerzinn@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 7884901008', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '09 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-09 02:17:24', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979224, 0, 'SALES MANAGER/ SENIOR SALES MANAGER/ SALES DEVELOPMENT MANAGER- LIFE INSURANCE', 'SANSKRITI CONSULTANCY', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '0', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'Direct salesField SalesTeam ManagementBusiness DevelopmentHNIChannel salesAgency SalesChannel SalesSalesLife InsuranceCorporate SalesPCGMarketing  Apply Send me similar jobs ', '', '29', 'Select Functional Area', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Designation: Assistant Sales Manager/ Sales Manager/ Senior Sales Manager/ Sales Development Manager/ Direct Sales Manager / Sales Development Manager- Corporate Agency / Relationship Manager / Senior Relationship Manager / Premier Relationship Manager / Associate Agency Development Manager / Agency Development Manager / Development Manager.\r\n\r\nLocation: Pan India.\r\n\r\nIndustry: Insurance.\r\n\r\nCompany: Aviva Life Insurance Co. L.t.d./ Max Life Insurance Co. L.t.d./ HDFC Life Insurance Co. L.t.d./ Edelweiss Tokio Life Insurance Co. L.t.d. & Other MNC Insurance Companies.\r\n\r\nJob Profile:\r\n\r\n    To drive Life Insurance Business thru a Team of Insurance Advisors and to achieve sales Targets thru them.\r\n    Recruitment of Advisors.\r\n    Training of Advisors by doing joint sales calls with them.\r\n    To Manage a Team of Advisors.\r\n\r\nDesired Candidate Profile:-\r\n\r\n    Minimum Graduates with good communication skills.\r\n    Localities preferable or else minimum 3 yrs in current location.\r\n    Minimum 1-3 years Sales experience in any industry.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCTC: Negotiable + (Depends on Location)Reimbursement + Attractive Incentives + other perks.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nHowever, please note that the individual salary offered will be decided by the company on a case to case basis.\r\n\r\nBesides the fixed salary there are incentive schemes which are very attractive and you have the potential to earn significant money. Over and above this there are various Rewards and Recognition programs that run in the company.\r\n\r\nThe company offers good career opportunities to its people.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAPPLY TO: If you find the job profile as per your needs then apply to Mail your resume at: ASAP\r\n\r\nhiring@sanskriticonsultancy.com \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAlso Visit our company Facebook Page@\r\n\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/Sanskriti.Consultancy\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCall us at: 07042917778 / 07042937778 / 7042947778 / 07042957778 / 08447178288\r\n\r\nOr SMS â€˜JOB AVIVA LIFE- SM, SSM/ MAX LIFE- AADM/ HDFC LIFE-SDM/ EDELWEISS LIFE- DM at 08447178288\r\n\r\nFor Example you Applied for SM Level in AVIVA LIFE type â€˜JOB AVIVA LIFE-SMâ€™ and send it 08447178288\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nOr forward it to your friend also.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nWhy Life Insurance\r\n\r\nFasting Growing Industry with Over 60% Growth Every Year.\r\n\r\nGet Opportunity To Learn The Insurance and Financial Planning/Management Business. Opportunity for Individual Growth and Significant Compensations.\r\n\r\nREQUIRE ONLY AND ONLY SALES BACKGROUND.', 'Sanskriti Consultancy\r\n\r\nCell :+91-07042917778 / 07042937778 / 7042947778 / 07042957778 / 08447178288\r\n\r\nLand Line:- 011-43674288 / 011-47512211 / 011-43583768 / 011-43073768', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '09 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-09 02:19:11', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
