(98979237, 0, 'Company secretary and Legal', 'Hire Shastra', '', '1', '0', '', '5', '7', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Delhi', '', '', '27', '121', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'we are having Urgent hiring for CS& LEGAL for a well known company located in delhi/ncr.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPOSITION 1 : CS & LEGAL â€“ 1 POSITION\r\n\r\nJOB DESCRIPTION\r\n\r\n1. All secretarial compliances in regards to company act.\r\n\r\n2. All disputes & complaints redressal under the consumer protection act.\r\n\r\n3. Liasioning with Sr. advocates for civil & criminal matters.\r\n\r\n4. Sound knowledge of mercantile & other related laws.\r\n\r\n5. Code administration (contracts with distributors & third parties)\r\n\r\n6. Adjudication of code violation & code compliances.\r\n\r\n7. Instituting suits, arranging arbitration for code violation.\r\n\r\n8. Drafting of contracts in regards of SCM, commissions, SLAâ€™s.\r\n\r\n9. Vetting of marketing contracts.\r\n\r\n10. Compliance calendar and reporting.\r\n\r\n11. Handling all legal issues pertaining to service related matters.\r\n\r\n12. Food, drug, cosmetics legal metrology norms.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDesired Candidate Profile\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n1. Qualification: CS & LL.B.\r\n\r\n2. Age: Below 40years.\r\n\r\n3. Experience: 5-10years in reputed law firm or company in similar capacity.\r\n\r\n4. Should have handled team & excellent communication skills & pleasing personality.\r\n\r\n5. Strong analytical & liasioning ability with govt. ministries, legal authorities etc.', 'Email: Garimafrontline7407@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 7065100038', 'CS', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '12 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-12 01:35:28', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
