(98979239, 0, 'Test Automation Engineer', 'Centraprise IT Solutions.', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Hyderabad', 'Should be able to create Framework  existing framework  update the same. underst ', '', '7', '131', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Excellent Automation experience, especially on Silk Test tool - both Classic and Open Agent.Should be able to create Framework, understand existing framework and update the same. Very good hands on experience in Test Scripting on Silk Test Tool - Test language.Preferred experience and domain knowledge in Banking domain Should be able to work in Global delivery model (in coordination with offshore and onsite team.Experience on Selenium is added advantage.', 'Email: sandeep@centrapriseit.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '13 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-13 00:53:23', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979240, 0, 'Test Engineer Trainee', 'scoop technologies PVT LTD.', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Hyderabad', 'Software Testing  Manual Testing  Testin g Automated Testing  QTP  Selenium  Performance Testing ', '', '36', '117', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Should have basic understanding of QA Process\r\nShould have good knowledge of any of the programming languages.\r\nShould have good understanding of the web and data bases concepts\r\nShould have very good logical and analytical skills.\r\nSkill sets required:\r\n\r\nManual Testing\r\nGood Exposure on Automation and Performance tools like QTP,Load runner,etc.,\r\nBug logging tools\r\nMandatory Skills:\r\n\r\nGood communication skills both verbal and written.\r\nShould have good grasping skills to learn the new tools and technologies.\r\nPersonnel Management Ability', '    Company Name: scoop technologies PVT LTD.\r\n    Email: Swetha.k@scoopsolutions.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '13 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-13 00:55:15', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979241, 0, 'Senior Lead Engineer', 'sriven info consultants india pvt ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '5', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Hyderabad', '    Skills:     Software TestingManual TestingTestingAutomated TestingQTPSeleniumPerformance Testing  Apply Send me similar jobs ', '', '41', '117', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Resolve issues found during engineering test and QA in a timely manner, taking risk into account. Conceives, proposes, and sells new ideas in engineering and guides their implementation. Participates in design and code reviews of other team members. Provides work assistance to lower level engineers. Assist the Project Management and Marketing groups as necessary.', 'Email: hr@sriveninfo.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '13 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-13 00:59:04', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979242, 0, 'Sr.Test Engineer', 'BLUEBERRY LABS PRIVATE LIMITED.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Hyderabad', 'Selenium software Testing', '', '23', '35', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Experience in agile is a must\r\n3.      Good understanding of complete STLC (software Testing Life Cycle)\r\n4.      Should be well versed with Requirements Elicitation\r\n5.      Preparation of test scenarios in line with requirements\r\n6.      Should be well versed with test case designs for different test phases like regression, SIT,      ST and UAT\r\n7.      Test case peer review\r\n8.      Well versed with all phases of software testing\r\n9.      Hands on with test environment preparation and test case execution\r\n10.   Defect reporting\r\n11.   Identification of automatable test scenarios\r\n12.   Experience with functional automation tools like UFT / Selenium is a must\r\n13.   Test Summary Report preparation\r\n14.   Work closely with the Development team for fixing of the defects\r\n15.   Documenting Lessons Learnt & Best Practises and socialize\r\n16.   Should be able to Communicate well with Test Lead / Manager', '    Company Name: BLUEBERRY LABS PRIVATE LIMITED.\r\n    Email: jobs@blueberrylabs.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '13 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-13 01:03:57', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979243, 0, 'Wearable Software Test Engineer', 'Sailotech Pvt Ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '5', '10', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Hyderabad', '', '', '32', '117', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Experience, testing embedded systems, software and APIs.\r\n\r\n2.       Good understanding of test methodology and test processes, including requirements collection, test plan development, execution and\r\nerror tracking.\r\n\r\n3.       Hands-on debugging skills in the lab using standard lab equipment (scopes, multi meters, voltage sources, sensor specific\r\nmeasurement equipment, basic hand tools) to debug the system.\r\n\r\n4.       Experience in developing test automation with strong programming skills (in Perl). -Detail oriented, thorough and analytical approach\r\nrequired with excellent communication skills.\r\n\r\n5.      Ability to time-share and prioritize between multiple tasks is crucial. Additional skills: -Previous exposure to Qualcomm test tools and\r\ntest processes extremely useful. Previous exposure to Sensors (inertial, pressure, magnetic, ambient light, proximity, environmental and\r\nphysiological) testing advantag', '    Company Name: Sailotech Pvt Ltd.\r\n    Company Description:\r\n    Sailotech Pvt Ltd.\r\n    Email: sharath.rathod@sailotech.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '13 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-13 01:09:16', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979244, 0, 'STRATEGIC BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT AND MANAGEMENT TRAINEE !!', 'Seven Seas Management', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Ahmedabad', '', '', '28', '116', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'ROLES & RESPONSIBILITIES: \r\n\r\nWe select our new joiners as Business Associate and train and develop them holistically in all functional areas of Business Management viz. Marketing, HR, Finance and Operations over a period of 6-9-12 months as per the following Global Training Module (GTM):\r\n STEP 1: Client Servicing & Customer Acquisition\r\n STEP 2: HR Trainer\r\n STEP 3: Crew Leader\r\n STEP 4: Assistant Owner\r\n STEP 5: Strategic Business Unit Owner\r\n\r\nELIGIBILITY CRITERIA:\r\n 1. Candidate MUST have fluency in English.\r\n 2. Age criteria: Between 20 and 27 years.\r\n 3. Minimum qualification of the candidate must be GRADUATE.\r\n 4. Candidates who can join IMMEDIATELY only apply.\r\n\r\nFor any query or appointment booking call to Miss Swara (9033006262)\r\n\r\nOr \r\n\r\nsend your CV on hrd.aricentorg@gmail.com', 'Email: hrd.aricentorg@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9033006262', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '16 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-16 04:15:37', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979245, 0, 'Budding Professionals required for Management Trainee Position!!', 'Horizon Export', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Ahmedabad', '  Training HRM PR Promotions Client Servicing  Advertising  Marketing', '', '28', '72', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Position : Management Trainee\r\n\r\nWe are in search of Trainee Managers who are ready to take the challenge and are ready to mould themselves to become the top most global leaders in the corporate world, for which we train and develop individuals according to our Global Training Module.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nYour profile in our organization will be to work in the aspect of Management. We use a common Training Method Module in order to provide the necessary training to each individual in the prospect of Marketing, HRD (Human Resource Development), Administration & Finance.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nLevel1 -Systems and Client Representation (Marketing / Advertising /Branding/ Promotions)\r\n\r\nLevel2 -Development into a leader (Human Resource Development)\r\n\r\nLevel3 -Development and Performance Appraisal (Human Resource Management)\r\n\r\nLevel4 -Risk Assessment and Administration (Finance Management)\r\n\r\nLevel5 -Understanding Management (Business Management)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nKey Skills:\r\n\r\na) Flexible in Advertising / Marketing with good presentation and PR skills.\r\n\r\nb) Ready to learn and are open for a multi tasking kind of profile.\r\n\r\nc) Independent and creative individual looking for entry in corporate world.\r\n\r\nd) Disciplined and hard working candidate\r\n\r\nJob Responsibilities :\r\n\r\nGoal centric\r\nStrategic Marketing Development\r\nAbility to motivate and mentor a team\r\n \r\nCandidates residing in GUJARAT and who can join immediately may apply. Freshers are also welcome.\r\n\r\nIf this is the opportunity you have been waiting for then send us your updated resume on hrd.recruitment15@gmail.com and Contact Kirti / Alisha-8758574787 / 079-40032135 and fix up your interview.', 'Email: hrd.recruitment15@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 8758574787', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '16 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-16 04:18:05', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979246, 0, 'Seeking Dynamic Freshers for Marketing/advertising Management', 'Seven Seas Management', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Ahmedabad', ' Training  Sales  Advertising Performance   Appraisal Management  Marketing', '', '28', '82', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'We are in search of TRAINEE MANAGERS & STRATEGIC BUSINESS MANAGERS who are ready to take the challenge of the corporate world and are ready to mould themselves to become the topmost global leaders in the corporate world.JOB PROFILE your profile in our organization will be to work in the aspect of Management. \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nROLES && RESPONSIBILITIES: \r\nWe select our new joiners as Business Associate and train and develop them holistically in all functional areas of Business Management viz. Marketing, HR, Finance and Operations over a period of 6-9-12 months as per the following Global Training Module (GTM):\r\nSTEP 1: Client Servicing && Customer Acquisition\r\nSTEP 2: HR Trainer\r\nSTEP 3: Crew Leader\r\nSTEP 4: Assistant Owner\r\nSTEP 5: Strategic Business Unit Owner\r\n\r\nELIGIBILITY CRITERIA:\r\n1. Candidate MUST have fluency in English.\r\n2. Age criteria: Between 20 and 27 years.\r\n3. Minimum qualification of the candidate must be GRADUATE.\r\n4. Candidates who can join IMMEDIATELY only apply.\r\n\r\nCONTACT - MS. Swara - 9033006262 OR ELSE SEND UR CVS TO\r\n\r\nhrd.aricentorg@gmail.com', 'CONTACT - MS. Swara - 9033006262 OR ELSE SEND UR CVS TO\r\n\r\nhrd.aricentorg@gmail.com', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '16 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-16 04:20:10', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979247, 0, 'Marketing', 'Do IT Enterprises.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Ahmedabad', '', '', '28', '69', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Marketing Executive Note: Freshers are also welcomed, priority will be given to the candidates with Marketing as their main subject in educational qualifications Requirement . Fluent in English . Educational Background with International marketing would be given first choice (in case of fresher) . Having experience in marketing of Agro based commodity products will be given priority . Should possess convincing power, negotiation skills, communication and interpersonal skills . MS office knowledge is necessary Duties include: . daily communication with buyer on phone/mail/social networking apps and sites like skype/FB etc. . Follow up with current clients and generate more demand . Update clients with daily prices . Develop new business in international market . Advertising', 'Email: resume@doitenterprises.in', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '16 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-16 04:24:14', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
