od working experience of dictation, and transcribe notes\r\n    Good command over English for drafting letters.\r\n    Male Candidate preferred.\r\n\r\nMust:-\r\n    Secretarial course\r\n    Shorthand\r\nInterested candidates please send me your updated resume at varun.osg777@gmail.com or call me ', 'Email: varun.osg777@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9266662009', 'CS', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '18 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-18 04:08:39', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
