ecruitment Searches, etc.\r\n\r\nJob Location:.Bangalore / Bengaluru.\r\nE-mail: .cv@hitechmanpower.com.\r\nHITECH PLACEMENTS, Bangalore.\r\nPhone:.\r\n25286767.\r\n25255390.\r\nMobile:.\r\n9035060955.\r\n9243407966.\r\n9901502660.\r\n8792855156.\r\n9035702386.', 'Email: pushpa@hitechmanpower.com\r\nTelephone: 9243407966', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '20 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-20 00:46:41', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
