(98979291, 0, 'Required Accounts Executive at Patel Nagar', 'J.J. India Hiring For J.J. India', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Delhi', '', '', '10', '108', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Urgently Required Account Executive. Candidate Should have 3-4 yrs of experience in Accounts and finance. Should be graduate or post graduate. Should have knowledge of tally, VAT, income tax, TDS, service tax etc\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Gross Salary: 20K-25K\r\n\r\nJob Location: Patel Nagar\r\n\r\nJob Timings: 9.30AM to 6PM\r\n\r\nInterested candidates can meet at J.J.INDIA, B-108, 2nd Floor, Lajpat Nagar, Part-1, New Delhi-110024 Ph: 9811008929, Email: info@jjindia.co.in', 'Email: info@jjindia.co.in\r\nTelephone: 9811008929', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '26 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-26 02:50:11', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979292, 0, 'Lead Technical Recruiter', 'Huawei Technologies India Pvt. Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '6', '11', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', ' Hiring Social  Media IT   Recruitment Sourcing Payroll', '', '33', '117', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'IT Recruiter/Technical Recruiter\r\n\r\nLocation : Bangalore\r\n\r\nType of employment: Contract (Third Party Payroll)\r\n\r\nExperience: 6-10 years\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nResponsibilities :\r\n\r\nYou are responsible to seek out professionals with the right combination of experience, education and skills to fill a particular position.\r\n\r\nYou are responsible to attract employees who fit a job description and have the potential to become valuable additions to the company.\r\n\r\nCommunication with hiring team for recruitment, reporting, ensuring high joining ratio.\r\n\r\nBased on business need, ready to take up unplanned work and deliver on-time.\r\n\r\nQualifications Required:\r\n\r\n.You should have significant technical recruiter experience, in multiple recruiting environments .\r\n\r\nExperience in hiring senior level position.\r\n\r\nExperience in Leading a team of 5 - 10 members.\r\n\r\nExperience in working with Social Media and other channels of sourcing.\r\n\r\nAbility to recruit passive and active candidates\r\n\r\nExperience in working with Networking/Telecommunication requirement is a bonus.\r\n\r\nExceptional oral, written, and interpersonal communication skills.\r\n\r\nAbility to build strong relationships and positively influence clients and colleagues and Strong problem solving ability.\r\n\r\nHaving desired to work with an innovative technology.\r\n\r\nAbility to accurately and articulately document information.\r\n\r\nAbility to work effectively with teams; share responsibility for results, provide and accept feedback.\r\n\r\nHighly Skilled in Microsoft Office - ppt, excel word\r\n\r\nNeed readiness to commute to nearby office location.\"', 'Email: hr_india@huawei.com', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '27 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-27 06:16:09', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979293, 0, 'TECHNICAL RECRUITER', 'Hortonworks', '', '1', '0', '', '3', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '    Skills:     SubscriptionsInformation SecuritySOFTSystemsEngineeringCANACTQETechnical SupportDistributionSOURCEStrategyFoundationSTABLEAPACHE', '', '1', '29', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Hortonworks is the leading contributor to Apache Hadoop, the worlds most popular platform for storing, processing, managing and analyzing big data. The company also assists enterprises and technology vendors in developing and deploying Apache Hadoop-based solutions via support subscriptions, training and certification programs. \r\n \r\nTechnical Recruiter at Hortonworks is vital role to the overall success of the organization. The RIGHT person will have an incredible grasp on how to manage a full life cycle recruiting process for roles in Engineering, QE, Technical Support and Sales. \r\n \r\nIn this role, youll need to build a strategic partnership with the business unit hiring managers to ensure we are hiring the A Players. If you\'re A-Team player with an eye for talent who loves connecting people and opportunities, this is the role for you. \r\n \r\nResponsibilities  \r\n \r\nCollaborate with teams to deeply understand hiring needs \r\nManage the entire recruiting process and act as a candidate / hiring manager advocate \r\nIdentify closing strategies for offers and proactively provide candidates with the right information to help make their decision as easy as possible \r\nCreate and own a flawlessly positive candidate experience \r\nExceptional sourcing capabilities and Experience with Greenhouse ATS is desirable \r\nRequirements \r\n \r\nAt least 3-5 years of technical field recruiting experience in a fast start-up environment (corporate experience is required) \r\nExperience in recruiting in highly competitive candidates across many lines of business \r\nAN INCREDIBLE SENSE OF URGENCY!!  Ability to work across multiple divisions and geographical sites  Ability to grasp new technologies \r\nAbility to qualify a candidate and understand what each candidate brings to the table, and then connect that candidate with the right opportunity at Hortonworks. \r\nAbility to connect and effectively communicate with people of all levels \r\nExceptional teamwork and multi-tasking skills \r\nMust thrive and prioritize in a constantly changing environment \r\nSoft skills: Recruiting quality talent requires hard work, knowledge, strategy, patience and at times, a little bit of luck. You will need to understand a broad range of issues across the cultures, teams and high-tech industry as well as nuts and bolts of what drives each unique individual candidate. It is a highly skilled position, requiring someone who can master mostly intangible factors to bring about tangible results  the best hire for each and every open position.  \r\ni. implement and act in accordance with the organization\'s information security policies;  \r\nii. protect assets from unauthorized access, disclosure, modification, destruction or interference;  \r\niii. execute particular security processes or activities;  \r\niv. ensure responsibility is assigned to the individual for actions taken; and  \r\nv. report security events or potential events or other security risks to the organization \r\n \r\n \r\n \r\nHortonworks is a leading commercial vendor of Apache Hadoop, the preeminent open source platform for storing, managing and analyzing big data. Our distribution, Hortonworks Data Platform powered by Apache Hadoop, provides an open and stable foundation for enterprises and a growing ecosystem to build and deploy big data solutions. Hortonworks is the trusted source for information on Hadoop, and together with the Apache community, Hortonworks is making Hadoop more robust and easier to install, manage and use. Hortonworks provides unmatched technical support, training and certification programs for enterprises, systems integrators, and technology vendors. For more information, visit www.hortonworks.com.  \r\n APPLY NOW', 'www.hortonworks.com.  ', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '27 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-27 06:18:00', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979294, 0, 'Technical Recruiter', 'Celebron Solutions Private Limited.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '', '', '23', '115', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Hi-end core technical hiring for top IT companies/ fortune 500 companies\r\nEnd to end recruitment life cycle management.\r\nMinimum 1yr experience in contract staffing.\r\nWorking on multiple technical requirements and ensuring right talent is processed forward\r\nRegular follow-up throughout the hiring process and ownership at all stages\r\nMaintaining good data base of job aspirants and strong relationship building with them\r\nMaintaining daily/ weekly and monthly reports and MIS\r\nWorking with targets and positive approach\r\nInnovative recruitment strategies for hiring\r\nClosing positions on priority basis', 'Email: phani@celebron.com', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '27 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-27 06:19:21', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979295, 0, 'Technical Recruiter', 'Emploi Globale Consulting Pvt Ltd Hiring For Emploi Globale Consulting Pvt Ltd', '', '2', '0', '', '2', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '   ScreeningRecruitmentSourcingTalent AcquisitionCommunication', '', '21', '117', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', '3 to 6 Years of hands-on experience in IT recruitment\r\n\r\nAbility to understand technical information\r\n\r\nUnderstand requirements related to IT/Engineering jobs and deliver qualified candidates Computer Skills (Word, Excel, Outlook)\r\n\r\nResponsible for full lifecycle recruiting process to include sourcing and identifying candidates, phone screening, , submitting, scheduling client interviews and conducting follow-ups\r\n\r\nFoster long-term relationships with candidates Review and understand technical job requirement\r\n\r\nReview applicants to verify if position requirements are met Follow up with candidates for resumes\r\n\r\nAbility to build strong relationships Self-confidence and self starter\r\n\r\nMust have thorough knowledge on sourcing from different channels, especially Linkedin and other social media in addition to the job portals\r\n\r\nResults oriented problem solver who believes in accountability and will not accept failure Outgoing personality who likes to talk with and get to know people\r\n\r\nStrong work ethics and sense of commitment Good communication skills essential\r\n\r\nQualification: Minimum Graduate', 'www.emploiglobale.in', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '27 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-27 06:20:37', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979296, 0, 'Recruiter', 'Autosoft Solutions India Pvt Ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '', '', '23', '115', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Proficient in end to end recruitment life cycle -Contract fulfillment/Sourcing.\r\n Posting and sourcing candidates through various - Job sites, social networking sites etc.\r\n Preliminary screening/short-listing the right qualitative profile against the given requirement.\r\n Coordinating with the SPOC to know the feedback of the candidates and improve sourcing based on the discussions.\r\n Conduct initial HR interviews (Telephonic) to check technical skills, communication Skills, interest levels, etc.\r\n Follow up on the feed backs.\r\n Closing the positions within the stipulated time.\r\n Following up with the candidate after the offer is made.\r\n Timely Follow Up with the candidate.\r\n Excellent communication skills', 'Email: fresher@autosoftservices.com\r\nTelephone: 8065300009', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '27 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-27 06:22:19', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
