(98979298, 0, 'Opening for Management Associate ( Marketing / Advertising / Branding )', 'Seven Seas Management', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Ahmedabad', '   Business DevelopmentMarketing   Management Management', '', '1', '116', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Marketing/Advertising Branding Strategist\r\n\r\nJob Description:\r\n\r\nÂ· Strategy development, brain storming discussions, pitch presentations, proposal development, cost negotiations and deal closure would be an integral aspect of the job function.\r\n\r\nÂ· Create and maintain a healthy project pipeline and work towards enhancing the reach of the organization\r\n\r\nÂ· Network and meaningfully engage with the Product Management and Marketing departments of the assigned company accounts.\r\n\r\nDesired Candidate Profile:\r\n\r\nÂ· IMMEDIATE JOINING\r\n\r\nÂ· Excellent English communication and presentation skills, both verbal and written\r\n\r\nÂ· Charismatic, competitive and enthusiastic personality with negotiation skills\r\n\r\nÂ· Excellent interpersonal and customer-facing skills\r\n\r\nFlexibility and willingness to learn in a high pressure environment\r\n\r\n*AT THE TIME OF INTERVIEW A DETAILED DESCRIPTION OF YOUR JOB PROFILE WILL BE EXPALINED TO YOU\r\n\r\nFor any query or appointment booking call to Miss Swara (9033006262)\r\n\r\nOr \r\n\r\nsend your CV on hrd.aricentorg@gmail.com', 'Email: hrd.aricentorg@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9033006262', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '30 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-30 02:37:14', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979299, 0, 'Marketing Associate', 'Vanguard Human Resource Consultant Pvt Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '1', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Gurgaon', '', '', '1', '72', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '    Company Name: Vanguard Human Resource Consultant Pvt Ltd.\r\n    Email: anamika@vanguardhrconsulting.com', '', 'Should have excellent written & Verbal communication skills.\r\nShould have hunger and passion to work and excel.\r\nShould be flexible to work at odd hours.\r\nShould be flexible in approach and ability work in teams.\r\nWell groomed and presentable skills.\r\nKeen to make it big in life! \r\nDrive Customer Engagement Programs\r\nExecution Coordination\r\nProject Management \r\n\r\n\r\nSoft Skills\r\nExcellent documentation and Written/Verbal communication skills.\r\nMust be flexible, independent and self-motivated', '    Company Name: Vanguard Human Resource Consultant Pvt Ltd.\r\n    Email: anamika@vanguardhrconsulting.com', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '30 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-30 02:38:51', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979300, 0, 'Hiring for Business Associate', 'ACE MGMT', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Delhi', '    brand managementsales managementbusiness promotionbusiness developmentmarketing management', '', '28', '77', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Build Your Future With Us!!!\r\n\r\nHere comes an exciting opportunity to build your career with a dynamic and vibrant company renowned for developing some of the best leaders in our industry today. ACE MANAGEMENT is a top marketing solution providers in DELHI. Our specialty lies in creating long term brand awareness and providing cost effective solutions for a portfolio of clients.\r\n\r\nCompany Functions : \r\n\r\n1. Promoting the brand & increasing sales through face to face marketing\r\n\r\n2. Designing dynamic and innovative marketing strategies for blue chip companies\r\n\r\n3. Create high Brand Recall among Target Groups to increase Sales\r\n\r\n4. Communicate with target customers and manage customer relationships\r\n\r\n5. Execute the Below the Line (BTL) activities to create awareness\r\n\r\n6. Training and developing new candidates\r\n\r\n7. Involves leading a team of 20-30 candidates working in various functions of management.\r\n\r\n8. Interacting with new prospective blue chip companies and closing deals\r\n\r\n9. Team Building and mentoring\r\n\r\n10. Managing people and resources\r\n\r\n11. Marketing Management\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJOB DESCRIPTION-\r\n\r\nSo we select our new joinees as Business Associate and train and develop them holistically in all functional areas of Business Management viz. Marketing, HR, Finance and Operations over a period of 6-9-12 months as per the following Global Training Module (GTM):\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nBusiness Associate => HR Trainer => Executive Team Leader => Assistant Branch Head => Business Head\r\n\r\nPosition1: Trainee Manager/ Business Associate (BA)\r\n\r\n Activity/ Task set: Client Representation and Servicing\r\n\r\nPosition2: HR Trainer, Executive Team Leader\r\n\r\nActivity/ Task set: Team Building & Management\r\n\r\nPosition3: Assistant Branch Head\r\n\r\nActivity/ Task set: Overall Business Management\r\n\r\nPosition 4 / Title: Business Head\r\n\r\nActivity/ Task set: Management of a Strategic Business Unit (SBU)\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nMove forward based on your performance\r\n\r\nP.S WE ARE LOOKING OUT FOR IMMEDIATE STARTERS\r\n\r\n\"Do you want to be part of our ever growing success \r\nInterested applicants may send their CV to career@acemanagement.in or acedelhihr@gmail.com or call the Recruitment Team @9999867423', 'Email: career@acemanagement.in\r\nTelephone: 9999867423', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '30 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-30 02:40:11', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979301, 0, 'Account Executive (Lajpat Nagar,New Delhi)', 'Manav Management Group', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Delhi', ':     Accounts Income  Tax Bank  Reconciliation', '', '1', '1', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Hello We have Requirements for the post of:- Accounts Executive\r\n\r\nJob Title: Accounts Executive\r\n\r\n Industry- Industrial Security Service\r\n\r\n Work Experience: 3-5yrs (Accounts)\r\n\r\nSalary: - 20,000k to 25,000k\r\n\r\nJob Location:- Lajpat Nagar I,New Delhi 110024\r\n\r\nEducation Qualification: B.Com / M.Com/Mba/CA\r\n\r\n(Best Knowledge of vat,tds, taxation & Sale Tax.)\r\n\r\nJob Responsibility: -\r\n\r\n- Accounting of the inventory bills.\r\n\r\n- Vendor Reconciliation.\r\n\r\n- Invoice Processing and entries in Tally.\r\n\r\n- Daily Cash book maintained.\r\n\r\n- Handling of All braches petty cash.\r\n\r\n- Reconciliation of Account Payable and Account Receivable.\r\n\r\n- Cash & Bank Reconciliation.\r\n\r\n- Monthly & Annually deposited TDS & Service Tax and return filing,\r\n\r\n- Preparing Balance Sheet and Profit & Loss Account.\r\n\r\n- Online Payment.\r\n\r\n- Preparing Excise Reconciliation.\r\n\r\nIf you are interested for this profile so Plz send me your latest\r\n\r\nResume on my email add: - manavmanagementgroup@gmail.com\r\n\r\nReff By :-Manav Management Group\r\n\r\nWebsite: - www.manavmanagementgroup.in', '    Company Name: Manav Management Group\r\n    Email: manavmanagementgroup@gmail.com\r\n    Telephone: 0129-4019444', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '30 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-30 04:08:53', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979302, 0, 'Required Accounts Executive at Patel Nagar', 'J.J. India Hiring For J.J. India', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Delhi', '', '', '2', '108', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Urgently Required Account Executive. Candidate Should have 3-4 yrs of experience in Accounts and finance. Should be graduate or post graduate. Should have knowledge of tally, VAT, income tax, TDS, service tax etc\r\n\r\nâ€¢ Gross Salary: 20K-25K\r\n\r\nJob Location: Patel Nagar\r\n\r\nJob Timings: 9.30AM to 6PM\r\n\r\nInterested candidates can meet at J.J.INDIA, B-108, 2nd Floor, Lajpat Nagar, Part-1, New Delhi-110024 Ph: 9811008929, Email: info@jjindia.co.in', 'Email: info@jjindia.co.in\r\nTelephone: 9811008929', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '30 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-30 04:10:52', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979303, 0, 'Urgent openings with American Express in Customer Service and Collections', 'American Express', '', '2', '0', '', '1', '5', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Gurgaon', 'csa Customer Service customer support cse Communication skills Technical Support (Voice) Customer Service ', '', '9', '14', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Urgent openings with American Express in Customer Service and Collections\r\n\r\nAt American Express, we serve customers, not transactions. We are widely known for providing superior customer service and have been recognized for a number of achievements including being ranked highest in customer satisfaction within the credit card industry.\r\n\r\nA career in World Service at American Express is rich in experience and offers opportunities to build lasting relationships with our customers.\r\n\r\nJob Responsibilities: \r\n\r\nDeliver extraordinary customer care by responding to questions concerning customer accounts for different American Express Products.\r\n\r\nProcess card applications in a timely and comprehensive manner\r\n\r\nHighlight issues through feedback and recommend changes accordingly to meet customer needs and to ensure quality service\r\n\r\nDocument necessary account information and offer custom solutions that benefit the customer.\r\n\r\nDeliver extraordinary results measured by customer satisfaction, effectiveness, efficiency and quality\r\n\r\nBalance customer interests with the interests of American Express\r\n\r\nResolve all customer queries and follow established problem ticket recording procedures as appropriate.\r\n\r\nGather relevant information from customers as required and update it accurately to facilitate the decision making process.\r\n\r\nCandidate should be open to work in a 24/7 work environment.\r\n\r\nDesired Profile\r\n\r\nExperience Required:\r\n\r\nPrior customer service experience with a passion for building customer loyalty through exceptional listening, relationship building, and strong written and verbal communication.\r\n\r\nSkills Required:\r\n\r\nGraduate or Under Graduate (with prior international call center experience)\r\n\r\nAbility to work in a fast paced metric driven environment\r\n\r\nAbility to multitask and navigate in a windows environment.\r\n\r\nStrong written and verbal communication.\r\n\r\nAnalytical mind & attention to detail.\r\n\r\nKnowledge of Amex card product would be preferred.\r\n\r\nNote: Interested applicants may contact\r\n\r\n9311566611', 'Email: arvind.jauhari@aexp.com\r\nTelephone: 9311566611', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '31 January, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-01-31 05:47:36', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
