(98979309, 0, 'Developer-Sr.Developer', 'Cognizant Technology Solutions India Pvt. Ltd.', '', '4', '0', '', '4', '9', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '6', '', '', '', 'Pune', '', '', '23', '138', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'CTS is looking for .NET developers/Sr. Developers\r\n\r\nExperience: 4 to 9 Years\r\n\r\nLocation : Pune\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n\r\nResponsibilites :\r\n\r\nStrong understanding of object-oriented programming\r\n\r\n\r\nExperience with popular web application frameworks\r\nUnderstanding of fundamental design principles for building a scalable application\r\n\r\n\r\nDesign, build, and maintain efficient, reusable, and reliable code\r\n\r\n\r\nIntegrate data storage solutions {{may include databases, key-value stores, blob stores, etc.}}\r\n\r\n\r\nEnsure the best possible performance, quality, and responsiveness of applications\r\n\r\n\r\nIdentify bottlenecks and bugs, and devise solutions to mitigate and address these issues.\r\n\r\nDesired Candidate Profile\r\n\r\n\r\nCandidate profile: \r\n\r\n\r\nStrong knowledge in any of the below mentioned .NET framework\r\nSkill Cluster 1: .Net, WCF, Entity Framework\r\nSkill Cluster 2: ASP.Net, MVC, WCF\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRegards,\r\n\r\nTeam HR', 'Email: nishanth.vaish@cognizant.com\r\nTelephone: 04428224335', 'MCA/B Tech./ M Tech.', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '01 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-01 03:44:59', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979310, 0, 'Opening for Dot Net Developer in Pune', 'Dreamfond Group.', '', '1', '0', '', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Pune', 'Communication  Skills ASP Net', '', '23', '22', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'We are hiring the candidate on Urgent Basis for Dot Net Developer inpune .\r\n\r\nVacancies are :Dot Net Developer\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSkill Requirements:\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nÂ· Utilize established development tools, guidelines and conventions including but not limited to ASP.NET, SQL Server, HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and C#/VB.NET\r\n\r\nÂ· Design, code and test new Windows and web software applications\r\n\r\nÂ·\r\n\r\nÂ· Maintain existing software systems by identifying and correcting software defects\r\n\r\nÂ· Investigate and develop skills in new technologies\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRequirements:\r\n\r\nÂ· Excellent Communication Skills.\r\n\r\nÂ· Certification in .net would be added advantages.\r\n\r\nÂ· Good In Technical Coding & Knowledge For Drawing.\r\n\r\nÂ· Qualification:-Graduation /Post Graduate\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nSalary : 2L â€“ 5 L\r\n\r\nInterview Time : 10 Am to 5 PM.\r\n\r\nLocation :Shivaji Nagar Pune\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nAll The Bestâ€¦!Thanks& Regards\r\n\r\nDiya\r\n\r\n8446767742', 'Email: hrdg@dreamfond.com\r\nTelephone: 8446767742', 'MCA/B Tech./ M Tech.', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '01 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-01 03:46:33', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979311, 0, 'Dot Net Developer', 'Growel Softech Pvt. Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Pune', '', '', '23', '40', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'NET. Developer with 2 - 6 years of experience with C#.Net, MVC 4/5, node.js, Web API, Mongodb, Hadoop, MS Azure, AngularJs, Pythonfor a hands on coding. The successful candidate will need to demonstrate experience with enterprise-grade .Net applications. Ideally you will also have experience delivering Azure IaaS, PaaS, SaaS solutions. Building a strong reputation in Azure and IoT solution delivery.\r\nThe role will require you to work across multiple products over time providing technical leadership and support to team members and development partners.\r\nSkill Description:\r\n2+ years experience with MVC 4/5, Node.js, Web API, OData Services, Python, C# .Net 4.0 onwards, AngularJs, Bootstrap.\r\nMinimum of 1+ years of experience in defining and implementing cloud/Azure based large solutions.(optional)\r\nWorking experience in Azure IaaS, PaaS, storage, network and database.(optional)\r\nExperience and understanding of security requirements for cloud.\r\nExperience in assessing applications for cloud adoption\r\nExperience or knowledge about Azure IoT (preferred)\r\nExperience in Azure automation (preferred)', 'Email: shital.j@growelsoftech.com\r\nTelephone: 9370785953', 'MCA/B Tech./ M Tech.', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '01 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-01 03:47:45', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979312, 0, 'Dot Net Developers', 'Cyberindigo Net Pvt Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '6', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Pune', '', '', '23', '138', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Proven experience in MS SQL 2000 Server, ADO and/or Oracle Expertise in Visual Studio.Net. Proven track record in development of complex applications using SQL, MTS components Knowledge of project life cycle using Project Central and Microsoft Tools.\r\n\r\nAbility to troubleshoot errors associated with Web technology, VB Script, Javascript, HTML, XML, VB6, VB.net, c#, SQL Server 2000 & 7.0, Stored Procedures.\r\n\r\nStored Procedure creation, Database Design, SQL Data Definition Language, SQL Data Manipulation Language and APIs.\r\n\r\nRequirements\r\n\r\nDesired Candidate Profile\r\n\r\n1. 1-3 years of experience in developing Web Applications using .net.\r\n\r\n2. Good experience in ASP.Net,C#.net,Ajax is required.\r\n\r\n3. Understanding of SQL, stored procedures is required\r\n\r\n4. Exposure to DNN is preferred. - Should have good experience in\r\n\r\n* Project & database design\r\n\r\n* Client interaction\r\n\r\n* Prototyping & client sign-off\r\n\r\n* Development & Unit Testing\r\n\r\n* Project documentation\r\n\r\n* Application roll-out\r\n\r\n* Strong debugging skills', 'http://www.cyberindigo.net/\r\nEmail: hrd@cyberindigo.net', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '01 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-01 03:49:07', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979313, 0, 'IT/CS', 'Endeavor IT Solution.', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Indore', '', '', '23', '29', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'We are looking for Web developer who has a passion for creating world class social applications/web application.\r\n\r\nMain tasks & Responsibilities:\r\n\r\nDesign, build, test and deploy the whole applications in Open source.\r\n\r\nParticipating in business requirements, design review session and implementing it in web-application.\r\n\r\nWork with the development and design teams to bring solutions to life.\r\n\r\nRequired Skills:\r\n\r\nPHP Developer with MySQL, HTML and CSS knowledge.Strong coding skills and computer science fundamental.\r\n\r\nInterested candidates can apply for this.', '    Company Name: Endeavor IT Solution.\r\n    Company Description:\r\n    Endeavor IT Solution.\r\n    Email: ankitasharma.endeavor@gmail.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '02 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-02 01:26:50', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
