(98979315, 0, 'Business Development Executive/Officer', 'Skylux Telelink Private Limited', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '0', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'sales    Business Development   business development', '', '23', '82', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Job Specification & Description:\r\n\r\n        Marketresearch for the potential clientsandto understandthe current competition inmarket.\r\n\r\n        Cold calling to arrange meetings with potential customers to prospect for new business.\r\n\r\n        Maintaininganddeveloping relationships with existing customers in personandvia telephone callsandemails.\r\n\r\n        Responding to incoming emailandphone enquiries;\r\n\r\n        Acting as a contact between a company/production deptandits existingandpotentialmarkets.\r\n\r\n        Negotiating the terms of an agreementandclosingsales, completing all the required documentation for on boarding client as per standards.\r\n\r\n        Negotiating on price, costs, deliveryandspecifications with buyersandmanagers;\r\n\r\n        Ensure weekly meeting is conducted to measure and use of best practices.\r\n\r\n        Managing inquiries received from SEO services, Google Ad\'s, Email blast.\r\n\r\n        Preparationandmaintaining Rejection reportandother MIS documents as required.\r\n\r\n        Attending new product demonstrations and seminars of OEMs\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEducation-\r\n\r\nUG:Any Graduate - Any Specialization, B.B.A - Management, B.Sc - Any\r\n\r\nSpecialization, Diploma - Any Specialization\r\n\r\nPG:MBA/PGDM - Any Specialization, PG Diploma - Any\r\n\r\nUG:Any Graduate - Any Specialization, B.B.A - Management, B.Sc - Any\r\n\r\nSpecialization, Diploma - Any Specialization\r\n\r\nPG:MBA/PGDM - Any Specialization, PG Diploma - Any', 'preeti.raj@skyluxinc.com\r\nEmail: preeti.raj@skyluxinc.com\r\nTelephone: 9036055218', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '02 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2