(98979319, 0, 'Openings for Service Desk Engineer- Bangalore-Immediate joiners', 'Streamsource Services.', '', '1', '0', '', '1', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '  Service Desk  Customer Service', '', '9', '12', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Dear job seekers,\r\n\r\nWe have urgent requirement for Service Desk Engineer in Bangalore location.Please find the details below.\r\n\r\nSkills Required : Level one Desktop.\r\n\r\nExperience : one to two years\r\n\r\nCommunication : Excellent\r\n\r\nPay Rate : ap per company standards\r\n\r\nNotice Period : upto 15days(Max).\r\n\r\nJob Location : Bangalore.\r\n\r\nRoles :\r\n\r\nExcellent communication skill. Desired Geographical exposure to UK and US customers/users. To work in a 24/7 environment, logging incidents and Service Requests accurately, carrying out initial diagnosis and progressing them in a timely fashion to meet KPIâ€™s, resolving the incidents wherever possible.\r\n\r\nCo-ordinate incident resolution activities across a large number of internal groups and 3rd Party suppliers to ensure customer incidents/changes are resolved within SLA.\r\n\r\nIncidents may be detected or received from monitoring tools, phone calls, emails, chat and web.\r\n\r\nâ€œTo be the first point of contact for all colleagues for all IT related issues. To provide excellent customer service by ensuring that all requests are actioned and resolved accurately, in line with agreed business processes and procedures, and to the customerâ€™s satisfaction. To be a contributing team member ensuring key business objectives and individual performance standards are met and/or exceeded.â€\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nPlease apply if you are interested.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nRegards\r\n\r\nStreamsource services', 'Email: jobs@streamsourceindia.com\r\nTelephone: 9916906567', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '03 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-03 05:51:04', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979320, 0, 'Urgent Hiring furniture for marketing Graduate / M.B.A.', 'Shree Shyam Enterprises Hiring For Shree Shyam Enterprises', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '3', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Gurgaon', '', '', 'Select Industry', '139', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Job Description: Direct sales\r\n\r\nAnnual Compensation: INR Negotiable as per the candidates\r\n\r\nPotential - Rs. 1.2L - Rs. 2.5L\r\n\r\nEducation : Graduate / M.B.A.\r\n\r\nIndustrial Experience : Fresher / 2-3 Year Experienced in furniture\r\n\r\nField.\r\n\r\nRole : Marketing & Sales - Direct\r\n\r\nLocation- Gurgaon\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nNeed Marketing Executive having knowledge of computer\r\n\r\nbasis. Also good communication would be preferred &\r\n\r\nhaving own vehicle must.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n_ Meet clients, Understand requirements\r\n\r\n_ Explain Office Chairs, Office Furniture, Modular Office Furniture Products\r\n\r\n_ Capture and update customer information accurately\r\n\r\n_ Listen attentively to customer need.\r\n\r\n_ Candidate should have a positive attitude & should be goal oriented.\r\n\r\n_ Quick in response\r\n\r\n_ Candidate should have good presentation and convincing skills\r\n\r\n_ Good Communication Skills in English.\r\n\r\n_ Generate leads/prospects over the phone.\r\n\r\n_ Follow up with incoming leads.\r\n\r\n_ Multitasking ability.\r\n\r\nWe are looking for someone with a strong personality and a bottom-up attitude.\r\n\r\nAs Marketing & Sales, you are proactive and result-oriented, with a focus on\r\n\r\nefficiency.\r\n\r\n \r\nThanks & Regards,\r\nMr. Vinod Kumar \r\n0124-4218890, ,7827667762', 'Email: shreeshyam1134@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 0124-4218890', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '03 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-03 05:53:36', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(98979321, 0, 'Urgent requirement for Business Development Manager in Mohali IT Park', 'T & A HR Solutions Hiring For T & A HR Solutions', '', '1', '0', '', '0', '2', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Mohali', 'MAILIT PARK   Business Development', '', '23', '72', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Urgent requirement for Business Development Manager in Mohali IT Park\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nDesignation:- Business Development Manager\r\n\r\nExp: Fresher can also apply\r\n\r\nQualification :- MBA & Any Graduate\r\n\r\nSalary: 2.5 Lakhs â€“ 3 Lakhs PA + Incentives\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJOB DESCRITION\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJob Responsibilities will include: \r\n\r\n \r\n\r\n-Research: Researching industries, organisations, and individuals to identify new leads and potential markets.\r\n\r\n-Lead Generation: After identifying a new lead (according to a given industry), initiating contact via email or phone to establish rapport and setting up meetings.\r\n\r\n-Background Preparation: Drafting a customized approach for each new lead by researching turnovers, market reach, and other parameters. \r\n\r\n-Service Pitch: Curating PowerPoint presentations to effectively pitch our services to new clients & leave a lasting impression.\r\n\r\n-CRM: Maintaining a good working relationship with all clients by regularly keeping in touch via email, phone or meetings. \r\n\r\n Travel will be in North India including Tricity, NCR and neighbouring StateInterested candidates kindly forward your updated CV on hr1@tasolutions.in given mail ID with your current and expected CTC or call on 9023404909 if not interested we will really appreciate if u forward this position to your colleagues', '    Company Name: T & A HR Solutions Hiring For T & A HR Solutions\r\n    Email: hr1@tasolutions.in\r\n    Telephone: 9023404909', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '03 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-03 05:55:50', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
