(98979330, 0, 'HR Manager', 'ToXSL Technologies Pvt. Ltd.', '', '4', '0', '', '0', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Mohali', 'hr manager  fresher  mca  mba  btech ', '', '23', '115', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Designation: HR Manager | Executive\r\n\r\nExperience: 0 - 3 year\r\n\r\nNo of Positions: 2\r\n\r\nSalary: up-to 30K pm | Negotiable\r\n\r\nSkills: excellent communication, employee engagement, hiring, appraisal & increment, email writing, team handling\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nCompany: ToXSL Technologies Pvt Ltd (ISO 9001:2015)\r\n\r\nContact: 9569227788 | 09569127788\r\n\r\nEmail: HR@TOXSL.COM\r\n\r\nAddress: C-127, 4th Floor, Industrial Area, Phase-8 (Sec-72), Mohali (Chandigarh)\r\n\r\nIndustry: Software Services (Android, iOS, Hybrid apps, Web designing & Development)\r\n\r\nTeam Size: 100+\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nInterested applicants, kindly share CV at hr@toxsl.com or call at 09569127788.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJob Description HR Executive | Manager:\r\n\r\n1) Managing employee database, documentation, joining formalities.\r\n\r\n2) Managing employee attendance.\r\n\r\n3) Interview handling, face to face interview, salary negotiation.\r\n\r\n4) Employee increment & appraisal, salary calculation.\r\n\r\n5) Policy drafting & updating.\r\n\r\n6) Grievance handling and employee engagement activities. \r\n\r\n7) Should be able to understand skills & JDs for technical profiles.\r\n\r\n8) Ability to work independently and multitask in a fast paced environment. Excellent communication skills.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nJob Description Technical Recruiter:\r\n\r\n1) Responsible for searching and recruiting the candidates on various skills.\r\n\r\n2) Knowledge of Sourcing profiles through various sources like Job Portals, References, and other social networks.\r\n\r\n3) Should be able to understand skills & JDs for technical profiles.\r\n\r\n4) Preferably from Consultancy or IT Firm.\r\n\r\n5) Very Strong communication and interpersonal skills.\r\n\r\n6) Ability to work independently and multitask in a fast paced environment.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nInterested applicants, kindly share CV at hr@toxsl.com or call at 09569127788.', 'Email: hr@toxsl.com\r\nTelephone: 9569127788', 'MBA- HR', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '06 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-06 03:12:56', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
