king with the company)\r\n - 5 Days Working\r\n - Huge Incentives & over time above the CTC.\r\n - Free transport subjected to the process\r\n - Internet facility, ATM facility\r\n - Food Court\r\n - Excellent Growth Path\r\n - Medical facility\r\n\r\n APPLY TO â€“ jobsatvirtue@gmail.com\r\n\r\nPLEASE NOTE APPLICATIONS SENT ON ANY OTHER EMAIL ADDRESS WILL NOT BE ENTERTAINED\r\n OR\r\n DIRECT WALKIN ON All This february)\r\n Venue Address \r\n For HINDUJA/WIPRO AT 196-SATYA NIKETAN, 1ST FLOOR,NEW DELHI, LANDMARK- VENKATESHWAR COLLEGE OR MOTI BAGH GURUDWARA, NEAREST METRO STATION-AIIMS,NEW DELHI-110021\r\n Time-(11-4PM)( TO GET ON THE SPOT OFFER LETTER)\r\n\r\nThanks & Regards\r\n Virtue Hiring Team\r\n Helpline-09116123192/09001590333', 'Email: virtuejobsncr@gmail.com\r\nTelephone: 9116123192', 'Graduation / PG', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-07 03:56:44', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(99172170, 0, 'Senior Software Engineer', 'ametech Technologies.', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'JIRAN  Unit', '', '23', '56', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'An exciting opportunity has arisen for a senior Software Engineer in our Research and Design department to work on a variety of measurement applications in the fields of high performance to fuel efficient engines, aerospace, photovoltaics, smart phone lens modules, the latest Digital SLR camera optics and the fast growing area of Intraocular lenses.\r\n\r\nJob Purpose\r\n\r\nTo develop desktop software for a range of world class metrology products, see www.taylor-hobson.com \r\n \r\n\r\nThe successful candidate will be responsible for the design of new software products as well as extending and maintaining existing established products at the Taylor Hobson office in Bangalore. You will be a team leader, with a desire to work in a mutli disciplined fast moving engineering environment and have a fundamental interest in technology. Training will be provided, where appropriate, in order to meet the skills and knowledge specified below.\r\nWhat skills do I need to have \r\n\r\n C# with WPF and Winforms using Visual Studio\r\n Object Oriented techniques\r\n Experience (e.g. 5+ years) of the software development life cycle in an agile environment (e.g. Scrum).\r\n Development of robust and reliable software, backed up with auto testing \r\nIt would be great if you have some experience of:\r\n\r\n UI design and 3D modelling, probably building on experience from gaming or CAD development\r\n DirectX, OpenGL and modelling packages such as Blender, Maya and 3D Studio Max.\r\n Perforce, NUnit, JIRA and Kinooks VisualBuild.\r\n Experience of remote site development (e.g. India-UK).\r\n Debugging and diagnostic techniques and tools.\r\n Software control of hardware such as motion, I/O, data logging .\r\n Experience of leading a small team\r\n Development of algorithms in a scientific/instrumentation environment.\r\n Analysis of requirements and creative software solutions and designs to meet these requirements.', 'Email: hr@ametech.co.in\r\nTelephone: 2652781666', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-07 03:58:38', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(99172171, 0, 'Senior Software Engineer', 'Opulentus Overseas Careers Pvt Ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '0', '1', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Singapore', '', '', '23', '56', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'The Segment Data team is looking for a full-stack software engineer.\r\nThis small, fast pacing and innovative team is currently solving a complex business problem by developing a brand new self-service platform, dealing with enormous quantities of data. We love surfing on the edge of cutting-edge technologies, whilst at the same time solving rudimentary problems related to big data. We work in an open and startup-like culture, where everyone makes impact in their own way.\r\nWe are looking for a self-starter who is keen on taking up challenges of performance and optimization in the big data world. One who can own the product, and aggressively drives the results with continuous focus on quality and customer experience. A great coder who takes pride in solving complex and interesting problems, yet giving enough attention to details. Keen to learn new technologies and has an ability to exercise it for betterment of the product.\r\n \r\nResponsibilities\r\n\r\nTake full ownership of the product pipeline and drive features end to end.\r\nInteract with customers, understand different use cases and turn those into platform features.\r\nDesign and develop software to meet high scale and performance requirements.\r\nDeploy and operate the platform in production environment. Identify production issues and troubleshoot in an efficient manner.\r\nContribute towards the collaborative team environment by keeping an open and healthy communication channel.\r\nRich hands-on experience in writing Java, Scala or C++ code, using best industry practices.\r\nFluent in one of the scripting languages, such as Python, Perl or RubyHas a solid foundation of data structures and algorithms and ability to apply them in real world problems.\r\nUnderstand the complexities of multi-threading and concurrent programming, specifically in Linux OS.\r\nExperience with big data technologies(hadoop/map-reduce), distributed and scalable architectures is a plus.\r\nKnowledge of web servers, and experience with web technologies and frameworks(JavaScript, HTML, CSS, Angular.js, React.js)\r\nWorking knowledge of databases like Postgresql/mysql.\r\nExposure to AWS technologies is an added advantage', 'Opulentus Overseas Careers Pvt Ltd.\r\nEmail: manager.hr@opulentuz.com\r\nTelephone: 4064624501', 'MCA/B Tech./ M Tech.', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-07 04:00:01', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(99172172, 0, 'Senior Software Engineer', 'It zone global services.', '', '2', '0', '', '2', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Noida', '    Design', '', '23', '29', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Strong JavaScript. Extensive prior development experience required Prior working experience using React JSWeb Development using Javacsript, CSS & HTML5Strong written and verbal communications skillsSolid understanding of all phases of the Software Development and test Life CycleNTT DATA is your Innovation Partner anywhere around the world. Headquartered in Tokyo, with business operations in 42 countries, we put emphasis on long-term commitment and combine global reach and local intimacy to provide premier professional services from consulting, system development to business IT outsourcing.Since 1967, NTT DATA has played an instrumental role in establishing and advancing IT infrastructure. Originally part of Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Public Corporation, its heritage contributed to social benefits with a quality-first mindset. A public company since 1995, the company builds on this proven track record of innovation by providing novel IT solutions to bring results in greater quality of life for people, communities and societies around the world.NTT DATA Group, which has been aggressively expanding its overseas business since 2005, has grown to employ approximately 80,000 people in offices in more than 40 countries and regions around the world', 'Email: itzonemani@gmail.com', '', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-07 04:01:26', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(99172173, 0, 'Senior Software Engineer', 'C.G.I.Pvt.Ltd.', '', '2', '0', '', '3', '6', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', 'Core Java ', '', '9', '22', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Work with multiple project delivery team Process design; development and/or improvement.\r\n To interpret the requirements and produce the detailed design documents.\r\n Will have to demonstrate root cause analysis, planning, and managing the development effort to produce error free code products for delivery.\r\n Perform root cause analysis, and in organizing, planning, and managing the development effort to produce error free code products for delivery.\r\n\r\nRequired qualifications to be successful in this role:\r\n\r\nPrimary Skills : \r\n 4-6 years in Core Java, J2EE (JSP, Servlets, MS) and web application \r\n Frameworks like Struts, Springs, Jasper Report\r\n UI frameworks like Bootstrap and related UI design\r\n Oracle Database including SQL Queries, PL/SQL and query optimization techniques \r\nSecondary Skills :\r\n Automated Unit Testing in JUnit,Mockito highly preferred\r\n Good understanding of Software Development Life Cycle (SDLC). \r\n Candidate must have a strong working knowledge in software engineering practices\r\n\r\nStrong analytical, developing, debugging and problem solving skills required.\r\n\r\nAny Graduate / Post Graduate', '    Company Name: C.G.I.Pvt.Ltd.\r\n    Email: guddu081@gmail.com\r\n    Telephone: 8507107547', 'BE/BTech', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-07 04:02:41', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(99172174, 0, 'Senior software Engineer java eclipse Plugi', 'Inspiration Manpower Consultancy Pvt. Ltd.', '', '1', '0', '', '2', '4', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Bangalore', '', '', '23', '40', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Programming skills: Java, Eclipse Plug-in Development OSLC 2.0 with Restful & SOAP/http Web Services 4. Strong Eclipse plugin developnment using Eclipse Frameworks: EMF, GEF, GMF, Graphiti, BIRT, ARTOP, EATOP, XTEXT 5. Software Design Skills: Object Oriented Analysis and Design, Design Patterns. 6. Should have excellent communication and customer facing skills 7. Should have developed solutions for the automotive industry 8. Proven ability to conceptualize and provides solution to a given problem scenario', '\r\nInspiration Manpower Consultancy Pvt. Ltd.\r\nEmail: accounts@inspirationmanpower.co.in', 'MCA/B Tech./ M Tech.', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '07 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-07 04:03:50', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
(99172175, 0, 'Accounts Executive', 'Accounts Executive GSP Power Projects.', '', '5', '0', '', '2', '8', 'Full-Time', '', '', '', '', '4', '', '', '', 'Gurgaon', 'Account   accounting   payroll ', '', '2', 'Select Functional Area', '', 'Y', 'Y', '', '', '', 'Dear Candidate,\r\n\r\nWe are urgently hiring for the position of Asst. Manager Accounts\r\n\r\nWe would like to introduce our self as GSP as a group has three companies under its fold. GSP Power Projects are an authorized GOEM for MAHINDRA & MAHINDRA LTD and Manufacture Silent DG sets Powered Mahindra Engines. GSP Power Projects has started manufacturing Portable Range of DG sets and other Portable Products powered by CEL engines (European Technology).Manufacturing unit for Silent DG Sets by the name of GSP Power Projects, located at Jammu & Kashipur,M/S Chrome well Industries at Faridabad.\r\n\r\nJOB REQUIREMENTS:\r\n\r\nPosition: Accountant\r\nExperience: 2-8 years\r\nJob Location: Gurgaon\r\nSalary: Negotiable \r\n\r\nJOB Description :-\r\n\r\n    Income Tax \r\n    T.D.S \r\n    Service Tax \r\n    Vat \r\n    R.O.C \r\n    Labor Laws \r\n    Management Consultancy.\r\n    Statutory Audits Of Banks \r\n    Internal Audits & Concurrent Audits\r\n\r\nTHE SCHEDULE/VENUE FOR THE INTERVIEWS ARE AS FOLLOWS\r\n \r\n\r\nDate: 10th and 13th Feb,2017\r\n\r\nTimings: 11.00 am onwards\r\n \r\nYou are requested please be on time for the interview. If for any reason the date is inconvenient for you kindly, contact the undersigned for an alternate date. You are also need to call or SMS at any of the numbers given below and confirm your availability for the interview failing which the interview call will be null and void.\r\n \r\nReporting Venues -\r\n\r\nUnit No. - 20 ,Ground Floor\r\n\r\nBest Tech Business Tower | Sector 48\r\n\r\nSohna Road|Gurgaon | Haryana - 122018\r\n\r\nhttp://www.gspgroup.co.in\r\n\r\nContact: Ms. Neha Singh\r\n\r\nTel : 0124 - 4810035\r\n\r\nMobile - +919313511696\r\n\r\nE - Mail â€“hrm@gsppower.com\r\n\r\nPlease confirm your attendance for this upcoming interview.\r\n\r\nYou are requested to mail and bring a set of documents (photocopies) listed \r\nbelow\r\n 1. Your updated resume/bio-data.\r\n 2. Passport size color photographs.\r\n\r\n We wish you all the luck!', 'Email: hrm@gsppower.com\r\nTelephone: 0124-4810032', 'MBA', 'Formal', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', '08 February, 2017', '', 17303, '2017-02-08 05:06:38', 'IN', 'Y', '', '', '', ''),
