(57123, 'F', '', '', '', 'D', 0, 'isquaresoft', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">I SQUARE SOFT CONSULTING SERVICES&reg;&nbsp;</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">was established in 2005 and is India&rsquo;s leading independent provider of Software.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; development service, IT/ITES, NON IT RECURITMENT, and Corporate Training to a wide range of clients throughout India. In these fields the company has been recognized for its ability to explain complex ideas simply and precisely to a range of audiences</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">.</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #333333; background-image: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-size: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; background-position: initial; background-repeat: initial;\">Talent Acquisi