(89273, 'F', '', '', '', 'D', 0, 'VISION INDIA SERVICES PVT LTD', '', '', '', '', 'https://twitter.com/visionindiaspl', 'https://www.facebook.com/Vision-India-297732810333798/?ref=aymt_homepage_panel', '', 'www.vispl.co.in', 'Vision India  Services  Pvt. Ltd. is a conglomerate of Industry  professionals providing Staffing services, committed towards creating a partnership in the world of outsourcing. We work to create a new world of possibilities with our partners thereby delivering a high value proposition. Partnership with our clients is imperative to us since we firmly believe that innovating together, towards a Unified goal is the key to success in todayâ€™s world, leading to measurable & tangible bottom line.\r\n\r\n\r\nVision India\'s corporate team consists of highly qualified professionals focusing on strategy, operations, compliance, assessment, analysis having expertise in Client Relationship & Delivery and HR Practices required for various business segments.\r\n\r\nVision India is focused solely on enhancing the performance of your organization. We do this by leveraging our very best in talent, tools, and processes in Human Resources\r\n\r\nWe provide you the leverage of cost base and experience of an outside provider, to potentially lower the cost of delivering HR services, while maintaining or improving service levels.\r\n\r\nWith the right blend of cost, workforce management solutions, experience and economies of scale we allow you to move away from administrative activities and focus on more strategic issues\r\n\r\nShort-term projects are one of the highlights of modern day business. We provide temporary staffing/Contractual Labour solutions that will help in hiring Idea candidates. Our completeness in HR systems and processes takes off a lot of burden off you.\r\n', '', 'shahid.ashraf@vispl.co.in', 'shahid89273', '02a3541d3648dcf943934344b67d69f8', 'shahid', 'ashraf', '', '', '1', '', '', 'kolkata', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '',