(34047, 'F', '', '', '', 'D', 0, 'www.mitramind.net', '', '', '', '', '', 'www.facebook.com/mitramindworld', '', 'www.mitramind.net', 'mitramind.net offers a professional consulting arena represented by a consortium of seasoned industry experts and a forum aimed towards the benefit of the diverse corporate requirements (human capital development, branding & PR, milestone events), career development seekers and an end-to-end solution provider for individual and entrepreneurial needs for brand/image development.\r\n\r\nWe also offer consulting on areas like Public Relations, Digital Social Media, Corporate Social Responsibility Consulting, Image Consulting, Celebrity Management, Movie Promotions and Media Relations.\r\n\r\nWe advice customized solutions in End-To-End Sourcing & Hiring, Total HRO (recruitment and generalist), Brand Communication Roadmap (strategy & action plan) for corporate houses to aid their endeavour to reach the target user. We support the fresh ignited minds with advisory sessions for entrepreneurial start-up initiatives via business consultation across multiple genres. \r\n\r\nOur contribution towards the recreational aspect of worklife embodies event management (PR & Entertainment) ventures and fully customized tours (including but not limited to outdoor travel packages, conference, business meet, etc.).', '', 'connect@mitramind.net', 'Mitramind34047', '8f28b6540f6b67aad39c71a039fb84c8', 'Mitramind', 'Consultants', '', '', '1', '', '', 'Kolkata', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '+917059914523', '', '', '', '', '', '', 4, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'E', '', '', '', '', '', '', '04 November, 2016', '2016-11-04', '2016-11-04 02:48:08', 'Y', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 194, 'N', 'Y', 'IN', '', ''),
