(31750, 'F', '', '', '', 'D', 0, 'Valuepoint Knowledgeworks', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', 'www.knowledgew.com', 'Knowledgeworks is a leading language services company providing a broad spectrum of high-end localisation solutions to key industry verticals. Founded in 2001 at Bangalore, the technology capital of India, it boasts a Client base comprising the Whoâ€™s Who of Information Technology (IT), Manufacturing, Healthcare, BFSI, MRO, and Media sectors, among others. We provide high-quality, reliable and time-bound translation services for any language combination globally. With a robust pool of qualified, domain-specific, and experienced translators and language experts spread across different continents, complemented by a vibrant in-house manpower base, we strive to meet our Clientsâ€™ linguistic requirements on the benchmarks of precision, consistency and confidentiality.\r\n\r\nAt Knowledgeworks, we understand the key role quality localisation plays in helping organisations seamlessly enter linguistically and culturally diverse markets and in making their products accessible across linguistic barriers. Whether you plan to localize your software suiteâ€™s UI strings into new languages, or to translate your medical brochures with perfect accuracy, whether you want multilingual Voice-over for your corporate training kit or rigorous translation of your legal documents, Knowledgeworks can be the trusted partner for all your linguistic needs. Operating on the OTD (On Time Delivery) and FTR (First Time Right) business principles, Knowledgeworks is your one-stop choice where cost-effective and immaculate translation matters.\r\n', '', 'shailaja.h@knowledgew.com', 'shailaja31750', '6886d53f4e4250c48b21685d1f78668c', 'Shailaja', 'Hagaragi', '', '', '1', '', '', 'banglore', '560043', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '+918904521673', 'valuepoint.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', 2, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'E', '', '', '