various industry sectors we operate in\r\n\r\nâ€¢	We work backwards from our knowledge to ensure a forward path for your organization with the timely delivery of solutions and their continuous improvement\r\n\r\nâ€¢	Our turnaround time (TAT) is 48 hours', '', 'info@timeous.in', 'Dipankar64380', '1c9c282bde159a2cc0b463b56573c477', 'Dipankar', 'Sharma', '', '', '1', '', '', 'New Delhi', '110091', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '+918851268504', '286343Logo - TCS.jpg', '', '', '', '', '', 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, '', '', 'E', '', '', '', '', '', '', '29 January, 2017', '2017-01-29', '2017-01-29 01:02:28', 'Y', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 'N', 108, 'N', 'Y', 'IN', '', ''),
