(19, 'Candidate Terms and Conditions', 'Candidate Terms and Conditions', 'Candidate Terms and Conditions', 'Candidate Terms and Conditions', '<p>The website, <a href=\"http://www.jobsire.com\">www.jobsire.com</a> (hereinafter, this address will be known as the \'Website\'), remains a public  domain URL that offers free access to people. Jobsire (hereinafter will be  known as \'the Company\') shall bear no liability for the authenticity or the  quality of the responses. The Company is not in a position to monitor all the  responses which an individual shall receive as a response to any information  that a particular person has displayed or used on the website. The job seeker  and the employer have to perform individual background checks on the genuine  nature of a response or responses.</p>\n<p>The Company shall not be held responsible for the accuracy  of information provided on the Website. The visitor has to take up  responsibility to do further research on specific information on this Website.  Any breach of information that is given by a consumer to this Company and which  is placed on this Website through technical or other means cannot be deemed as  the Company\'s responsibility. The same will apply to any breach of privacy. The  Company will not be able to provide any guarantees about the privacy of any  information that is provided by an individual who is using or acquiring the  information which is displayed on this Website or other websites and domains  that are under the ownership or operation of the Company.</p>\n<p>The Company will not be able to share any data that is  personally identifiable, of any job seeker or candidate, with any other entity  or company without seeking prior permission except in the case of those  individuals who are acting as the Company\'s agents. The company will divulge  such information that is under its possession as a response to legal processes  such as a subpoena or a court order. Users of such information will not use the  services which are offered by the Company or this Website in a manner that has  a negative impact on the functioning or the interests of the Website or the  Company. Users will also have to undertake responsibility of not duplicating,  downloading, publishing, modifying or distributing any material on this Website  unless it has been authorized specifically by this Company to do so. The job  seeker will also undertake responsibility that he or she will not establish any  connections or links to a specific page of this Website except to the Home  Page, without seeking the prior permission of the Company.</p>\n<p>The candidate will undertake usage of the Website for his or  her individual purposes alone. Use of content from this Website for the purpose  of plagiarism with commercial motives, without seeking prior consent from the  Company, will be strictly forbidden.</p>\n<p>The Website employs technological methods to exclude items  like robots from crawling over or exploring its content in order to scrape it.  The candidate will have to undertake responsibility of not circumventing such  means.</p>\n<p>Job seekers will also have to undertake responsibility that  all services that are offered by the Company or the Website will not be used to  post, upload or transit through email or by any other means available to them  either indirectly or directly. They also have to undertake that they will not  make available any bulk or commercial email that is unsolicited. The Company holds  the privilege to block, filter and monitor all emails which are sent by a job  seeker who is using the servers being maintained by this Company for the  purpose of relaying emails. The candidate and the Company have to abide by the  rules set forward by the International Best Practices towards containment and  the elimination of Spam.</p>\n<p>Users also undertake not to spam the database that is being  maintained by the Company or the Website. They also undertake responsibility  not to forward mail repeatedly or indiscriminately which may be considered as  spam. Any user conduct that violates this particular clause will make the  Company eligible to terminate services forthwith to that particular user,  without giving any notice to him or her.<br />\n  <br />\n  The user is not allowed to post, upload, publish, transmit or distribute all  such information or material which is considered unlawful or that may be viewed  potentially as being threatening, harassing, harmful, defamatory, abusive,  vulgar, libelous, obscene or otherwise ethnically or racially objectionable.<br />\n  <br />\n  The user has to state explicitly that the resume or the submission of  information being supplied into the Company\'s network is complete and correct  in all regards and that it does not involve any distorted, fraudulent, false, manipulated  or misleading averments or facts. The Company also shall explicitly disclaim  all liability that may arise from this particular resume or submission of  information that is supplied into its network by the job seeker. Additionally,  the candidate or the user has to agree to indemnify all possible losses that  the Company may incur as a result of distorted, defamatory, false, manipulated,  vulgar, libelous, fraudulent, obscene or misleading facts or averments that are  made objectionably by him or her on the Company\'s network.</p>\n<p><strong>Protection of the  User Account</strong><br />\n  <br />\n  The user shall take sole responsibility for the maintenance of the privacy of  the password and identification details of the User. The user shall also be  responsible for maintenance of confidentiality of all transmission and  activities that are performed by him or her through the process of  identification. The user shall also take up responsibility of carrying out  online or offline transactions that include debit cards, credit cards or  related forms of such instruments and documents; the Company will not assume  any liability or responsibility for any improper use of such information which  is related to the handling of debit cards and credit cards that are used by the  subscribers either on online or offline basis.</p>\n<p>The candidate or subscriber to this Website and all its  affiliated Websites does agree specifically that he or she will comply at all  times with the requirements that have been set up by the Information Technology  Act of 2000 along with all its rules, regulations, bye laws, guidelines and the  notifications that have been made there under while feeding or assessing any  resume or submission of information into the computer systems, computers or the  computer network of this Company. The said subscriber or candidate to this  Website and its affiliated Websites does further declare unequivocally that in  case of violation of any provision of the Information Technology Act of 2000 or  its rules and regulations or guidelines, bye laws or notifications, he or she  shall solely be responsible for his or her acts or deeds and that he or she  shall be held liable for both criminal and civil liability there under or under  other laws that are currently in force.<br />\n  <br />\n  The candidate shall be held responsible for attaining all permits, licenses,  consents, approvals and intellectual property or other rights at his or her own  cost as may be eligible for use of the services.<br />\n  <br />\n  The subscriber or the candidate to this Website or its affiliated Websites is  forbidden from posting, updating, uploading, transmitting or sharing any such  information that:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Belongs to any other individual and to which  this particular subscriber does not have any legal right to. </li>\n  <li>Is considered harassing, blasphemous, harmful,  defamatory, pornographic, obscene, invasive of other person\'s privacy,  libelous, hateful, disparaging, ethically or racially objectionable, harmful to  minors, relating to or encouraging laundering of money or gambling or illegal  in any regard. </li>\n  <li>Infringes any trademark, proprietary rights,  patent or copyright. </li>\n  <li>Violates laws that are currently in force. </li>\n  <li>Misleads or deceives the addressee about the  source of these messages or transmits any data which is considered menacing or  offensive in nature. </li>\n  <li>Impersonates any other individual. </li>\n  <li>Contains viruses for software or other computer  codes, programs or files that are meant to destroy, interrupt or restrict the  functionality of a computer resource while threatening the integrity, security,  unity, sovereignty of the country, defence, friendly relations with foreign  countries or public order and which causes provocation to the commissioning of  cognizable offence or prevents the scrutiny of an offence. </li>\n</ul>\n<p>The user cannot violate the intellectual property rights of  other entities or persons or download or retain information from other computer  systems or otherwise with an intent to carry out such acts.<br />\n  <br />\n  The Company shall put in its best efforts but it does not offer warranty that  the Website or any affiliated Websites and their linked network systems remain  free of operational errors; the company also does not warranty that the Website  or its affiliated Websites will remain free of computer contaminants, viruses,  worms or other harmful components. User\'s subscription will be held subject to  Quotas as they are applicable and as they are advised. Emails that are offered  as part of the information concerning contact details are assumed to be  authentic and genuine and access to these email accounts will be made available  only to authorised personnel.</p>\n<p>The Company cannot be held liable for losses or damages that  are sustained on account of inadvertent disclosure of information related to  the account of the user and about any information that may be related to the  online transactions and use of debit cards or credit cards and their  verification process or particulars. The Company will also not be held liable  for inaccuracies, errors and omissions in regards to information that is  disclosed or used, regardless of whether or not it is done in pursuit of a  legal procedure or otherwise.</p>\n<p>Payments for services that are provided by the Website shall  entirely be on an advance basis. Refund, when applicable, will solely be at the  Company\'s discretion. The Company shall provide no guarantee for the timeliness  or accuracy of refunds reaching the bank or the card accounts of the customers  or users. The Company also gives no warranty of server uptime or proper working  of its applications. It is provided on a best-effort basis and the Company\'s  liability gets restricted only to the refund of the amount. The Company shall  not take any liability for providing free services. The Company also reserves  its rights to alter or amend any agreement terms or disclaimers at any given  time, without prior notice. All terms or disclaimers, despite specific mention  or not, shall be deemed as included when a reference is made to any of them.<br />\n  <br />\n  The Company also reserves the right to publish data on its Website or on any of  its affiliated Websites or publications as it deems fit without charging anything  extra to the user or subscriber.</p>\n<p>The agreement between the subscriber and the Company cannot  be treated as a \'non-poach\' one nor can it be used or termed as a \'non-poach agreement\' alternative when the Company or its Website is a public domain and information  that is published by the Company is made public except such information which  is assigned a private character specifically.</p>\n<p>Any agreement for usage or subscription that is entered into  by the Company does not become exclusive in terms of service on any user or  subscriber.</p>\n<p>The Company cannot be held party to legal proceedings  between users and parties that are contracted through the Website. When the  Company is drawn into any legal proceedings, the costs shall be recovered from  that party which involves this Company. However, the Company will abide by  court orders that may be served on it through all due processes.</p>\n<p>In the situation of any individual using the internet  receives viruses or spam messages that include links to the Website or to other  sites owned, maintained or operated by it, liability will not fall on the  Company for the said purpose. The Company will not assume any responsibility  for any such mails.</p>\n<p>Services that are offered by Websites owned, maintained or  operated by the Company will not cover representation as agents on behalf of  users or subscribers.</p>\n<p>The Company employs no agents and does not function through  agents except for those who are mentioned specifically on the Website\'s Home  Page.</p>\n<p>The Terms and Conditions that are mentioned herein regulate  the Website\'s usage. Any user of the  Website who violates any of the stipulations that are contained herein shall  render himself or herself liable to any appropriate action that is deemed necessary  in a court of both civil and criminal law.</p>\n<p>Jobsire and the Company are synonymous and can be used  interchangeably.<br />\n  <br />\n  The Website\'s users are subject to the <a href=\"http://www.jobsire.com/page.php?id=2\"><strong>Privacy Policy</strong></a> that can be accessed through  the link made available here.</p>\n<p>In case of any non-compliance of the Privacy Policy or the  Terms and Conditions, the Company reserves the right to terminate the usage  rights and withdraw any information uploaded by a user that is deemed  offensive.<br />\n  &nbsp;<br />\n  <strong>Job Seekers</strong>&nbsp;<strong>agree to these  following terms for using Jobsire or Jobsire Services/Resume Submission or  Posting/Resume Uploading/Resume Management by means of Registration of Resume  on the Website</strong>:-<br />\n  <br />\n  [Note: The insertion of the resume or any information submitted by a user could  be updated only by that particular user and it can be done without any charge].</p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n  <li>The Company does not       guarantee that there will necessarily be a satisfactory response once the       resume is inserted or any information is submitted by a user.</li>\n  <li>The Company does not offer       any warranty about the bonafide status or credentials of the organisation       or prospective employer that downloads the submission of the resume or       information and uses it to get in touch with the user.</li>\n  <li>The Company cannot be held       liable for any loss of technical data or otherwise or of the submission of       resume or information supplied by a user as a result of force majeure or       acts of God as well as those reasons that are beyond human control such as       delay, failure to perform or corruption of information but not limited to       riots, government policies, strikes, civil unrest or tampering of       information by persons who are unauthorized such as hackers, natural       calamities, war, virus attacks or distributed denial of service attacks.</li>\n  <li>It is the sole       responsibility of the user to check the genuineness of all responses       received after the submission of resume or information into the Company\'s       system of network by him or her when going out of station for any       interview or a job. The Company will disclaim all liabilities for acts,       deeds or things which a user may do post receipt of the response to the       resume or information that was fed into the Company\'s network system.</li>\n  <li>When a job seeker uploads       multiple resumes beyond a limit that is deemed reasonable after using same       or different accounts, the Company is entitled to remove that candidate\'s       resume without any notice. It has to be understood that this service is       provided only for those candidates who are seeking suitable jobs. Any       commercial use of the Website is strictly forbidden.</li>\n  <li>The Company has the right       to delete and reject any submission of a resume or information that is       supplied by a user without the need of supplying any reasons for doing       that.</li>\n  <li>This service is provided       free of charge and it gives the right to the candidate to modify, add or       make changes to the information or data that is supplied by him or her but       at the same time, the candidate is not entitled to use this free service       to submit resume or information pertaining to any other person.</li>\n  <li>The Company holds the right       to edit or modify a particular resume to make it fit in the database.</li>\n  <li>The subscriber is given a       password by the Company to allow him or her to access information that is       received through the Website. The responsibility of maintaining safe       custody of that password rests with the subscriber. The Company will not       be held responsible for loss, theft or corruption of data or for the       misuse of password resulting in leakage or damage to the information and       consequential usage by third parties.</li>\n  <li>It is the sole responsibility       of the candidate to make sure that he or she uses options of privacy       settings as deemed fit to refuse access of information that is fed to       corporate entities, consultants or individuals. The Company cannot be held       liable for such data or information being accessed by users whose access       has not been blocked specifically while using these privacy settings.</li>\n  <li>The user has to remember       that despite his or her profile being not searchable by default, a Jobsire       Recruiter profile will help him or her view the snapshot of his or her       profile when logged into the account.</li>\n  <li>Despite privacy settings,       the Company cannot be held responsible for a resume being viewed by any       blocked user for any particular reason. It is recommended that a user does       not allow his or her resume to be accessible or searchable by all in order       to maintain best privacy settings.</li>\n  <li>The user confirms that he       or she is not a minor and is not under any legal disability or otherwise       that may restrict his or her ability to comply with the Company\'s Terms       and Conditions or to install and employ the services that can be purchased       and subscribed to with minimal risk of harm to others. The user also       confirms that he or she is not buying the products or services for the       purpose of resale to others without the prior permission of the Company.</li>\n  <li>Changes or modifications       that are done by the user to the information shall take effect and come       into force after forty eight hours of such changes being made.</li>\n  <li>Once the registration is       done, the candidate agrees to make his or her resume searchable to all       registered clients of Jobsire who subscribe to the Company\'s services.       Candidates may be contacted by these subscribers of Jobsire through email       or via chat or telephone services. If a candidate wishes to modify this       particular setting and become non-searchable, he or she may reset the       Privacy Settings in the resume section. It is recommended that the       candidates read the privacy settings section carefully. The Company shall       not be held responsible for mails received by them.</li>\n  <li>User agreement between the       Company and the subscriber or candidate will be terminated on completion       of a term for which the user subscribes or when he or she violates any of       the terms and conditions of the agreement. The agreement can also be terminated       if both parties agree to such termination, mutually, in writing.</li>\n  <li>User of services cannot       claim copyright or any intellectual property rights over the data that is       uploaded by him or her on the Website.</li>\n  <li>Jurisdiction for all       disputes that may arise is Hyderabad in India and this is to exclusion of       all the other courts.</li>\n  <li>Disputes will be resolved       as per the laws that govern India.</li>\n</ul>', '<p>The website, <a href=\"http://www.jobsire.com\">www.jobsire.com</a> (hereinafter, this address will be known as the \'Website\'), remains a public  domain URL that offers free access to people. Jobsire (hereinafter will be  known as \'the Company\') shall bear no liability for the authenticity or the  quality of the responses. The Company is not in a position to monitor all the  responses which an individual shall receive as a response to any information  that a particular person has displayed or used on the website. The job seeker  and the employer have to perform individual background checks on the genuine  nature of a response or responses.</p>\n<p>The Company shall not be held responsible for the accuracy  of information provided on the Website. The visitor has to take up  responsibility to do further research on specific information on this Website.  Any breach of information that is given by a consumer to this Company and which  is placed on this Website through technical or other means cannot be deemed as  the Company\'s responsibility. The same will apply to any breach of privacy. The  Company will not be able to provide any guarantees about the privacy of any  information that is provided by an individual who is using or acquiring the  information which is displayed on this Website or other websites and domains  that are under the ownership or operation of the Company.</p>\n<p>The Company will not be able to share any data that is  personally identifiable, of any job seeker or candidate, with any other entity  or company without seeking prior permission except in the case of those  individuals who are acting as the Company\'s agents. The company will divulge  such information that is under its possession as a response to legal processes  such as a subpoena or a court order. Users of such information will not use the  services which are offered by the Company or this Website in a manner that has  a negative impact on the functioning or the interests of the Website or the  Company. Users will also have to undertake responsibility of not duplicating,  downloading, publishing, modifying or distributing any material on this Website  unless it has been authorized specifically by this Company to do so. The job  seeker will also undertake responsibility that he or she will not establish any  connections or links to a specific page of this Website except to the Home  Page, without seeking the prior permission of the Company.</p>\n<p>The candidate will undertake usage of the Website for his or  her individual purposes alone. Use of content from this Website for the purpose  of plagiarism with commercial motives, without seeking prior consent from the  Company, will be strictly forbidden.</p>\n<p>The Website employs technological methods to exclude items  like robots from crawling over or exploring its content in order to scrape it.  The candidate will have to undertake responsibility of not circumventing such  means.</p>\n<p>Job seekers will also have to undertake responsibility that  all services that are offered by the Company or the Website will not be used to  post, upload or transit through email or by any other means available to them  either indirectly or directly. They also have to undertake that they will not  make available any bulk or commercial email that is unsolicited. The Company holds  the privilege to block, filter and monitor all emails which are sent by a job  seeker who is using the servers being maintained by this Company for the  purpose of relaying emails. The candidate and the Company have to abide by the  rules set forward by the International Best Practices towards containment and  the elimination of Spam.</p>\n<p>Users also undertake not to spam the database that is being  maintained by the Company or the Website. They also undertake responsibility  not to forward mail repeatedly or indiscriminately which may be considered as  spam. Any user conduct that violates this particular clause will make the  Company eligible to terminate services forthwith to that particular user,  without giving any notice to him or her.<br />\n  <br />\n  The user is not allowed to post, upload, publish, transmit or distribute all  such information or material which is considered unlawful or that may be viewed  potentially as being threatening, harassing, harmful, defamatory, abusive,  vulgar, libelous, obscene or otherwise ethnically or racially objectionable.<br />\n  <br />\n  The user has to state explicitly that the resume or the submission of  information being supplied into the Company\'s network is complete and correct  in all regards and that it does not involve any distorted, fraudulent, false, manipulated  or misleading averments or facts. The Company also shall explicitly disclaim  all liability that may arise from this particular resume or submission of  information that is supplied into its network by the job seeker. Additionally,  the candidate or the user has to agree to indemnify all possible losses that  the Company may incur as a result of distorted, defamatory, false, manipulated,  vulgar, libelous, fraudulent, obscene or misleading facts or averments that are  made objectionably by him or her on the Company\'s network.</p>\n<p><strong>Protection of the  User Account</strong><br />\n  <br />\n  The user shall take sole responsibility for the maintenance of the privacy of  the password and identification details of the User. The user shall also be  responsible for maintenance of confidentiality of all transmission and  activities that are performed by him or her through the process of  identification. The user shall also take up responsibility of carrying out  online or offlin