ting in damage or leakage of information       with consequential misuse by third parties. The Company shall exercise all       reasonable precautions from its side to make sure that there is no misuse       or leakage of the password or passwords created by the recruiter or the       user.</li>\n  <li>The Company shall not be       held responsible for any information which is received by users and it       will be the sole responsibility of users to check, verify and then       authenticate the response or information which is received at their own       expense.</li>\n  <li>The user has to declare       that he or she is not of minor age and is not under any legal restriction       or disability that limits the ability to comply with the Terms and       Conditions applicable herein or to use and install the services which are       purchased and subscribed for with minimal risk to others.</li>\n  <li>All necessary       modifications or changes done by the user to the information shall come       into effect only after forty eight hours of the changes being made.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>User Registration</strong></p>\n<p>On registration, the user agrees to:-</p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n  <li>Make his or her profile       available so that it could be displayed in the public domain.</li>\n  <li>Understand that when he or       she posts a job on <a href=\"http://www.jobsire.com\">www.jobsire.com</a> or       sends an email to job seekers through this Website, a screenshot of the       user\'s public profile on Jobsire Recruiter profile will get inserted       automatically into the mail or post (applies to new job or existing listings       on Jobsire).</li>\n  <li>Seek authority to upload       job listings which are posted through profiles created by the user in this       Website section of Jobsire Recruiter profile.</li>\n  <li>Understand that the       Website may publish information concerning vacancies posted by the user       through the Website of the Company in any of its classified account       sections or on such other parallel or mirror sites or in affiliated       publications as the Company may deem proper and suitable.</li>\n  <li>Jurisdiction for any       dispute that may arise from and related to contest of the terms and       conditions for employers and recruiters shall be Hyderabad in India, to       the exclusion of all the other courts in India.</li>\n  <li>Disputes will be settled       as per Indian laws.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Anti Spam Policy</strong></p>\n<p>Use of the Website database and its access is controlled by  this policy. Services that are provided are focused at offering recruitment  solutions and they have to be limited towards getting in touch with suitable  candidates for authentic jobs that exist.</p>\n<p>Mailing practices that involve transmitting promotional and  marketing mailers, misleading messages with subject lines meant to conceal the  original message and offensive messages are prohibited strictly.</p>\n<p>The Company holds the right to suspend services to users  that originate Spam, without giving any prior notice. There will be no refund  admissible in these circumstances.</p>\n<p>This is an explicatory list of the types of messages that  can be categorized as Spam:-</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>Commercial communication that is unsolicited. </li>\n  <li>Bulk messages that are not solicited. </li>\n  <li>Voice calls and chats to those telephone numbers  which are registered on the National Consumer Preference Register. </li>\n  <li>Mails that are not related to jobs. </li>\n  <li>Messages that have misleading or confusing  subject lines. </li>\n  <li>Blank messages. </li>\n  <li>Unreasonably high volume of mails. </li>\n  <li>Mails that solicit payments. </li>\n  <li>Fraudulent mails. </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Users explicitly agree to indemnify the Company and hold it  harmless along with its employees, directors, officers and agents from any  claims, actions, damages or demands that may include without restriction of  reasonable accounting and legal fees that may arise out of usage of the  accounts in relation to transmission of Spam.</p>\n<p>It is recommended that the users change their passwords on a  frequent basis so that the risk of misuse of their accounts is reduced.</p>\n<p>For more information and for the purpose of reporting Spam,  you may kindly email us at <a href=\"mailto:abuse@jobsire.com\">abuse@jobsire.com</a>. </p>\n<p><strong>Profile Packs</strong></p>\n<ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>The profile packs of       candidates cannot be exchanged for any other Jobsire products or the amount       involved cannot be refunded for them once they are bought.</li>\n  <li>The profile packs of       candidates cannot get clubbed with other Jobsire products.</li>\n  <li>Insta Recruit from Jobsire       can be used only when a recruiter has a live subscription to Jobsire. In       case of this subscription getting expired, the recruiter will not be able       to send CHAT until the Jobsire contract is renewed, even in the case of       the recruiter being left with balance chats in his or her account.</li>\n  <li>Chats that have not been       used will remain with a recruiter and he or she can use these chats when       the subscription gets renewed.</li>\n  <li>Recruiters will be able to       chat only with those job seekers on a particular search page that shows up       after a search is conducted.</li>\n  <li>A minimum number of a       thousand chats have to be bought at one time and in multiples of       thousands, thereof, subsequently.</li>\n  <li>Recruiters have to try and       make sure that chats are being sent only to relevant candidates at all       times in order to attain maximum response.</li>\n  <li>The Company holds the       right to scan all material or content that is being dispatched on chat and       block those chats where any Spam material is detected or information is       found that is not pertaining to recruitment.</li>\n  <li>The Company has the right       to have the number of chats regulated if they are being sent out to a       specific profile on a particular day. This is towards protection of       consumer interests in case of that consumer getting Spam messages by a       recruiter.</li>\n  <li>The Company will do its       best in delivering all chats that are sent out; however, it shall not take       up responsibility for those chats that are not delivered. This could be as       a result of some telephones being out of order or due to problems of       operator network and SIM cards not being used any more. The Company does       take up the responsibility of chats leaving the chat gateway of the       vendor.</li>\n  <li>The Company reserves the       right to withdraw, terminate or change the scale and the scope of its       services at any given point of time without assigning any reason for that.</li>\n  <li>Chats that are sent after       1900 hours in the evening will be lined up in the Company system and they       will be delivered to the job seekers after 0800 IST on the next morning       and this will be in compliance with the existing telecom regulations.</li>\n  <li>Service will be made       available across all operators within India.</li>\n  <li>For candidates who reply       to the chats, VAS rates would apply as they are levied by respective       operators. For more details, respective mobile operators could be       contacted.</li>\n</ol>\n\n<p>Note: The terms contained in this agreement may be altered  by the Company at any given point of time. The Company is entitled to provide  its services to any prospective client and this applies without any  restriction.</p>\n<p>User of this website will be subject to Jobsire\'s <a href=\"http://www.jobsire.com/page.php?id=2\">Privacy Policy</a> that is accessible by way of  this link.</p>', 'S', 'Y');
INSERT INTO `saticpages` (`id`, `title`, `metatag`, `metakeyword`, `pagename`, `content`, `us_content`, `pagetype`, `status`) VALUES
(21, 'Employer Agreement', 'Employer Agreement Metatag', 'Employer Agreement Keyword', 'Employer Agreement', '<div style=\"margin:0px; padding:0px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px;\">\n<ol>\n<li>Jobsire (hereinafter will be referred to as `the Company&rsquo;) agrees to offer services to the users or subscribers alone for the period contracted in the agreement to the best possible extent.</li>\n<li>The Company is entitled to terminate or suspend the services that have been contracted for by a subscriber either before or during the period contracted without the need for giving any reasons whatsoever in such situations. Amount that has been paid by a subscriber will be refunded by the Company. This will be done on a pro-rata basis and is solely at the discretion of the Company.</li>\n<li>The subscriber can avail of one username and password to gain access to the website of <a href=\"http://www.jobsire.com/\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">www.jobsire.com</font></a> (hereinafter referred to as `the Website&rsquo;). Additional usernames and passwords may be agreed upon mutually between the Company and the subscriber.</li>\n<li>The Company shall offer no warranty about satisfactory responses to the subscriber in connection with all the applications that are received when he or she uses the Website.</li>\n<li>The Company will not be held liable in any way for information that is received by a user and it will be the responsibility of the user to check and authenticate after verifying the response or information that is received. This will be done at the expense of the user.</li>\n<li>Any action that is taken by the employer or the recruiter, in connection with background check reports or otherwise, is the sole responsibility of that employer alone and the Company shall not be held responsible for the results of such actions.</li>\n<li>The Company will not be held responsible for any loss of information supplied by users that is technical or otherwise on account of reasons that may be beyond the control of the Company such as corruption of information or delay or performance failure but not limited to riots, government policies, strike, civil unrest, tampering of information by third parties such as hackers or unauthorised persons, natural calamities, war, cancel bots, viruses, computer program routines, Trojan horses, back doors, trap doors, worms and Easter eggs that are meant to damage or interfere detrimentally with the network system or personal information on the Website. The Company is not responsible for both direct and indirect consequential damages and loss of profit and reputation even when advised thereof concerning the possibility of such losses.</li>\n<li>The Company shall start providing its services only when it receives the charges from the subscriber, upfront or from third parties on behalf of the user.</li>\n<li>The Company shall design or create the package. However, the logo, text and pictures for the content on the Website will have to be provided by the candidate or the user.</li>\n<li>The job seeker or the subscriber shall represent and assure that the information which is provided by him or her in terms of the agreement for posting or uploading will not contain any viruses, trap doors or other computer program routines which are meant to damage or interfere detrimentally with the network system on the Website. In the event of such detection, the Company reserves the right to terminate the Agreement ab initio. The consideration exchanged on the Agreement will be forfeited and the Company is also entitled to take necessary legal action, if deemed appropriate.</li>\n<li>The recruiter has to undertake to the Company that the jobs that are sought and filled through the Website are genuine and in existence. The subscriber is authorised to advertise or recruit for these vacancies. The user has to undertake that the database will be employed to get in touch with the job seekers for the purpose of filling up these vacancies and jobs. The recruiter shall also make sure that they comply with all laws that are applicable for protection of personal information and details of users as he or she accesses their profiles through the Website including but not being limited<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>to compliance with the Telecom Commercial Communications Customer Preference Regulations of 2010 along with other regulations, bye laws, guidelines and notifications that have been made there under while accessing submissions of resumes or information into the computer networks or the computer systems belonging to the Company.</li>\n<li>The Company is entitled to change the design, feel, look, depiction, prominence or the classification of any portion of the Website at any given time, without giving any reasons or notice for doing so.</li>\n<li>The recruiter or the subscriber has to give the Company an undertaking that there will be no fees charged from job seekers who are contacted through this Website for the purpose of processing details for such candidates.</li>\n<li>This subscription is not transferable or re-saleable by the recruiter or the subscriber to a third party, firm, corporate body or an individual concern.</li>\n<li>The subscriber will get a password or passwords by the Company to allow him or her to gain access to the information that is received through software but the safe custody of the password will be the responsibility of that subscriber and the Company will not be held liable in any way for loss, theft, corruption or misuse of data or password that results in leakage or damage to the information or consequential use by third parties. The Company shall undertake to carry out all appropriate precautions to make sure that there is no misuse of the password that has been granted to a subscriber.</li>\n<li>The information provided on the Company&rsquo;s Website is solely for use by the subscribers and it does not authorise these subscribers to use or download the data for any commercial purpose. If a subscriber is found to be violating this clause, the Company may suspend the services of that subscriber at its discretion and may also take necessary legal action, if required.</li>\n<li>The recruiter or subscriber is not allowed to use or circulate or forward a job seeker&rsquo;s resume which is hosted on Jobsire&rsquo;s network to the candidate&rsquo;s current employer by taking the information from that candidate&rsquo;s resume.</li>\n<li>User of the services provided by the Company shall not have any claim of copyright or intellectual property rights over information or data that is uploaded by him or her on the Website or submitted to the Company.</li>\n<li>Any dispute that is arising out of transactions between users and the Company shall be settled as per the laws applicable in India.</li>\n<li>All disputes that result from the transactions between users and the Company are subject to the Courts&rsquo; jurisdiction situated in Hyderabad alone.</li>\n<li >User shall consent to indemnify the Company, its directors, officers, agents and employees from and against any actions, claims or demands that include without being restricted to reasonable accounting and legal fees that result from breach of this Agreement or representation breach. The user also provides a warranty as contemplated in this Agreement or from any of its provision of material to the Website. This includes but is not limited to breach claims of third party rights that involve intellectual property rights or breach of provisions of any particular law that are currently in force.<br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><strong>Best Practices for an Employer or Recruiter</font></strong></p>\n<ol>\n  <li>Jobsire Recruiter profile may be edited or updated by the recruiter or the user alone. He or she shall not post, distribute, upload, transmit or publish any information or material which is unlawful or which may have potential of being threatening, harmful, harassing, defamatory, abusive, vulgar, libelous, obscene, racially or ethnically objectionable.</li>\n<li>The Company reserves the right to remove a profile without giving notice to a subscriber if he or she is found uploading multiple profiles while using same or separate accounts.</li>\n<li>The Company has the right to delete or reject any profile or information within that profile that is submitted by a user, without giving any reason to the user.</li>\n<li>The user has sole responsibility for providing safe custody of all login details; the Company will not be responsible for any loss, theft, corruption or misuse of data or the password, resulting in damage or leakage of information with consequential misuse by third parties. The Company shall exercise all reasonable precautions from its side to make sure that there is no misuse or leakage of the password or passwords created by the recruiter or the user.</li>\n<li>The Company shall not be held responsible for any information which is received by users and it will be the sole responsibility of users to check, verify and then authenticate the response or information which is received at their own expense.</li>\n<li>The user has to declare that he or she is not of minor age and is not under any legal restriction or disability that limits the ability to comply with the Terms and Conditions applicable herein or to use and install the services which are purchased and subscribed for with minimal risk to others.</li>\n<li>All necessary modifications or changes done by the user to the information shall come into effect only after forty eight hours of the changes being made.</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><strong>User Registration</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\">On registration, the user agrees to:-<br>\n</p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\n	<li>Make his or her profile available so that it could be displayed in the public domain.</li>\n	<li>Understand that when he or she posts a job on <a href=\"http://www.jobsire.com/\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">www.jobsire.com</font></a> or sends an email to job seekers through this Website, a screenshot of the user&rsquo;s public profile on Jobsire Recruiter profile will get inserted automatically into the mail or post (applies to new job or existing listings on Jobsire).</li>\n	<li>Seek authority to upload job listings which are posted through profiles created by the user in this Website section of Jobsire Recruiter profile.</li>\n	<li>Understand that the Website may publish information concerning vacancies posted by the user through the Website of the Company in any of its classified account sections or on such other parallel or mirror sites or in affiliated publications as the Company may deem proper and suitable.</li>\n	<li>Jurisdiction for any dispute that may arise from and related to contest of the terms and conditions for employers and recruiters shall be Hyderabad in India, to the exclusion of all the other courts in India.</li>\n	<li>Disputes will be settled as per Indian laws.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Anti Spam Policy</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\">Use of the Website database and its access is controlled by this policy. Services that are provided are focused at offering recruitment solutions and they have to be limited towards getting in touch with suitable candidates for authentic jobs that exist.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><br>\nMailing practices that involve transmitting promotional and marketing mailers, misleading messages with subject lines meant to conceal the original message and offensive messages are prohibited strictly.<br>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\">The Company holds the right to suspend services to users that originate Spam, without giving any prior notice. There will be no refund admissible in these circumstances.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><br>\nThis is an explicatory list of the types of messages that can be categorized as Spam:-</p>\n<ol>\n  	<li>Commercial communication that is unsolicited.</li>\n    <li>Bulk messages that are not solicited.</li>\n    <li>Voice calls and chats to those telephone numbers which are registered on the National Consumer Preference Register.</li>\n    <li>Mails that are not related to jobs.</li>\n    <li>Messages that have misleading or confusing subject lines.</li>\n    <li>Blank messages.</li>\n    <li>Unreasonably high volume of mails.</li>\n    <li>Mails that solicit payments.</li>\n    <li>Fraudulent mails.\n</li></ol>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><font>Users explicitly agree to indemnify the Company and hold it harmless along with its employees, directors, officers and agents from any claims, actions, damages or demands that may include without restriction of reasonable accounting and legal fees that may arise out of usage of the accounts in relation to transmission of Spam.<br>\n</font></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><font>It is recommended that the users change their passwords on a frequent basis so that the risk of misuse of their accounts is reduced.</font></p>\n<p><font>For more information and for the purpose of reporting Spam, you may kindly email us at </font><a><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">abuse@jobsire.com</font></a><font>. </font></p>\n<p><strong><font style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Profile Packs</font></strong></p>\n<ol>\n  <li>The profile packs of candidates cannot be exchanged for any other Jobsire products or the amount involved cannot be refunded for them once they are bought.</li>\n<li>The profile packs of candidates cannot get clubbed with other Jobsire products.</li>\n<li>Insta Recruit from Jobsire can be used only when a recruiter has a live subscription to Jobsire. In case of this subscription getting expired, the recruiter will not be able to send CHAT until the Jobsire contract is renewed, even in the case of the recruiter being left with balance chats in his or her account.</li>\n<li>Chats that have not been used will remain with a recruiter and he or she can use these chats when the subscription gets renewed.</li>\n<li>Recruiters will be able to chat only with those job seekers on a particular search page that shows up after a search is conducted.</li>\n<li>A minimum number of a thousand chats have to be bought at one time and in multiples of thousands, thereof, subsequently.</li>\n<li>Recruiters have to try and make sure that chats are being sent only to relevant candidates at all times in order to attain maximum response.</li>\n<li>The Company holds the right to scan all material or content that is being dispatched on chat and block those chats where any Spam material is detected or information is found that is not pertaining to recruitment.</li>\n<li>The Company has the right to have the number of chats regulated if they are being sent out to a specific profile on a particular day. This is towards protection of consumer interests in case of that consumer getting Spam messages by a recruiter.</li>\n<li>The Company will do its best in delivering all chats that are sent out; however, it shall not take up responsibility for those chats that are not delivered. This could be as a result of some telephones being out of order or due to problems of operator network and SIM cards not being used any more. The Company does take up the responsibility of chats leaving the chat gateway of the vendor.</li>\n<li>The Company reserves the right to withdraw, terminate or change the scale and the scope of its services at any given point of time without assigning any reason for that.</li>\n<li>Chats that are sent after 1900 hours in the evening will be lined up in the Company system and they will be delivered to the job seekers after 0800 IST on the next morning and this will be in compliance with the existing telecom regulations.</li>\n<li>Service will be made available across all operators within India.</li>\n<li>For candidates who reply to the chats, VAS rates would apply as they are levied by respective operators. For more details, respective mobile operators could be contacted.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Note: The terms contained in this agreement may be altered by the Company at any given point of time. The Company is entitled to provide its services to any prospective client and this applies without any restriction.</p>\n<p>User of this website will be subject to Jobsire&rsquo;s Privacy Policy that is accessible by way of this link. &nbsp;</p>\n</div>', '<div style=\"margin:0px; padding:0px; font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:12px;\">\n<ol>\n<li>Jobsire (hereinafter will be referred to as `the Company&rsquo;) agrees to offer services to the users or subscribers alone for the period contracted in the agreement to the best possible extent.</li>\n<li>The Company is entitled to terminate or suspend the services that have been contracted for by a subscriber either before or during the period contracted without the need for giving any reasons whatsoever in such situations. Amount that has been paid by a subscriber will be refunded by the Company. This will be done on a pro-rata basis and is solely at the discretion of the Company.</li>\n<li>The subscriber can avail of one username and password to gain access to the website of <a href=\"http://www.jobsire.com/\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">www.jobsire.com</font></a> (hereinafter referred to as `the Website&rsquo;). Additional usernames and passwords may be agreed upon mutually between the Company and the subscriber.</li>\n<li>The Company shall offer no warranty about satisfactory responses to the subscriber in connection with all the applications that are received when he or she uses the Website.</li>\n<li>The Company will not be held liable in any way for information that is received by a user and it will be the responsibility of the user to check and authenticate after verifying the response or information that is received. This will be done at the expense of the user.</li>\n<li>Any action that is taken by the employer or the recruiter, in connection with background check reports or otherwise, is the sole responsibility of that employer alone and the Company shall not be held responsible for the results of such actions.</li>\n<li>The Company will not be held responsible for any loss of information supplied by users that is technical or otherwise on account of reasons that may be beyond the control of the Company such as corruption of information or delay or performance failure but not limited to riots, government policies, strike, civil unrest, tampering of information by third parties such as hackers or unauthorised persons, natural calamities, war, cancel bots, viruses, computer program routines, Trojan horses, back doors, trap doors, worms and Easter eggs that are meant to damage or interfere detrimentally with the network system or personal information on the Website. The Company is not responsible for both direct and indirect consequential damages and loss of profit and reputation even when advised thereof concerning the possibility of such losses.</li>\n<li>The Company shall start providing its services only when it receives the charges from the subscriber, upfront or from third parties on behalf of the user.</li>\n<li>The Company shall design or create the package. However, the logo, text and pictures for the content on the Website will have to be provided by the candidate or the user.</li>\n<li>The job seeker or the subscriber shall represent and assure that the information which is provided by him or her in terms of the agreement for posting or uploading will not contain any viruses, trap doors or other computer program routines which are meant to damage or interfere detrimentally with the network system on the Website. In the event of such detection, the Company reserves the right to terminate the Agreement ab initio. The consideration exchanged on the Agreement will be forfeited and the Company is also entitled to take necessary legal action, if deemed appropriate.</li>\n<li>The recruiter has to undertake to the Company that the jobs that are sought and filled through the Website are genuine and in existence. The subscriber is authorised to advertise or recruit for these vacancies. The user has to undertake that the database will be employed to get in touch with the job seekers for the purpose of filling up these vacancies and jobs. The recruiter shall also make sure that they comply with all laws that are applicable for protection of personal information and details of users as he or she accesses their profiles through the Website including but not being limited<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>to compliance with the Telecom Commercial Communications Customer Preference Regulations of 2010 along with other regulations, bye laws, guidelines and notifications that have been made there under while accessing submissions of resumes or information into the computer networks or the computer systems belonging to the Company.</li>\n<li>The Company is entitled to change the design, feel, look, depiction, prominence or the classification of any portion of the Website at any given time, without giving any reasons or notice for doing so.</li>\n<li>The recruiter or the subscriber has to give the Company an undertaking that there will be no fees charged from job seekers who are contacted through this Website for the purpose of processing details for such candidates.</li>\n<li>This subscription is not transferable or re-saleable by the recruiter or the subscriber to a third party, firm, corporate body or an individual concern.</li>\n<li>The subscriber will get a password or passwords by the Company to allow him or her to gain access to the information that is received through software but the safe custody of the password will be the responsibility of that subscriber and the Company will not be held liable in any way for loss, theft, corruption or misuse of data or password that results in leakage or damage to the information or consequential use by third parties. The Company shall undertake to carry out all appropriate precautions to make sure that there is no misuse of the password that has been granted to a subscriber.</li>\n<li>The information provided on the Company&rsquo;s Website is solely for use by the subscribers and it does not authorise these subscribers to use or download the data for any commercial purpose. If a subscriber is found to be violating this clause, the Company may suspend the services of that subscriber at its discretion and may also take necessary legal action, if required.</li>\n<li>The recruiter or subscriber is not allowed to use or circulate or forward a job seeker&rsquo;s resume which is hosted on Jobsire&rsquo;s network to the candidate&rsquo;s current employer by taking the information from that candidate&rsquo;s resume.</li>\n<li>User of the services provided by the Company shall not have any claim of copyright or intellectual property rights over information or data that is uploaded by him or her on the Website or submitted to the Company.</li>\n<li>Any dispute that is arising out of transactions between users and the Company shall be settled as per the laws applicable in India.</li>\n<li>All disputes that result from the transactions between users and the Company are subject to the Courts&rsquo; jurisdiction situated in Hyderabad alone.</li>\n<li >User shall consent to indemnify the Company, its directors, officers, agents and employees from and against any actions, claims or demands that include without being restricted to reasonable accounting and legal fees that result from breach of this Agreement or representation breach. The user also provides a warranty as contemplated in this Agreement or from any of its provision of material to the Website. This includes but is not limited to breach claims of third party rights that involve intellectual property rights or breach of provisions of any particular law that are currently in force.<br>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><strong>Best Practices for an Employer or Recruiter</font></strong></p>\n<ol>\n  <li>Jobsire Recruiter profile may be edited or updated by the recruiter or the user alone. He or she shall not post, distribute, upload, transmit or publish any information or material which is unlawful or which may have potential of being threatening, harmful, harassing, defamatory, abusive, vulgar, libelous, obscene, racially or ethnically objectionable.</li>\n<li>The Company reserves the right to remove a profile without giving notice to a subscriber if he or she is found uploading multiple profiles while using same or separate accounts.</li>\n<li>The Company has the right to delete or reject any profile or information within that profile that is submitted by a user, without giving any reason to the user.</li>\n<li>The user has sole responsibility for providing safe custody of all login details; the Company will not be responsible for any loss, theft, corruption or misuse of data or the password, resulting in damage or leakage of information with consequential misuse by third parties. The Company shall exercise all reasonable precautions from its side to make sure that there is no misuse or leakage of the password or passwords created by the recruiter or the user.</li>\n<li>The Company shall not be held responsible for any information which is received by users and it will be the sole responsibility of users to check, verify and then authenticate the response or information which is received at their own expense.</li>\n<li>The user has to declare that he or she is not of minor age and is not under any legal restriction or disability that limits the ability to comply with the Terms and Conditions applicable herein or to use and install the services which are purchased and subscribed for with minimal risk to others.</li>\n<li>All necessary modifications or changes done by the user to the information shall come into effect only after forty eight hours of the changes being made.</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><strong>User Registration</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\">On registration, the user agrees to:-<br>\n</p>\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0in;\" type=\"disc\">\n	<li>Make his or her profile available so that it could be displayed in the public domain.</li>\n	<li>Understand that when he or she posts a job on <a href=\"http://www.jobsire.com/\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">www.jobsire.com</font></a> or sends an email to job seekers through this Website, a screenshot of the user&rsquo;s public profile on Jobsire Recruiter profile will get inserted automatically into the mail or post (applies to new job or existing listings on Jobsire).</li>\n	<li>Seek authority to upload job listings which are posted through profiles created by the user in this Website section of Jobsire Recruiter profile.</li>\n	<li>Understand that the Website may publish information concerning vacancies posted by the user through the Website of the Company in any of its classified account sections or on such other parallel or mirror sites or in affiliated publications as the Company may deem proper and suitable.</li>\n	<li>Jurisdiction for any dispute that may arise from and related to contest of the terms and conditions for employers and recruiters shall be Hyderabad in India, to the exclusion of all the other courts in India.</li>\n	<li>Disputes will be settled as per Indian laws.</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Anti Spam Policy</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\">Use of the Website database and its access is controlled by this policy. Services that are provided are focused at offering recruitment solutions and they have to be limited towards getting in touch with suitable candidates for authentic jobs that exist.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><br>\nMailing practices that involve transmitting promotional and marketing mailers, misleading messages with subject lines meant to conceal the original message and offensive messages are prohibited strictly.<br>\n</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\">The Company holds the right to suspend services to users that originate Spam, without giving any prior notice. There will be no refund admissible in these circumstances.</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><br>\nThis is an explicatory list of the types of messages that can be categorized as Spam:-</p>\n<ol>\n  	<li>Commercial communication that is unsolicited.</li>\n    <li>Bulk messages that are not solicited.</li>\n    <li>Voice calls and chats to those telephone numbers which are registered on the National Consumer Preference Register.</li>\n    <li>Mails that are not related to jobs.</li>\n    <li>Messages that have misleading or confusing subject lines.</li>\n    <li>Blank messages.</li>\n    <li>Unreasonably high volume of mails.</li>\n    <li>Mails that solicit payments.</li>\n    <li>Fraudulent mails.\n</li></ol>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><font>Users explicitly agree to indemnify the Company and hold it harmless along with its employees, directors, officers and agents from any claims, actions, damages or demands that may include without restriction of reasonable accounting and legal fees that may arise out of usage of the accounts in relation to transmission of Spam.<br>\n</font></p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0in 0in 0pt;\"><font>It is recommended that the users change their passwords on a frequent basis so that the risk of misuse of their accounts is reduced.</font></p>\n<p><font>For more information and for the purpose of reporting Spam, you may kindly email us at </font><a><font size=\"3\" face=\"Times New Roman\">abuse@jobsire.com</font></a><font>. </font></p>\n<p><strong><font style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\">Profile Packs</font></strong></p>\n<ol>\n  <li>The profile packs of candidates cannot be exchanged for any other Jobsire products or the amount involved cannot be refunded for them once they are bought.</li>\n<li>The profile packs of candidates cannot get clubbed with other Jobsire products.</li>\n<li>Insta Recruit from Jobsire can be used only when a recruiter has a live subscription to Jobsire. In case of this subscription getting expired, the recruiter will not be able to send CHAT until the Jobsire contract is renewed, even in the case of the recruiter being left with balance chats in his or her account.</li>\n<li>Chats that have not been used will remain with a recruiter and he or she can use these chats when the subscription gets renewed.</li>\n<li>Recruiters will be able to chat only with those job seekers on a particular search page that shows up after a search is conducted.</li>\n<li>A minimum number of a thousand chats have to be bought at one time and in multiples of thousands, thereof, subsequently.</li>\n<li>Recruiters have to try and make sure that chats are being sent only to relevant candidates at all times in order to attain maximum response.</li>\n<li>The Company holds the right to scan all material or content that is being dispatched on chat and block those chats where any Spam material is detected or information is found that is not pertaining to recruitment.</li>\n<li>The Company has the right to have the number of chats regulated if they are being sent out to a specific profile on a particular day. This is towards protection of consumer interests in case of that consumer getting Spam messages by a recruiter.</li>\n<li>The Company will do its best in delivering all chats that are sent out; however, it shall not take up responsibility for those chats that are not delivered. This could be as a result of some telephones being out of order or due to problems of operator network and SIM cards not being used any more. The Company does take up the responsibility of chats leaving the chat gateway of the vendor.</li>\n<li>The Company reserves the right to withdraw, terminate or change the scale and the scope of its services at any given point of time without assigning any reason for that.</li>\n<li>Chats that are sent after 1900 hours in the evening will be lined up in the Company system and they will be delivered to the job seekers after 0800 IST on the next morning and this will be in compliance with the existing telecom regulations.</li>\n<li>Service will be made available across all operators within India.</li>\n<li>For candidates who reply to the chats, VAS rates would apply as they are levied by respective operators. For more details, respective mobile operators could be contacted.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Note: The terms contained in this agreement may be altered by the Company at any given point of time. The Company is entitled to provide its services to any prospective client and this applies without any restriction.</p>\n<p>User of this website will be subject to Jobsire&rsquo;s Privacy Policy that is accessible by way of this link. &nbsp;</p>\n</div>', 'S', 'Y'),
(1, 'Company Profile | Jobsire', 'Company Profile', 'Jobsire Company Profile', 'Company Profile', '<p><strong>Our Vision</strong><br>\n  JobSire will be  the premiere online job service site, providing a one-stop shop for jobseekers  and employers seeking employment and services across a broad spectrum of  employment disciplines.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Our Mission</strong><br>\n  To facilitate our  vision, we are committed to providing a simple but robust employment platform  that enables jobseekers and those who need their skills to connect in a quick  and seamless manner.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Our Values</strong><br>\n  At JobSire, we  are committed to providing quality and reliable service to our clientele and  partners, as well as all site users. Our core values emphasize partnership,  integrity, focus, and a commitment to excellence. These things define us and  guide us as we do our jobs each and every day.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>BUSINESS FOCUS</strong><br>\n  At JobSire, our main focus each day is to ensure that we  provide real value for each of our clients and jobseekers. To accomplish that  goal, we work tirelessly to maintain a focused business strategy that properly  reflects our core values.<strong></strong><br>\n  <br>\n  From a strategic standpoint, we strive to maintain a  flexible approach that utilizes our vast experience in a way that best  facilitates our broader goals. That experience enables us to better understand  the varied business scenarios our clients bring to the platform, and  accommodate changing business requirements in the most transparent and  efficient way.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>OFFERED SERVICES</strong><br>\n  At JobSire, we have a number of different services  available, categorized as follows:<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Online Jobs Search </strong><br>\n  With our proprietary job search feature, jobseekers can  easily and quickly search for jobs online that match their unique skills. By  using the right keywords, they can quickly find the work they need in any job  discipline with just a couple of clicks.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Phone App </strong><br>\n  Communication between employers and jobseekers can be  critical for many projects. We facilitate that communication through the use of  our special Mobile App. This app, usable on either a smartphone or through the  web browser, enables employers and their hires to enjoy stress free chats and  ensure that no detail is left to chance.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>On-The-Spot-Connection </strong><br>\n  With our system, employers have the ability to reach out  directly to jobseekers as soon as any candidate applies for the project  position.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>MANAGEMENT</strong><br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Our Team</strong><br>\n  The JobSire team is comprised of a group of seasoned and  highly-trained professionals who are always prepared to go above and beyond  expectations in their efforts to help facilitate online job searches and  matches. We work tirelessly to ensure that jobseekers and employers are all on  the same page, and are motivated each day by a desire to grow with your  customers and provide them with the maximum level of satisfaction.<strong></strong><br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Our Clients</strong><br>\n  We are committed to developing and maintaining the strongest  possible relationships with each of our prospective clients, including  companies like:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>ICICI Bank </li>\n  <li>DLF Constructions</li>\n  <li>Cisco Systems</li>\n  <li>HSBC</li>\n  <li>TCS</li>\n  <li>Infosys</li>\n  <li>Cognizant</li>\n  <li>Bajaj Capital</li>\n  <li>Taj Group of Hotels</li>\n</ul>\n<p>With all of our clients, total satisfaction is always our  ultimate objective. To find out more about how JobSire can help you with your  hiring needs, contact us today.</p>', '<p><strong>Our Vision</strong><br>\n  JobSire will be  the premiere online job service site, providing a one-stop shop for jobseekers  and employers seeking employment and services across a broad spectrum of  employment disciplines.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Our Mission</strong><br>\n  To facilitate our  vision, we are committed to providing a simple but robust employment platform  that enables jobseekers and those who need their skills to connect in a quick  and seamless manner.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Our Values</strong><br>\n  At JobSire, we  are committed to providing quality and reliable service to our clientele and  partners, as well as all site users. Our core values emphasize partnership,  integrity, focus, and a commitment to excellence. These things define us and  guide us as we do our jobs each and every day.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>BUSINESS FOCUS</strong><br>\n  At JobSire, our main focus each day is to ensure that we  provide real value for each of our clients and jobseekers. To accomplish that  goal, we work tirelessly to maintain a focused business strategy that properly  reflects our core values.<strong></strong><br>\n  <br>\n  From a strategic standpoint, we strive to maintain a  flexible approach that utilizes our vast experience in a way that best  facilitates our broader goals. That experience enables us to better understand  the varied business scenarios our clients bring to the platform, and  accommodate changing business requirements in the most transparent and  efficient way.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>OFFERED SERVICES</strong><br>\n  At JobSire, we have a number of different services  available, categorized as follows:<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Online Jobs Search </strong><br>\n  With our proprietary job search feature, jobseekers can  easily and quickly search for jobs online that match their unique skills. By  using the right keywords, they can quickly find the work they need in any job  discipline with just a couple of clicks.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Phone App </strong><br>\n  Communication between employers and jobseekers can be  critical for many projects. We facilitate that communication through the use of  our special Mobile App. This app, usable on either a smartphone or through the  web browser, enables employers and their hires to enjoy stress free chats and  ensure that no detail is left to chance.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>On-The-Spot-Connection </strong><br>\n  With our system, employers have the ability to reach out  directly to jobseekers as soon as any candidate applies for the project  position.<br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>MANAGEMENT</strong><br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Our Team</strong><br>\n  The JobSire team is comprised of a group of seasoned and  highly-trained professionals who are always prepared to go above and beyond  expectations in their efforts to help facilitate online job searches and  matches. We work tirelessly to ensure that jobseekers and employers are all on  the same page, and are motivated each day by a desire to grow with your  customers and provide them with the maximum level of satisfaction.<strong></strong><br>\n  <br>\n  <strong>Our Clients</strong><br>\n  We are committed to developing and maintaining the strongest  possible relationships with each of our prospective clients, including  companies like:</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>ICICI Bank </li>\n  <li>DLF Constructions</li>\n  <li>Cisco Systems</li>\n  <li>HSBC</li>\n  <li>TCS</li>\n  <li>Infosys</li>\n  <li>Cognizant</li>\n  <li>Bajaj Capital</li>\n  <li>Taj Group of Hotels</li>\n</ul>\n<p>With all of our clients, total satisfaction is always our  ultimate objective. To find out more about how JobSire can help you with your  hiring needs, contact us today.</p>', 'S', 'Y'),
(5, 'About Us | Jobsire', 'Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetuer adipiscing elit. Aenean commodo ligula eget dolor. Aenean massa.', 'Cum sociis natoque penatibus et magnis dis parturient montes, nascetur ridiculus mus.', 'About Us', '<p class=\"p1\">JOBSIRE is better described as a multifaceted but highly interconnected and ranked online job services provider that would bridge the gap between employers and jobseekers.Â  Though, we are newly founded in US but with cognate experience backing us, we have successfully been delivering our services to meet our clients\' requisites with perfection.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">As a one-stop-shop for online job services, jobseekers and employersâ€™ needs; we are unequivocally poised to deploy technology and innovation in creating online job services of global repute that makes things easier for employers and jobseekers to seamlessly connect for all job requirements for any job whatsoever.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">With us at JOBSIRE, finding the right online jobs, jobseekers and employers is a task you can be rest assured we will handle; taking off the burden from you as we invariably remain an extension of your team.</p>', '<p class=\"p1\">JOBSIRE is better described as a multifaceted but highly interconnected and ranked online job services provider that would bridge the gap between employers and jobseekers.&nbsp; Though, we are newly founded in India but with cognate experience backing us, we have successfully been delivering our services to meet our clients\' requisites with perfection.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">As a one-stop-shop for online job services, jobseekers and employers&rsquo; needs; we are unequivocally poised to deploy technology and innovation in creating online job services of global repute that makes things easier for employers and jobseekers to seamlessly connect for all job requirements for any job whatsoever.</p>\n<p class=\"p1\">With us at JOBSIRE, finding the right online jobs, jobseekers and employers is a task you can be rest assured we will handle; taking off the burden from you as we invariably remain an extension of your team.</p>', 'S', 'Y');
